<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1SA" style="id">- WolioNT</book>
  <para style="ide">65001 - Unicode (UTF-8)</para>
  <para style="rem">Draft pertama October 2023 Ongen dan Sufiati, Draft Revisi September 2024, Revisi Terakhir Februari 2025, Cek Konsultan September 2025, Published Jan 2026.</para>
  <para style="h">1 SAMUEL</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Sam.</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Sam.</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 SAMUEL</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 SAMUEL</para>
  <para style="is">POGAU BHAA-BHAANA</para>
  <para style="im">
    <char style="bk">1 Samuel </char> akoantoaka tulatulana lipuna Israel minaaka i zamanina manga haakimu sakawana abholosia amembali zamanina raja-raja. I nuncana pobholosia sii, kadhaangiana lipuna Israel satotuuna apogauaka hususuna soo talu miamea: Nabii Samuel, Raja Saul tee Raja Daud. Apetulatulaaka dhadhina Daud wakutuuna dhaangiapo anaana umane tee indapo amembali raja, tee apokai mpuu tee tulatulana Samuel tee Saul.</para>
  <para style="ip">Boku-boku imatauta sii-sii mokojuduluna <char style="bk">1 SAMUEL </char> tee <char style="bk">2 SAMUEL </char> tee boku <char style="bk">1 MANGA RAJA </char> tee <char style="bk">2 MANGA RAJA </char> satotuuna saangu boku momaaratena tulatulana. Rampaakanamo kaaratena, boku incia sii apapogaaia amembali pata angu boku momampodho mamudhaakana inda laulauna amaarate wakutuuna aburia i karatasi i zamani i piamo itu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Boku <char style="bk">1 Samuel</char> sii apepuungia tee tulatulana Nabii Samuel momembalina haakimu kapadhaa mokapalaina Israel. Sapadhana incia sumai o boku incia sii apetulatulaakamo uka pokaiana tee Saul, raja mobhaa-bhaana. Saul inda ataʼati tee inda aose parintana Aulataʼala, sabutuna o Aulataʼala apaumba Samuel ande Incia bheapili mia mosagaanana molabhina kalapena minaaka i Saul to aparintaaka miana Israel. Aulataʼala alantimo mia ipilina sumai, siitumo Daud. Tulatulana boku incia sii aʼaahiria tee mateana Saul tee i wakutuuna kapadhaana pamarintana Saul aʼaahiria tee katalo tee kaeana inca.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kaadhari motofaraluuna mpuu i nuncana boku incia sii apokana mboomo tulatula mosagaanana modhaangiana i nuncana Pojanjia Mangenge, siitumo o mia bheasalaamati ande ataʼati i Aulataʼala, tee bheacilaka ande adorohaka. Giu incia sumai atinda mpuu i nuncana pasala <char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 2:30">2:30</ref></char> i wakutuuna o KAWASANA OPU apogau tee Imamu Eli, "Mohoromatiaku, bhekuhoromatia, maka mohinaaku bhekuhinaia."</para>
  <para style="ip">I nuncana boku incia sii ingkita takamata namisi moposala-sala pokaiana tee pakaroana pamarintana Israel. Inciamo KAWASANA OPU karona motoabhina momembalina rajana Israel, maka to alawaniaka kapeeluna raʼeati, Incia apili samia raja to manga incia. Giu mofaraluuna mpuu satotuuna malape o raja atawa o raʼeatina Israel adhadhi i tambena kuasana Aulataʼala, siitumo Haakimuna manga incia (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 2:7-10">2:7-10</ref></char>). I tambena manga hukumuna Aulataʼala, tabeana atojamini o hakuna bhari-bharia raʼeati malape o rangkaea atawa o misikini.</para>
  <para style="iot">Antona</para>
  <para style="io1">Nabii Samuel Amembali Kapalana Miana Israel <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 1:1-7:17">1:1--7:17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Saul Amembali Raja <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 8:1-10:27">8:1--10:27</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Saul Apepuu Aparinta Amembali Raja <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 11:1-15:35">11:1--15:35</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Daud tee Raja Saul <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 16:1-30:31">16:1--30:31</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Matena Raja Saul tee Manga Ana Umanena <char style="ior"><ref loc="1SA 31:1-13">31:1-13</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1SA 1" />
  <para style="s">Nabii Samuel Amembali Kapalana Miana Israel</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 1:1-7:17">1:1--7:17</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="s1">Elkana tee Witinaina i Silo</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 1:1-8">1:1-8</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 1:1" />Dhaangia samia umane minaaka i suku Efraim. Incia amboore i Kota Rama<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kota Rama: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Saro asiliina kota i aeati incia sii satotuuna o 'Ramataim Zofim,' maka roonamo i aeati mosagaanana o sarona kota incia sii atopekampodho tee soo atoburi 'Rama,' sabutuna i aeati incia sii soo apake saro mobiasana ipakena manga pande buri. </char></note> i weta i manga Gununa Efraim mokosaroakana Elkana bin Yeroham bin Elihu bin Tohu bin Zuf. <verse eid="1SA 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 1:2" />Incia akobhawine rua mia, mokosaroakana Hana tee Penina. Penina dhaangia tee anana, maka o Hana inda tee anana.<verse eid="1SA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 1:3" />Satao-satao Elkana alimba minaaka i Kota Rama to alingka aʼibaadati tee apasombaaka kurubani i aroana KAWASANA OPU Aulataʼalana saangua alamu i Kota Silo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Silo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kota incia sii o karidhona minaaka i Yerusalem rua pulu walu kilo. </char></note> Momembalina imamuna KAWASANA OPU iwe sumai siitumo Hofni tee Pinehas, rua miaia o anana Eli. <verse eid="1SA 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 1:4" />Wakutuuna Elkana apasombaaka kurubani, incia sadia adhawuakea o dagina kurubanina sumai sabage-sabage to Penina tee bhari-bharia anana malape umane atawa o bhawine. <verse eid="1SA 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 1:5" />Maka to Hana incia adhawuakea rua bage roonamo incia amaasiakea mpuu moomini o KAWASANA OPU inda adhawuakea o siwulu. <verse eid="1SA 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 1:6" />Hana sadia atopekapii incana tee ahinaia maruena sumai, roonamo KAWASANA OPU inda adhawua siwulu. <verse eid="1SA 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 1:7" />Kajadia incia sumai anamisia satao-satao. Gagari o Hana alingka i Kemana KAWASANA OPU, maruena sumai apekapiia incana sabutuna o Hana atangi tee amendeu akande. <verse eid="1SA 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 1:8" />Kasiimpo Elkana aabhakia, "Hana, apokia utangi? Apokia umendeu ukande? Apokia amakidhi-kidhi incamu? Buaka alabhi akoharagaa sapulu mia ana umane minaaka i kaasiku to ingkoo?"<verse eid="1SA 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hana tee Eli</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 1:9-18">1:9-18</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 1:9" />Saangu wakutuu sapadhana manga incia akande i Silo i Kemana KAWASANA OPU, Hana akakaromo minaaka i kauncuramakana. Wakutuu incia sumai o Imamu Eli tangasaana auncura uka i kauncuramakana i saripina ariina bhambana Kemana KAWASANA OPU.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kemana KAWASANA OPU: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Siitumo Kema Momangkilo ipakarona Nabii Musa wakutuuna miana Israel alimbamo minaaka i Tana Mesir tee indapo apesua i Tana Kanaan tee o Raja Solomo indapo apakaro Baitulla i Yerusalem. Kamata <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 26:1-37">Limb. 26:1-37</ref> </char>.</char></note> <verse eid="1SA 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 1:10" />Tee kaporona incana, Hana adoʼa i KAWASANA OPU apoose atangi tee akaʼusuʼusu. <verse eid="1SA 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:5">Kab. 6:5</ref>.</char></note>Incia apalimba tolauna onina, pogauna, "E KAWASANA OPU, Aulataʼalana saangua alamu, tilikimea o bhatuamu sii! Kamatamea o kanarakaana bhatuamu tee mpuu-mpuuna incamu! Udhaniakumo tee bholi umalinguakaaku! Ande Ingkoo udhawuakaaku samia ana umane, iaku kujanji bhekudhawuakea to alaianiko saʼumurua dhadhina, tee o buluana uka inda bhekukuruia."<verse eid="1SA 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 1:12" />Wakutuuna bhawine sumai atorotorosu adoʼa i aroana KAWASANA OPU, Imamu Eli atiliki bhiwina bhawine sumai. <verse eid="1SA 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 1:13" />Hana adoʼa i nuncana ngangarandana, jadi tangkanamo bhiwina mokamingku-mingkuna, maka o suarana inda atorango. Rampaakanamo sumai, Eli aabhia ande o Hana sii tangasaana amalango. <verse eid="1SA 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 1:14" />Kasiimpo Eli apogau tee incia, "Apokia umalango iwe sii? Untomo usumpu angguru!"<verse eid="1SA 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 1:15" />Maka o Hana alawani, "Inda opuku, iaku samia bhawine motangasaana momakidhi-kidhina incana. Iaku inda kusumpu angguru atawa o giu isumpu imalangoaka, maka iaku siimpo padha kupetulatulaaka sagala giuna kapiina incaku i aroana KAWASANA OPU. <verse eid="1SA 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 1:16" />Bholi uabhiaku samia bhawine inda momalapena feʼelina rampaakanamo abhari mpuu ipeenciakaku tee kanarakaa inamisiku, mbakana o bhiwiku akamingku-mingku minaaka i saao."<verse eid="1SA 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 1:17" />Lawanina Eli, "Ande mboo itu, ulingkamo, maasangia usalaamati tee maasangia o Kawasana Opu isombana miana Israel adhawuakako opea iemanimu tee Incia."<verse eid="1SA 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 1:18" />Lawanina Hana, "Maasangia o bhatuamu sii apotibhaaka kaasimu." Kasiimpo bhawine sumai alingkamo, incia akandemo tee indamo amaporo incana.<verse eid="1SA 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samuel Alaahiri tee Atodhawuaka i KAWASANA OPU</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 1:19-28">1:19-28</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 1:19" />Samainawana manga incia abhangumo saeona, kasiimpo asambahea pendua i aroana KAWASANA OPU. Sapadhana sumai manga incia ambulimo i bhanuana i Kota Rama. Wakutuuna Elkana akole aporomu tee Hana, KAWASANA OPU audhanimo bhawine sumai. <verse eid="1SA 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 1:20" />Satao sapadhana incia sumai, Hana abhawa-bhawamo, kasiimpo apalaahiri samia ana umane. Anaana incia sumai asarongiakea Samuel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Samuel: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I nuncana pogau Ibrani, sarona 'Samuel' sii aposiingi tee oni 'aemani.' Maka o maʼanana sarona 'Samuel' sii o 'sarona Aulataʼala.' </char></note> tee o Hana apogau, "Iaku kusarongiakea Samuel roonamo kuemania i KAWASANA OPU."<verse eid="1SA 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 1:21" />Satao sapadhana Hana apalaahiri anana, akawamo uka wakutuuna Elkana tee bhari-bharia witinaina alingka apasombaaka kurubani isumbele satao-satao, tee kurubanina tolauna onina i aroana KAWASANA OPU. <verse eid="1SA 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 1:22" />Maka o Hana inda aose manga witinaina, incia apogau tee umanena, "Sauntona Samuel adudu, iaku bhekubhawea iwe sumai ahususu to alaiani KAWASANA OPU, tee apepuu eo incia sumai Samuel bheamboore saʼumurua i kemana KAWASANA OPU."<verse eid="1SA 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 1:23" />Kasiimpo Elkana apogau, "Pewaumea opea iabhimu momalapena, mbooremo i bhanua sakawana o anaana sumai aunto adudu. Maasangia o KAWASANA OPU apewau opea mopadhana ijanjiakana." Sumaimo o bhawine sumai ambooremo i bhanua tee apadudumo anana sakawana anaana sumai aunto adudu.<verse eid="1SA 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 1:24" />Wakutuuna Samuel auntomo adudu, incia abhawea inana i Kemana KAWASANA OPU i Silo. Wakutuu incia sumai o Samuel dhaangiapo amaidhi-idhi mpuu. Inana uka abhawa sambaa sapi umane mokoʼumuruna talu tao, sapulu nama kilo gandum,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">sapulu nama kilo gandum: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pogau Ibrani asilii iwe sii aose kaʼukuruna 'saʼefa' mokoantoakana sapulu nama kilo atawa rua pulu pata litere. </char></note> tee sakanto kuli uwena angguru. <verse eid="1SA 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 1:25" />Sapi umane sumai atosumbele, kasiimpo Samuel abhawea i Imamu Eli. <verse eid="1SA 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 1:26" />Kasiimpo Hana apogau tee Eli, "E opuku, kuemani maʼafu, dhaangiapo uudhaniaku? Iakumo bhawine mokabhale-bhalena i saripimu tee mopoosena modoʼana i KAWASANA OPU i piamo itu. <verse eid="1SA 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 1:27" />Toomo anaana incia sii iaku kupalimba tolauna oniku, tee o KAWASANA OPU padhamo adhawuakaaku opea iemaniku tee Incia. <verse eid="1SA 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 1:28" />Rampaakanamo sumai, anaana incia sii kupasaraakaakea i KAWASANA OPU to amembaliaka pewauana saʼumurua." Tee o anaana incia sumai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:28 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">anaana incia sumai: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I nuncana kaburina Ibrani apake oni 'incia' tee o kaburi incia sii o maʼanana amembali uka to asarongiaka Samuel, Eli, Elkana, atawa amembali uka to asarongiaka Elkana tee keluargana. </char></note> aʼibaadatimo i KAWASANA OPU iwe sumai.<verse eid="1SA 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1SA 2" />
  <para style="s1">Doʼana Hana</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 2:1-10">2:1-10</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:46-55">Luk. 1:46-55</ref>. </char>
    </note>Kasiimpo Hana adoʼa, pogauna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">"KAWASANA OPU apaunde-unde ngangarandaku tee o KAWASANA OPU adhawuaku kakaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:1">Muncuku ahina musuku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:1">sababuna iaku kukaunde-unde roonamo katulungimu.<verse eid="1SA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 2:2" />Inda dhaangia momangkilona mboomo KAWASANA OPU.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">Inda dhaangia mosagaanana, tangkanamo Ingkoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:2">inda dhaangia o gunu bhatu mboomo Aulataʼalata.<verse eid="1SA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 2:3" />Bholi sadia amalanga bhatangana pogaumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">bholi dhaangia o pogau mosombo molimbana minaaka i ngangamu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:3">roonamo KAWASANA OPU Momatauna bhari-bharia giu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:3">tee Incia mohaakimuna bhari-bharia pewauna maanusia.<verse eid="1SA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 2:4" />Panana manga hiri atokatuki,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:4">maka manga mia momalute amakaamo.<verse eid="1SA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 2:5" />Mia momambosu i piamo itu sii-sii aasomo karona to apotibhaaka kinande,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">maka o mia momaara i piamo itu sii-sii amalompomo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5</char><char style="fq" closed="false">amalompomo: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pogau Ibrani amarasai atomaʼanai. Amembali uka akomaʼana aunto o kaarana atawa aponiunto. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:5">Bhawine mokombana i piamo itu sii-sii apalaahirimo pitu mia anaana,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">pitu mia anaana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">To miana Israel nomoro tuju agambaraaka saangu giu momondo (kamata <char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 1:2">Ayb. 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 42:13">42:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 15:9">Yer. 15:9</ref></char>). Ande tabaca aʼeati <char style="xt"><ref loc="1SA 21">21</ref></char>, sapadhana Hana apalaahiri Samuel, incia apalaahirimo uka talu mia ana umane tee rua mia ana bhawine. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:5">maka o mia mobharina anana i piamo itu, sii-sii amalaumo.<verse eid="1SA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 2:6" />KAWASANA OPU apadhadhi tee apekamate maanusia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:6">Incia apasapo mia i nuncana duniana mia mate tee aangkea minaaka i iwe sumai.<verse eid="1SA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 2:7" />KAWASANA OPU apamisikini tee aparangkaea mia;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:7">Incia apekatambe tee apamembali mia atohoromati.<verse eid="1SA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 2:8" />Incia aangka mia momisikini minaaka i nuncana ngawuna tana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">tee aangka mia mokakuranga minaaka i nuncana karombu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">to apauncuraia apobhawa tee manga lalaki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">tee apamembalia akokauncuramakaaka kurusii motohoromati.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:8">Roonamo ariina alamu o pewauana KAWASANA OPU,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:8">tee adhikaakea dunia i bhawona.<verse eid="1SA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 2:9" />Bhengkalana manga mia mosaalihi bheajagania,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:9">maka o mia madhaki bheahancuru i nuncana kalalanda</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:9">roonamo mencuana aminaaka i kakaamami imembaliakamami takana minaaka i manga musumami.<verse eid="1SA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 2:10" />KAWASANA OPU bheapahancuru mia mopotagalina tee Incia.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">To manga incia o KAWASANA OPU bheapasapo guntu minaaka i laiana.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 2:10">KAWASANA OPU bheahaakimu maanusia sakawana i tapana dunia.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">Incia bheadhawuaka kakaana to manga raja ipilina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 2:10">tee apajaea mia ilantina."<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mia ilantina: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I nuncana pogau Ibrani, ibarati incia sii uka akomaʼana 'masyiakh.' Ande o maʼanana satotuuna siitumo o mia motominaki to tandana incia o mia mopadhana ipilina Aulataʼala. Al Masi, motosarongiakana uka Isa bin Maryam, minaaka i oni 'masyiakh' (kamata Zab. 2:2; Tul. 4:26-27).</char></note><verse eid="1SA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kadhaki Ipewauna Manga Anana Eli</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 2:11-26">2:11-26</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 2:11" />Kasiimpo Elkana ambuli i bhanuana i Kota Rama, sainamo Samuel amboore i Silo to alaiani KAWASANA OPU tee ajagania Imamu Eli.<verse eid="1SA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 2:12" />Manga anana Eli satotuuna manga umane inda mokoguna. Manga incia inda aose parintana KAWASANA OPU <verse eid="1SA 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 2:13" />tee wakutuuna amembali imamu manga incia sainca-incana tee raʼeatina Israel. Ande dhaangia o mia mopasombaakana kurubani, mia molaianina imamu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mia molaianina imamu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kananeana dhaangia pia mia o mia mominaakana i suku Lewi atawa o imamu mosagaanana motopatugasiakana mohambana samia imamu to molaianina uumatina Israel wakutuuna apasombaaka kurubani. </char></note> aumba abhawa garupuu talu mataana. Wakutuuna dagina kurubani sumai tangasaana atonasu, <verse eid="1SA 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 2:14" />garupuu sumai atopake to asusuaka dagi modhaangiana i nuncana panci, kawali, balanga atawa o poluka, tee opeapo uka iangkana garupuu sumai bheaalea imamu to karona. Mboomo sumai ipewauna manga incia tee bhari-bharia miana Israel moumbana i Silo. <verse eid="1SA 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 2:15" />Sampe o mia molaianina imamu sagaa aumba wakutuuna indapo atotunu o tabhana kurubani sumai tee apaumba mia mopasombaakana kurubani sumai, "Dhawuakamea o dagi momamata sumai to imamu mamudhaakana atunua, roonamo incia amendeu atarima dagi motonasu minaaka i ingkomiu, maka tabeana momamatana."<verse eid="1SA 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 2:16" />Ande o mia incia sumai alawani, "Tabhana tabeana aporikanapo atotunu; sapadhana sumai kasiimpo amembali ualea peepeeluamu." Sumaimo mia molaianina imamu sumai alawani, "Inda, sii-sii uka udhawuakaaku, ande inda bhekupakisaaia kualea!"<verse eid="1SA 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 2:17" />Tee mboomo sumai rua miaia anana Eli sumai apewau dosa momaoge i aroana KAWASANA OPU, roonamo manga incia apandaʼente pasombaana kurubani to KAWASANA OPU.<verse eid="1SA 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 2:18" />Wakutuu incia sumai o Samuel dhaangiapo anaana tee atorosu alaiani KAWASANA OPU. Incia apake bhaju efod<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18</char><char style="fq" closed="false">bhaju efod: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bhaju hususu to manga imamu. Kamata <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 28:30">Limb. 28:30</ref></char>. </char></note> minaaka i kae lenan. <verse eid="1SA 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 2:19" />Satao-satao inana akarajaakea satuwu juba maidhiidhi kasiimpo abhawaakea to Samuel wakutuuna inana tee amana apobhawa aumba i Silo to apasombaaka kurubani satao-satao. <verse eid="1SA 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 2:20" />Satao-satao Eli aemani i KAWASANA OPU to abarakatiaka Elkana tee Hana. Incia apogau tee Elkana, "Maasangia o KAWASANA OPU adhawuakako siwulu minaaka i bhawinemu sii, to abholosiaka anaana mopadhana iemanimu tee doʼa tee ipasaraakaakamu to KAWASANA OPU." Sapadhana sumai manga incia ambulimo i mbooresana. <verse eid="1SA 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 2:21" />Hana aperangoia KAWASANA OPU, sabutuna incia abhawa-bhawamo tee apalaahirimo talu mia ana umane tee rua mia ana bhawine. Samuel momangurana dhadhina sumai uka ahandamo ajulu o kaogena i aroana KAWASANA OPU.<verse eid="1SA 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 2:22" />Eli amancuanamo mpuu. Incia arango bhari-bharia giu ipewauna manga anana to manga miana Israel. Tee o Eli amataua uka ande manga incia akole tee manga bhawine motugasina i aroana bhambana Kemana KAWASANA OPU. <verse eid="1SA 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 2:23" />Eli apogau tee manga incia, "Apokia ingkomiu upewau manga giu incia sumai? Iaku kurango lele minaaka i saangua lipu sii o pokaina tee pewaumiu momadhakina sumai. <verse eid="1SA 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 2:24" />Bholi upewau mboo itu manga anaku. Amadhaki mpuu opea ipogauakana uumatina KAWASANA OPU to ingkomiu! <verse eid="1SA 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 2:25" />Ande o mia akodosa tee mia mosagaanana, sumaimo Aulataʼala momembalina mopapomalapea pendua; maka ande o mia mokodosana tee KAWASANA OPU, incema momembalina potoloweana?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 2:25">Maka manga incia inda aperangoi pogauna amana, roonamo KAWASANA OPU gauna apekamate manga incia.<verse eid="1SA 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 2:26" />Samuel momangurana dhadhina sumai ahandamo ajulu o kaogena tee ahandamo amaasiakea KAWASANA OPU tee bhari-bharia mia.<verse eid="1SA 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Firimanina Aulataʼala to Imamu Eli tee Keluargana</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 2:27-36">2:27-36</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 2:27" />Saangu wakutuu samia nabiina Aulataʼala aumba i Eli tee apogau, "Perangoimea o firimanina KAWASANA OPU sii, 'Iaku kususuaka karoku to Harun opu-opuamu tee bhari-bharia siwuluna i wakutuuna uumatiku dhaangiapo amembali bhatua i lipuna Mesir tee wakutuuna akuasaia rajana Mesir. <verse eid="1SA 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 2:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 28:1-4">Limb. 28:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:35-36">Im. 7:35-36</ref>. </char></note>Iaku padhamo kupili Harun minaaka i tanga-tangana miana Israel to amembali imamu mobhaa-bhaana mopasombaakana kurubani i bhawona tampana tunuana kurubani, to motununa dhupa, tee mopakena bhaju efod i aroaku. Kasiimpo to ingkomiu momembalina siwuluna Harun, Iaku padhamo kudhawuakakomiu kalaiani mohususu to upasombaaka bhari-bharia kurubani itunu idhawuakana miana Israel. <verse eid="1SA 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 2:29" />Apokia ingkomiu upandaʼente kurubani mopadhana iparintaakaku to ipasombaaka i tampana mbooresaku? Apokia ingkoo ulabhi uhoromati manga anamu tee Iaku, tee upekaoge bukumiu minaaka uala wetana dagina kurubani momalape ipasombaakana miana Israel?' "<verse eid="1SA 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 2:30" />"Jadi mboomo sumai o firimanina KAWASANA OPU, Aulataʼala isombana miana Israel, 'Satotuuna Iaku padhamo kufirimani, ande o keluargamu tee siwulumu bhealaianiaku saʼumurua, maka sii-sii, amaridhomo giu incia sumai tee Iaku! Incema o mia mohoromatiaku, Iaku bhekuhoromatia, tee incema o mia mohinaaku incia bheahina i mataku, mboomo sii o firimanina KAWASANA OPU.' <verse eid="1SA 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 2:31" />Satotuuna bheakawamo wakutuuna bhekukatuki kuasamu tee kuasana siwuluna opu-opuamu, sabutuna inda dhaangia samia uka momatuʼana umuruna i nuncana keluargamu. <verse eid="1SA 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 2:32" />Sampe ingkoo uka bheukamata balaa akangkanai tampana mbooresaku! Pepuu sii-sii tee sakawana saʼumurua, manga mia mosagaanana i tanga-tangana miana Israel bheapotibhaaka pegiu-giuna kabarakati, maka minaaka i tanga-tangana siwulumu inda dhaangia mokoʼumuruna marambe! <verse eid="1SA 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 2:33" />Incemapo uka minaaka i siwulumu dhaangiapo modhadhina tee motoundaakana mokandena dagina kurubani i tampana tunuana kurubaniku, sumaimo bheapekawiloa matamu tee incamu bheapekaporoa. Roonamo bhari-bharia siwulumu mosagaanana bheamate wakutuuna dhaangiapo amangura dhadhina."<verse eid="1SA 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 2:34" />"Tee opea bhemomembalina tee rua mia anamu, siitumo Hofni tee Pinehas, bheamembali tanda to ingkoo <char style="add">ande bhari-bharia ifirimaniakana i saao bheatopamondo</char>; rua miaia bheamate i eo mopokana. <verse eid="1SA 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 2:35" />Kasiimpo iaku bhekuangka samia imamu motaʼatina tee moosena opea iparintaakaku. Incia bhekudhawuakea siwulu motaʼati to amembaliaka imamu modhadhina i aroana manga raja ipiliku. <verse eid="1SA 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 2:36" />Bhari-bharia bhilaana siwulumu dhaangiapo modhadhina bheaumba tee asuju tee apekatambe karona i aroana imamu incia sumai to aemani doi tee kinande apoose apogau, 'Undaakaaku kuhamba manga imamu sumai, mamudhaakana amembali kukande moomini soo satumpo roti.' "<verse eid="1SA 2:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1SA 3" />
  <para style="s1">KAWASANA OPU Apatokamata Karona i Samuel</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 3:1-4:1a">3:1--4:1a</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 3:1" />Samuel dhaangiapo momangurana dhadhina sumai alaiani KAWASANA OPU, tee incia aose parinta minaaka i Imamu Eli. I wakutuu incia sumai o firimanina KAWASANA OPU dhaangiapo amesagala, tee indapo abhari o mia momembalina mopekilalaakana pokamatana.<verse eid="1SA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 3:2" />I saangu malo, Eli tangasaana akole i kolemana. Matana apepuumo amarawu, sabutuna indamo atinda apokamata. <verse eid="1SA 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 3:3" />Wakutuu incia sumai o padamarana Kemana KAWASANA OPU indapo amate, sainamo Samuel dhaangiapo apotidhole i nuncana Kemana KAWASANA OPU <char style="add">i aroana Kamara Momangkilo Mpuu </char> tampana Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soronga motokarajaana minaaka i kau mogambaraakana umbaana Aulataʼala i tanga-tangana uumatina. Soronga incia sii akoantoaka uka rua angu katongkana bhatu motoburiakana tee sapulu angu hukumu. </char></note>. <verse eid="1SA 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 3:4" />Kasiimpo Samuel agoraakea KAWASANA OPU, tee incia alawani, "Umbe uma." <verse eid="1SA 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 3:5" />Kasiimpo Samuel abuntulimo alingka i Eli tee apogau, "Iaku iwe sii, ugoraakaaku i saao uma?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:5">Lawanina Eli, "Iaku inda kugoraakako, lingkamo upotidhole pendua." Sumaimo Samuel alingkamo apotidhole pendua.<verse eid="1SA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 3:6" />Kasiimpo KAWASANA OPU apenduamo uka agoraaka Samuel, incia abhangumo kasiimpo alingka i Eli tee apogau, "Iaku iwe sii, ugoraakaaku i saao uma?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:6">Lawanina Eli, "Iaku inda kugoraakako anaku, lingkamo upotidhole pendua."<verse eid="1SA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 3:7" />Wakutuu incia sumai o Samuel indapo apomatau tee KAWASANA OPU tee o firimanina KAWASANA OPU indapo atopaumbaaka to incia.<verse eid="1SA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 3:8" />Kasiimpo to talu mpearona uka o KAWASANA OPU agoraaka Samuel. Incia abhangu kasiimpo alingka apokawaaka Eli tee apogau, "Iaku iwe sii, ugoraakaaku i saao uma?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:8">Sumaimo Eli amataumea ande mogoraakana Samuel sumai o KAWASANA OPU. <verse eid="1SA 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 3:9" />Rampaakanamo sumai o Eli apogaumo tee Samuel, "Lingkamo ukole, dhaampo ande agoraakako pendua siimpomo upogau, 'E KAWASANA OPU, pogaumo, roonamo iaku o bhatuamu sii kuperangoiko.' " Kasiimpo Samuel alingkamo apotidhole i kolemana.<verse eid="1SA 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 3:10" />Kasiimpo aumbamo KAWASANA OPU akabhale-bhale iwe sumai tee agoraakea uka, "Samuel! Samuel!"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:10">Alawanimo Samuel, "E KAWASANA OPU, pogaumo, iaku kuperangoiko."<verse eid="1SA 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 3:11" />Kasiimpo KAWASANA OPU apogaumo tee Samuel, "Satotuuna Iaku bhekupewau saangu giu inda momentela i Israel, sabutuna bhari-bharia mia morangoa bheakii rua mbalia talingana. <verse eid="1SA 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 3:12" />I eo incia sumai bhekukarajaaia opea mopadhana ifirimaniakaku to Eli pokaiana tee keluargana minaaka i bhaa-bhaana sakawana i kapadhaana. <verse eid="1SA 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 3:13" />Iaku padhamo kupaumbaakea to incia ande bhekuhukumu keluargana saʼumurua roonamo manga anana ahinaaku. Eli amataua o dosana manga anana sumai, maka o Eli inda ataangi manga anana to apewau dosa. <verse eid="1SA 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 3:14" />Rampaakanamo sumai, Iaku kuposumpa to keluargana Eli, ande o dosana manga incia inda amembali ahapusua tee kurubani isumbele atawa tee haroaana pasombaana giuna ikande saʼumurua."<verse eid="1SA 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 3:15" />Samuel apotidhole sakawana saeona, kasiimpo abhangu tee abungkale manga bhambana Kemana KAWASANA OPU. Maka o Samuel amaeka to apaumbaaka opea mopadhana ikamatana sumai i Eli. <verse eid="1SA 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 3:16" />Maka o Eli agoraaka Samuel, pogauna, "Samuel anaku!"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 3:16">Samuel alawani, "Umbe uma!"<verse eid="1SA 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 3:17" />Pogauna Eli, "Firimani opea mopadhana ipakawaakana to ingkoo? Petula-tulaakamea bhari-bharia, bholi ubuniakea minaaka i iaku. Ande dhaangia o giu irahasiaakamu, sumaimo Aulataʼala bheahukumuko." <verse eid="1SA 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 3:18" />Jadi o Samuel apetulatulaakamea bhari-bharia giu incia sumai tee inda dhaangia ibuniakana. Kasiimpo Eli apogau, "Incia o KAWASANA OPU; taroakamea Incia apewauaka opea iabhina momalapena i fikirina."<verse eid="1SA 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 3:19" />Samuel ahandamo ajulu o kaogena. KAWASANA OPU apoose tee incia tee inda saangu uka ipogauakana Samuel inda mokobukutiina. <verse eid="1SA 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 3:20" />Sumaimo saangua lipuna Israel, minaaka i Kota Dan sakawana i Kota Bersyeba aʼakuia ande o Samuel atotuu-totuu samia nabii ilambokona KAWASANA OPU. <verse eid="1SA 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 3:21" />KAWASANA OPU mentene mpearo apatokamataaka karona i Silo. Iwe sumai o KAWASANA OPU apatokamataaka karona to Samuel tee apogau tee incia.<verse eid="1SA 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1SA 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1a" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1a" />Pogauna Samuel sumai arangoa bhari-bharia miana Israel.<verse eid="1SA 4:1a" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:1a </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Soronga motokarajaana minaaka i kau mogambaraakana umbaana Aulataʼala i tanga-tangana uumatina. Soronga incia sii akoantoaka uka rua angu katongkana bhatu motoburiakana tee sapulu angu hukumu. Kamata <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 25:10-22">Limb. 25:10-22</ref></char>.</char></note> Atorampasi</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 4:1b-11">4:1b-11</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1b" style="v" sid="1SA 4:1b" />Saangu wakutuu, miana Israel alingka apotimbe tee miana Filistin. Miana Israel apakaro kemana i saripina Eben-Haezer, sainamo miana Filistin apakaro kemana i Afek. <verse eid="1SA 4:1b" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 4:2" />Kasiimpo miana Filistin apasiapumo suludaduna to apotimbeaka tee manga miana Israel. Wakutuuna tangasaana potimbea sumai, miana Israel amatalomo, tee abhari o suludaduna momatena kera-kera pata rewu mia i nuncana potimbea sumai. <verse eid="1SA 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 4:3" />Wakutuuna manga suludaduna sumai ambuli i kemana, manga mancuanana miana Israel apogaumo, "Apokia i eo sii o KAWASANA OPU mangataroaka tamatalo minaaka i miana Filistin? Maimo tabhawaaka Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU minaaka i Silo. Ande o soronga sumai apobhawa tee ingkita, ingkita dhaanamo tasalaamati minaaka i manga musuta."<verse eid="1SA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 4:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 25:22">Limb. 25:22</ref>. </char>
    </note>Kasiimpo manga incia atumpu pia mia o suludaduna to alingkaaka i Silo tee aala Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPUNA Aulataʼalana saangua alamu modhaangiana i bhawona manga kerub.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kerub: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malaaʼekati igambaraaka mboomo mahaluku mokopani, gambarana kalangana Aulataʼala tee umbaana. </char></note> Rua miaia anana Eli, siitumo Hofni tee Pinehas aose manga incia abhawa Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU sumai i pokemaa.<verse eid="1SA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 4:5" />Sakawana Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU sumai i pokemaana miana Israel, manga incia asambo-sambomo tee apekee momakaa mpuu, sabutuna o dunia akolendu. <verse eid="1SA 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 4:6" />Wakutuuna o miana Filistin arango suarana sambo-sambo sumai, manga incia apogaumo, "Opea isambo-samboakana manga miana Ibrani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">manga miana Ibrani: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wakutuu zamanina Nabii Samuel, miana Israel indapo asarongi karona "miana Ibrani" maka asarongi karona "miana Israel" atawa "miana Yehuda." Soo manga musuna Israel mosarongina manga incia "miana Ibrani" to aele-eleaka manga incia. </char></note> sumai?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:6">Kasiimpo manga incia amataumea, ande o Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU akawamo i pokemaana manga miana Israel. <verse eid="1SA 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 4:7" />Manga miana Filistin amaekamo tee apogau, "Dhaangia tee manga dewana miana Israel moumbana i pokemaana manga incia!" Manga incia uka apogau, "Tacilakamo roonamo indapo aperna tanamisi giu mboo sii. <verse eid="1SA 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 4:8" />Tacilakamo! Incema bhemomangatulungina minaaka i limana manga dewa momakaa sii? Manga dewamo incia sumai mopadhana mopekamatena miana Mesir tee sagala giuna balaa i tana matuu i piamo itu. <verse eid="1SA 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 4:9" />E miana Filistin, pekatangkea o ngangarandata tee tabaranimo tapotimbe mboomo samia umane, ande inda ingkita bhetamembali bhatuana miana Ibrani, mboomo i piamo itu manga incia amembali bhatuata. Rampaakanamo sumai maimo tapotimbeaka mboomo samia hiri mobarani!"<verse eid="1SA 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 4:10" />Kasiimpo apotimbemo miana Filistin, tee amatalomo miana Israel, sabutuna manga incia apalaiakamo karona i kemana samia-samia. Amaoge mpuu o katalona miana Israel, siitumo talu pulu rewu o tantarana momatena i eo incia sumai. <verse eid="1SA 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 4:11" />Inda soo incia sumai, maka o Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU uka atorampasi, tee uka rua miaia anana Eli siitumo Hofni tee Pinehas atopekamate.<verse eid="1SA 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Matena Imamu Eli</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 4:12-22">4:12-22</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 4:12" />I eo incia sumai dhaangia samia o suludadu mominaakana i suku Binyamin mopalaiakana karona minaaka i tampana potimbea tee akawa i Silo. Pakeana amabhenci-bhenci tee adhikaakea ngawuna tana i bhaana. <verse eid="1SA 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 4:13" />Wakutuuna akawa i Silo, Eli tangasaana auncura i kurusii i bhiwina dhala aantagi lelena potimbea sumai. Ngangarandana alilaho rampaakanamo Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU sumai. Wakutuuna suludadu sumai apesua i nuncana kota tee apetulatulaaka lele madhaki sumai, bhari-bharia miana kota apekee tee suara makaa.<verse eid="1SA 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 4:14" />Wakutuuna Eli arango mopekeena sumai, incia aabhamo, "Karobhona opea sumai?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:14">Kasiimpo mia incia sumai alausakamo aumbati Eli to apaumbaakea o kajadia opea modhaangiana iwe sumai. <verse eid="1SA 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 4:15" />Wakutuu incia sumai umuruna Eli sio pulu walu taomo, tee o matana amarawumo sabutuna incia indamo amembali apokamata.<verse eid="1SA 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 4:16" />Pogauna mia incia sumai tee Eli, "Iaku siimpo kuumba minaaka i tampana potimbea. Eo sii iaku kupalaiaka karoku minaaka i tampana potimbea sumai."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 4:16">Pogauna Eli, "E anaku, tuaapa o kadhaangiana potimbea sumai?"<verse eid="1SA 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 4:17" />Mobhawana lele sumai alawani, "Miana Israel apalaiaka karona minaaka i suludaduna Filistin, amaoge mpuu o katalomami tee tanarakaa mpuu i nuncana potimbea sumai. Rua miaia anamu Hofni tee Pinehas uka amatemo, tee o Sorongana Pojanjiana Kawasana Opu arampasimea musu."<verse eid="1SA 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 4:18" />Wakutuuna mia incia sumai apetulatulaaka opea momembalina tee Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU, Eli akotibu akambara-mbara minaaka i kurusiina i saripina bhambana lawa sumai. Laena bhorokona amakatu, sabutuna o Eli alausaka amate roonamo incia amaoge o bukuna tee amancuanamo. Eli akapalai miana Israel kangengena pata pulu tao.<verse eid="1SA 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 4:19" />Wakutuu incia sumai o ana maniana Eli, siitumo bhawinena Pinehas tangasaana abhawa-bhawa tee amakasumo akoana. Wakutuuna arango lelena Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU atorampasi, tee uka o umanena tee maniana amatemo, incia anamisimo kapii tee akapengke-pengkemo, tee inda amangenge sapadhana sumai incia akoanamo roonamo incia aumbatimea kapiina mia mokoana. <char style="add">Kasiimpo incia amatemo.</char> <verse eid="1SA 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 4:20" />Wakutuuna ajalana amakasumo, apogaumo manga bhawine motulungia, "Bholi umaeka, roonamo ingkoo padhamo upalaahiri samia ana umane!" Maka incia inda alawani tee inda afaduliakea ipogauakana manga incia.<verse eid="1SA 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 4:21" />Bhawinena Pinehas adhawuakea saro Ikabod to anana sumai, roonamo, "Kamuliangina Aulataʼala ailamo minaaka i Israel." Incia apogau mboo sumai roonamo Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU atorampasimo, tee rampaakanamo matena maniana tee umanena uka. <verse eid="1SA 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 4:22" />Pogauna, "Kamuliangina Aulataʼala ailamo minaaka i Israel roonamo Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU atorampasimo."<verse eid="1SA 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1SA 5" />
  <para style="s1">Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU i Lipuna Miana Filistin</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 5:1-12">5:1-12</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 5:1" />Sapadhana miana Filistin arampasi Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU, sorongana pojanjia sumai abhawamea minaaka i Kota Eben-Haezer sakawana i Kota Asdod i Filistin. <verse eid="1SA 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 5:2" />Kasiimpo miana Filistin abhawamo Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU sumai to apapesuaia i nuncana tampana sombaana dewa Dagon tee adhikaia i saripina patuna dewa Dagon. <verse eid="1SA 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 5:3" />Saeona mpuu, miana Asdod abhangumo tee akamatamo patuna dewa Dagon apaubhomo tee o rouna atumpu i tana i aroana Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU. Kasiimpo patuna dewa Dagon sumai aangkea tee apambulia i tampana. <verse eid="1SA 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 5:4" />Samainawana dhaangiapo saeona mpuu manga incia abhangumo, tee akamatamo patuna dewa Dagon apaubhomo uka pendua i aroana Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU sumai. Sainamo bhaana tee rua mbalia limana amakatu tee amandawu apekadole-dole sakawana i dhopi modhaangiana i tambena bhamba, tee soomo badana modhaangiana i aroana sorongana pojanjia sumai. <verse eid="1SA 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 5:5" />Rampaakanamo sumai, sakawana sii-sii manga imamuna dewa Dagon tee bhari-bharia mia mopesuana i tampa sambaheaana dewa Dagon amendeu apolanda i dhopi i tambena bhambana tampana sambaheaana dewa Dagon i Asdod sumai.<verse eid="1SA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 5:6" />Kasiimpo KAWASANA OPU adhawuakea kahukumu momatamo to manga miana Asdod tee manga lipu i saripina, siitumo ahukumuakea tee panyaki kabhisu mokonana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">panyaki kabhisu mokonana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Oni incia sii aminaaka i kaburi Ibrani momangenge mpuu. Ande i nuncana kaburi Yunani momangenge dhaangia uka tee kaburi incia sii: "Tee o bhokoti apesua i lipuna manga incia, sabutuna dhaangia tee mate tee kahancuru i saangua kota incia sumai." </char></note> i badana manga incia. <verse eid="1SA 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 5:7" />Sapadhana akamata manga kajadia incia sumai, manga miana Asdod apogaumo, "Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPUNA miana Israel sii inda amembali amboore tee ingkita, roonamo ingkita tee Dagon momembalina dewata sumai dhaanamo amakaa mpuu mangahukumuaka tee limana." <verse eid="1SA 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 5:8" />Rampaakanamo sumai manga incia aemani mamudhaakana bhari-bharia rajana miana Filistin<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bhari-bharia rajana miana Filistin: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dhaangia lima mia o rajana Filistin. Kamata <char style="xt"><ref loc="JOS 13:3">Yos. 13:3</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 6:4">1Sam. 6:4</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 17:18">17:18</ref>. </char> </char></note> aporomusaka, kasiimpo manga incia aabha, "Opea bheipewauta tee Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPUNA miana Israel sii?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:8">Manga raja sumai alawani, "Papindamea o Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPUNA miana Israel sumai i Kota Gat." Sumaimo manga incia apapindamea o Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPUNA miana Israel sumai.<verse eid="1SA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 5:9" />Maka satopapindana sorongana pojanjia sumai i Kota Gat, KAWASANA OPU aumbaakamo kahukumu momaoge i kota incia sumai tee atobungkemo raʼeatina Kota Gat minaaka i anaana sakawana i mancuana, siitumo ahukumuakea tee kabhisu mokonana i badana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kabhisu mokonana i badana: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Atawa i nuncana kaburi Yunani, "I puuna kalana manga incia." </char></note> manga incia. <verse eid="1SA 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 5:10" />Kasiimpo Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU sumai alambokoa i Kota Ekron.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 5:10">Sakawana Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU sumai i Kota Ekron, apekeemo o raʼeatina Ekron, pogauna, "Manga incia apapinda Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU miana Israel iwe sii to apekamateaka raʼeatina liputa!" <verse eid="1SA 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 5:11" />Rampaakanamo sumai, manga incia akembamo bhari-bharia rajana kotana miana Filistin to aporomusakaaka pendua, kasiimpo manga incia apogau, "Tulungi pekaridhoa o Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPUNA miana Israel sii tee upambulia i tampana bhaa-bhaana. Ande inda, bhari-bharikita bheamangapekamate dewana manga incia!" Saangua kota incia sumai atobungke rampaakanamo katamona kahukumuna Aulataʼala. <verse eid="1SA 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 5:12" />Manga mia inda momate ahukumuakea tee kabhisu mokonana, sabutuna o pekeena raʼeatina kota incia sumai akawea o laiana.<verse eid="1SA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1SA 6" />
  <para style="s1">Sorongana Pojanjia Apambulia i Miana Israel</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 6:1-7:1">6:1--7:1</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 6:1" />Pitu mbula o kangengena Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU atodhika i lipuna miana Filistin. <verse eid="1SA 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 6:2" />Kasiimpo miana Filistin akembamo manga imamu tee manga pande sihiri, kasiimpo aabha, "Opea bheipewaumami tee Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU sii? Mangapaumbaakapo tuaapa o carana mamudhaakana tapambulia pendua i tampana."<verse eid="1SA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 6:3" />Manga incia alawani, "Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPUNA miana Israel sumai bholi soo upambulia makate, maka tabeana upapooseakea tee saangu pasombaa to katolosina dosamiu. Tee mboo sumai o panyakimiu bheatopaunto, tee ingkomiu bheumataua apokia o Aulataʼalana miana Israel ahukumukomiu torotorosu."<verse eid="1SA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 6:4" />Sapadhana incia sumai manga miana Filistin aabhamo uka, "Opea tabeana ipasombaakamami to katolosina dosamami tee Incia?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 6:4">Manga imamu tee manga pande sihiri sumai alawani, "Pasombaakamea lima tongka bulawa mokobhanguna mboomo kabhisu tee lima mbaa bhokoti ikarajaamiu minaaka i bulawa tee upapokanea mboomo kabharina manga raja i Kota Filistin, roonamo apokana tee balaa mopadhana mokangkanaikomiu tee uka mokangkanaina manga raja i kotamiu."<verse eid="1SA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 6:5" />"Jadi ukarajaamo lima tongka bulawa mokobhanguna mboomo kabhisu tee bhokoti mopekadhakina lipumiu, kasiimpo umuliangi Aulataʼala isombana miana Israel. Maasangia Incia bheaunto ahukumukomiu tee manga dewamiu, tee aunto aumbaaka balaa i lipumiu. <verse eid="1SA 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 6:6" />Apokia umentagali mboomo miana Mesir tee Raja Firaun? Bholi umalingu ande o Aulataʼala amentenempearo ahukumu manga incia tee kahukumu momatamo mpuu, sampe manga incia ataroaka miana Israel alingka abholi lipuna Mesir sumai."<verse eid="1SA 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 6:7" />"Rampaakanamo sumai, karajaamo saangu kareta bhaau tee ubhokea i bhorokona rua mbaa sapi mangura motangasaana mopaduduna anana tee indapo mopernana motopakeakana kancodhaa to ahela kareta. Rua mbaaia o sapi sumai ubhokemea i aroana kareta, maka manga anana sapi sumai upambulia i nuncana kandana mamudhaakana inda aose inana. <verse eid="1SA 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 6:8" />Kasiimpo uangkamea o Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU sumai tee udhikaia i nuncana kareta. Dhikamea manga bulawa bheipasombaakamiu to katolosina dosamiu i nuncana saangu sorosoronga modhaangiana i saripina sorongana pojanjia sumai. Sapadhaana sumai utaroakamea o sapi sumai alingkaaka. <verse eid="1SA 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 6:9" />Kamatamea o lingkaana kareta sumai, ande o sorongana pojanjia sumai abhawea aporope i Kota Bet-Semes, maʼanana o Aulataʼalana miana Israel moumbaakana balaa momaoge to ingkita, maka ande inda, sumaimo ingkita bhetamataua ande mencuana Aulataʼalana miana Israel mangahukumuna, tee o giu incia sii inda atoporadhamii."<verse eid="1SA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 6:10" />Manga incia aosemo opea ipogauakana manga imamu tee manga pande sihiri sumai, tee aalamo rua mbaa sapi motangasaana mopaduduna anana tee abhokea i kareta sumai, sainamo manga anana sapi sumai akurungaia i nuncana kanda. <verse eid="1SA 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 6:11" />Kasiimpo Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU sumai adhikaia i nuncana kareta apoose tee sorosoronga mokoantoakana lima tongka bulawa mokobhanguna mboomo kabhisu tee bhokoti sumai. <verse eid="1SA 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 6:12" />Kasiimpo rua mbaaia sapi sumai alausaka alingka i dhala oge moporopena i Kota Bet-Semes <char style="add">i Tana Israel</char>. Sakaaratea dhala akomburu apalimba suarana tee inda abelo i kaai tee i kaana. Manga rajana miana Filistin sumai atorotorosu aosea sakawana i potidhaana Bet-Semes.<verse eid="1SA 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 6:13" />Wakutuu incia sumai manga miana Bet-Semes tangasaana atobhe gandum i mbolonga. Wakutuuna manga incia apotonto i aroana, tee akamatamo sorongana pojanjia sumai, manga incia akaunde-undemo mpuu. <verse eid="1SA 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 6:14" />Kareta incia sumai aunto i saangu bhatu maoge i inawuna Yosua miana Bet-Semes sumai. Kasiimpo raʼeatina kota incia sumai aweta-wetamo kauna kareta tee asumbele rua mbaaia sapi sumai to kurubani tunua ipasombaakana to KAWASANA OPU. <verse eid="1SA 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 6:15" />Kasiimpo manga miana Lewi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">manga miana Lewi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Suku Lewi apilia Aulataʼala hususu to alaiani Incia i Kemana KAWASANA OPU tee abhawa manga bara momangkilo iwe sumai mboo Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU sii.</char></note> apasapomo Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU sumai apoose tee sorosoronga mokoantoakana bulawa sumai tee adhikaia i bhawona bhatu maoge i saao. I eo incia sumai uka manga miana Bet-Semes apasombaaka kurubani tunua tee manga kurubani isumbele to KAWASANA OPU. <verse eid="1SA 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 6:16" />Wakutuuna lima miaia rajana Filistin akamata bhari-bharia giu incia sumai, manga incia ambulimo i Kota Ekron i eo incia sumai uka.<verse eid="1SA 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 6:17" />Siimo kabhisu minaaka i bulawa ipasombaakana miana Filistin to KAWASANA OPU to katolosina dosana raʼeatina lima angua kota iparintana lima miaia rajana Filistin sumai: Satongka minaaka i Asdod, satongka minaaka i Gaza, satongka minaaka i Askelon, satongka minaaka i Gat, tee satongka minaaka i Ekron, <verse eid="1SA 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 6:18" />tee uka manga bhokoti minaaka i bulawa ilambokona sumai apokana tee kabharina lima angua kota iparintana lima miaia rajana Filistin sumai, minaaka i kota mokobente sakawana i kampo-kampo. Bhatu maoge tampana dhikaana Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU modhaangiana i inawuna Yosua miana Bet-Semes sumai uka amembali bukutiina kajadia incia sumai sakawana sii-sii.<verse eid="1SA 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 6:19" />Maka o Aulataʼala apekamate pitu pulu mia minaaka i raʼeatina Bet-Semes roonamo apotonto i nuncana Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU sumai, sabutuna manga incia amaporomo mpuu incana roonamo KAWASANA OPU apakotibuakea balaa momaoge mpuu. <verse eid="1SA 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 6:20" />Kasiimpo apogaumo manga miana Bet-Semes, "Incema momembalina mopoarona tee KAWASANA OPU o Aulataʼala momangkilo sii? Inda samia uka momembalina! Talambokoa to incema o sorongana pojanjia sii mamudhaakana inda tamate bhari-bharikita?"<verse eid="1SA 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 6:21" />Kasiimpo manga incia alambokomo pia mia potoloweana to raʼeatina Kota Kiryat-Yearim tee aposamea, "Miana Filistin padhamo apambulia pendua o Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU. Umbamo tee uangkamea o soronga sumai tee ubhawea i tampamiu."<verse eid="1SA 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1SA 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 6:2-4">2Sam. 6:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 13:5-7">1Taw. 13:5-7</ref>. </char>
    </note>Jadi o raʼeatina Kiryat-Yearim aumba aala Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU tee abhawea i nuncana bhanuana Abinadab modhaangiana i bhawona kabumbu. Kasiimpo apatotapuaka anana mokosaroakana Eleazar to mojaganina Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU sumai.<verse eid="1SA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Samuel Mokapalaina Miana Israel</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 7:2-17">7:2-17</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 7:2" />Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU sumai amboore i Kota Kiryat-Yearim kera-kera o kangengena rua pulu tao. I wakutuu incia sumai uka bhari-bharia miana Israel agora tee apemeliliaka KAWASANA OPU. <verse eid="1SA 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 7:3" />Kasiimpo apogaumo Nabii Samuel tee bhari-bharia miana Israel, "Ande ingkomiu gaumiu umbuli usomba KAWASANA OPU tee mpuu-mpuuna incamiu, ingkomiu tabeana ubhanaka manga barahalana lipu mosagaanana tee manga patuna dewi Astoret<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">dewi Astoret: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dewi kasuburu isombana miana Kanaan iabhina mboomo bhawinena manga dewa Baal, dewa isombana manga lipu i saripina Israel. (Kamata <char style="xt"><ref loc="HAB 2:13">Hab. 2:13</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:33">1Raj. 11:33</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:13">2Raj. 23:13</ref></char>).</char></note> minaaka i tanga-tangamiu. Pasaraakaakamea o ngangarandamiu i KAWASANA OPU tee usombamo tangkanamo tee Incia, sumaimo Incia bheapabebasikomiu minaaka i limana miana Filistin." <verse eid="1SA 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 7:4" />Jadi manga miana Israel abhanakamo manga patuna dewa Baal tee patuna dewi Astoret tee manga incia soo asomba KAWASANA OPU.<verse eid="1SA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 7:5" />Kasiimpo Samuel apogau, "Romusakamea bhari-bharia miana Israel i Kota Mizpa, roonamo iaku bhekudoʼa i KAWASANA OPU to ingkomiu." <verse eid="1SA 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 7:6" />Sumaimo manga incia aporomusakamo i Mizpa, tee atambu uwe kasiimpo alalia to tandana pasombaa i aroana KAWASANA OPU. I eo incia sumai manga incia apoasa iwe sumai tee apogau, "Ingkami takodosamo tee KAWASANA OPU." Nabii Samuel uka amembali haakimu mokapalaina miana Israel i Kota Mizpa.<verse eid="1SA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 7:7" />Wakutuuna miana Filistin arango lele ande o miana Israel aporomusaka i Kota Mizpa, amajumo lima miaia rajana miana Filistin sumai tee aumbati miana Israel. Giu incia sumai arangoa miana Israel, sabutuna manga incia amaekamo to apoaroaka miana Filistin. <verse eid="1SA 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 7:8" />Pogauna miana Israel i Nabii Samuel, "Bholi uunto mangadoʼaaka i KAWASANA OPU o Aulataʼalata, mamudhaakana mangapasalaamati minaaka i limana miana Filistin." <verse eid="1SA 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 7:9" />Rampaakanamo sumai o Nabii Samuel aalamo sambaa anana dumba modhaangiana modudu, kasiimpo apasombaakea to kurubani tunua i KAWASANA OPU. Nabii Samuel aemani tulungi i KAWASANA OPU to miana Israel, tee o doʼana sumai aperangoia KAWASANA OPU.<verse eid="1SA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 7:10" />Wakutuuna Samuel tangasaana apasaraakaaka kurubani tunua sumai, aumbamo miana Filistin to apoewangiaka miana Israel. Maka i eo incia sumai o KAWASANA OPU apakacau tee apabingu miana Filistin tee suarana guntu momakaa mpuu, sabutuna manga miana Filistin amatalomo tee miana Israel. <verse eid="1SA 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 7:11" />Kasiimpo alimbamo manga miana Israel minaaka i Kota Mizpa tee apajere tee apekatalo miana Filistin sakawana i Bet-Kar.<verse eid="1SA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 7:12" />Kasiimpo Samuel aala saangu bhatu tee adhikaia i polotaana Kota Mizpa tee Sen<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sen: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I nuncana pogau Ibrani akomaʼana "nginci," tee amembali sarona kota inda imatauta sii-sii, atawa amembali uka to sarona saangu kabumbu.</char></note> tee asarongiakea Eben-Haezer,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Eben-Haezer: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maʼanana i nuncana pogau Ibrani <char style="it">Bhatu Katulungi</char>. </char></note> pogauna, "Sakawana iwe sii o KAWASANA OPU mangatulungi." <verse eid="1SA 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 7:13" />Mboomo sumai o miana Israel apekatalo miana Filistin tee kangengena dhadhina Nabii Samuel, manga incia indamo apendua uka to apesuaiki i lipuna Israel. <verse eid="1SA 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 7:14" />Bhari-bharia kota mopadhana italona tee ialana manga miana Filistin minaaka i Kota Ekron sakawana i Kota Gat apambulimea pendua i miana Israel. Mboomo sumai o miana Israel apotibhaakea pendua manga tana modhaangiana i saripina manga kotana, kasiimpo miana Israel tee miana Amori<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">miana Amori: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Miana Amori aposala tee miana Filistin. Roonamo miana Amori satotuuna manga mia momboorena i atina Tana Kanaan, i tanga-tangana manga gunu modhaangiana i Tana Kanaan, tee uka i sawetana timbuna Umala Yordan. Manga incia mokokuasana i manga lipu incia sumai i wakutuuna miana Israel indapo arampasia, sainamo miana Filistin amboore i saripina tawo i Tana Kanaan. Tee kananeana miana Amori atosarongimo miana Kanaan. Kamata <char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:16">Bhaa. 15:16</ref>.</char> </char></note> apomalapemo.<verse eid="1SA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 7:15" />Samuel amembali haakimu mokapalaina miana Israel saʼumurua dhadhina. <verse eid="1SA 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 7:16" />Incia satao-satao alingka atiingi Kota Bait-El, Kota Gilgal, tee Kota Mizpa, tee amembali haakimuna miana Israel i bhari-bharia tampa incia sumai. <verse eid="1SA 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 7:17" />Sapadhana incia sumai o Samuel ambulimo pendua i bhanuana i Kota Rama. Iwe sumai incia ahaakimu parakarana manga miana Israel tee abhangu saangu tampana tunuana kurubani to KAWASANA OPU.<verse eid="1SA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1SA 8" />
  <para style="s">Saul Amembali Raja</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 8:1-10:27">8:1--10:27</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="s1">Miana Israel Aemani Samia Raja</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 8:1-22">8:1-22</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 8:1" />Wakutuu incia sumai o Nabii Samuel amancuanamo, tee incia aangkamo bhari-bharia anana umane to amembaliaka haakimu to miana Israel. <verse eid="1SA 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 8:2" />Ana tumpena o sarona o Yoel, tee o katutunina tumpe o sarona o Abia. Manga incia amembali haakimu i Kota Bersyeba. <verse eid="1SA 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 8:3" />Maka rua miaia o anana sumai inda aose pemingkuina amana; manga incia asaladhala roonamo atarima kasogo tee o kahaakimuna inda aʼadili.<verse eid="1SA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 8:4" />Sumaimo aporomusakamo bhari-bharia mancuanana Israel, kasiimpo aumba apokawaaka Samuel i Kota Rama. <verse eid="1SA 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 8:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:14">Kap. 17:14</ref>. </char></note>Pogauna manga incia, "Satotuuna ingkoo umancuanamo, tee rua miaia anamu inda aose pemingkuimu. Sii-sii mangaangkaakamo samia raja to mangaparintana, mamudhaakana ingkami dhaangia tee rajamami mboomo manga lipu mosagaanana."<verse eid="1SA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 8:6" />Maka wakutuuna manga incia apogau tee Samuel, "Mangaangkaakamo samia raja to mangaparintana," Samuel inda apeelua o pogauna manga mancuanana Israel sumai, tee incia adoʼa i KAWASANA OPU. <verse eid="1SA 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 8:7" />Kasiimpo Samuel afirimania KAWASANA OPU, "Perangoimea bhari-bharia iemanina manga miana lipu sumai, roonamo mencuana ingkoo imendeuna manga incia, maka Iaku imendeuna, mamudhaakana Iaku inda kumembali rajana manga incia. <verse eid="1SA 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 8:8" />Apokana tee opea mopadhana ipewauna manga incia wakutuuna manga incia kubhawea alimba minaaka i Tana Mesir, tee sakawana i eo sii, manga incia abholiaku tee asomba aulataʼala mosagaanana, mboomo sumai uka ipewauna manga incia tee ingkoo. <verse eid="1SA 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 8:9" />Jadi sii-sii perangoimea opea iemanina manga incia, maka udhaniakea mpuu-mpuu tee upaumbaakea opea bhemomembalina hakuna raja moparintangina manga incia naile itu."<verse eid="1SA 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 8:10" />Jadi bhari-bharia firimanina KAWASANA OPU apakawaakea Samuel to manga mia bhari moemania moangkaakea samia raja. <verse eid="1SA 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 8:11" />Pogauna, "Siimo momembalina hakuna raja bhemoparintakomiu: Anamiu umane bheaalea to apamembalia tantarana, sagaa minaaka i manga incia bheapamembalia suludadu mosawina i karetana potimbea,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">karetana potimbea: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kareta incia sii dhaangia rua angu o rodana tee ahelaia manga ajara i nuncana potimbea. I bhawona kareta incia sii dhaangia rua mia o suludaduna, samia mopajalea tee samiana mopotimbena i bhawona kareta. </char></note> sagaa apamembalia suludadu mosawina i ajara, tee sagaa uka bheapamembalia suludadu bhemobuntulina i aroana kareta. <verse eid="1SA 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 8:12" />Dhaangia uka bhemotoangkana to amembali mokapalaina sarewu suludadu, tee mokapalaina lima pulu suludadu. Raja sumai bheapakisaa manga anamu to abhingkuni tanana inawuna, aromusaka hasilina tobheana, akarajaa manga ewangana potimbea tee parakakasina karetana potimbea. <verse eid="1SA 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 8:13" />Incia bheaala manga anamiu bhawine to apakarajaaia amembali pande jalona mina-mina mawondu, pande nasuna kinande, tee pande karajaana roti."<verse eid="1SA 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 8:14" />"Incia uka bheaala momalapena minaaka i kalibumiu, inawuna anggurumiu, tee inawuna zaitunmiu, kasiimpo adhawuakea to manga pagawena. <verse eid="1SA 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 8:15" />Mencuana soo incia sumai, maka incia bheaala uka sapulu parasee minaaka ihasilina inawumiu tee inawuna anggurumiu, kasiimpo adhawuakea to manga pagawena maligena tee manga pagawena mosagaanana."<verse eid="1SA 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 8:16" />"Incia bheaala manga bhatuamiu umane atawa o bhawine, tee bheaala momalapena minaaka i manga ana manguramiu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">momalapena minaaka i manga ana manguramiu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I nuncana boku 1 Samuel momangenge atoburi i nuncana pogau Yunani mboo sii, "momalapena minaaka i manga sapimiu." </char></note> tee keledaimiu, kasiimpo bhari-bharia sumai apakea to karajaana karona. <verse eid="1SA 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 8:17" />Incia uka bheaala sapulu parasee minaaka i gulumana dumbamiu, tee ingkomiu bheumembali bhatuana. <verse eid="1SA 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 8:18" />Ande akawa o wakutuu incia sumai, ingkomiu bheupekee roonamo raja ipilimiu sumai, maka o KAWASANA OPU inda bheaperangoia o pekeemiu sumai."<verse eid="1SA 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 8:19" />Maka o lipuna Israel incia sumai inda aperangoi pogauna Samuel. Manga incia apogau, "Inda! Ingkami tabeana dhaangia tee rajamami <verse eid="1SA 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 8:20" />mamudhaakana ingkami tapokana tee manga lipu mosagaanana! Rajamami sumai bheamangaparinta tee mangakapalai i nuncana potimbea."<verse eid="1SA 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 8:21" />Nabii Samuel aperangoi bhari-bharia ipogauakana manga incia, kasiimpo apakawaakea i KAWASANA OPU. <verse eid="1SA 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 8:22" />Firimanina KAWASANA OPU to Samuel, "Perangoimea o pogauna manga incia tee uangkaakamea samia raja to manga incia."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 8:22">Kasiimpo Samuel <char style="add">asatujui opea iemanina manga incia </char> tee apogau tee manga miana Israel, "Mbulimo i kotamiu samia-samia."<verse eid="1SA 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1SA 9" />
  <para style="s1">Saul Apokawa tee Samuel</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 9:1-25">9:1-25</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 9:1" />Dhaangia samia umane morangkaea mokosaroakana Kis bin Abiel, bin Zeror, bin Bekhorat, bin Afiah mominaakana i suku Binyamin. <verse eid="1SA 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 9:2" />Incia dhaangia tee anana umane momakesana rouna tee momalangana badana mokosaroakana Saul.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Saul: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Incia uka atosarongi Thalut i nuncana Kuruʼani. </char></note> Minaaka i tanga-tangana miana Israel inda samia uka molabhina kakesana minaaka i Saul sii. Rampaakanamo kalangana badana sumai, bhari-bharia miana Israel soo adhika i awaana.<verse eid="1SA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 9:3" />Saangu wakutuu o Kis akailangamo bhari-bharia keledai bhawinena, sabutuna o Kis apogaumo tee Saul, "Bhawamo samia o mia molaianiko, tee ulingkamo upeelo manga keledai sumai." <verse eid="1SA 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 9:4" />Kasiimpo manga incia alingkamo apeelo manga keledai sumai i lipu Salisa tee i lipu Saalim alaloi manga gununa lipuna suku Efraim, maka o keledai sumai inda apotibhaakea uka. Sapadhana incia sumai manga incia alingkamo uka apeeloa i lipuna suku Binyamin, maka asadhaadhaa inda apotibhaakea uka.<verse eid="1SA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 9:5" />Wakutuuna manga incia akawa i lipu Zuf, Saul apogaumo tee sampoosena sumai, "Maimo tambuliaka, ancosala o amaku alabhimo kameriakana tee ingkita tee ameriaka manga keledai bhawinena sumai."<verse eid="1SA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 9:6" />Maka o sampoosena sumai alawani, "Antagipo, i kota incia sii dhaangia tee samia bhatuana Aulataʼala motohoromatina mpuu, tee bhari-bharia ipogauakana sadia abanara tee akobukutii. Maimo talingkaaka iwe sumai sii-sii, aipomo incia amembali mangapaumbaaka iapai o tampana manga keledai sumai."<verse eid="1SA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 9:7" />Lawanina Saul, "Maka ande ingkita talingka iwe sumai, opea bheibhawata to incia? Bhari-bharia bhakuta atopadhamo tee indamo dhaangia o kadhawu momembalina ibhawata to bhatuana Aulataʼala sumai, buaka dhaangiapo momembalina ibhawata?"<verse eid="1SA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 9:8" />Sampoosena sumai alawani Saul, "Iaku dhaangia tee satibha doi peraku, tee bhekudhawuakea to bhatuana Aulataʼala sumai mamudhaakana mangapaumbaaka i iapai o tampana manga keledai sumai. <verse eid="1SA 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 9:9" />(I piamo itu i Israel, ande o mia apeelo opea ipeeluna Aulataʼala, manga incia bheapogau mboo sii, "Maimo talingkaaka i pande pekilala," roonamo isarongiaka nabii sii-sii, i piamo itu atosarongi pande pekilala.)<verse eid="1SA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 9:10" />Kasiimpo apogaumo Saul tee sampoosena sumai, "Fikirimu itu amalape, maimo talingkaaka." Sumaimo manga incia alingkamo i kota mbooresana bhatuana Aulataʼala sumai.<verse eid="1SA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 9:11" />Wakutuuna manga incia apangara i dhala mokokabumbu moporopena i kota, manga incia apokawa tee pia mia kabuabua molingkana to motambuna uwe i sumu. Manga incia aabhamo i manga kabuabua sumai, "Dhaangia tee pande pekilala iwe sii?"<verse eid="1SA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 9:12" />Manga kabuabua sumai alawani, "Umbe dhaangia, incia siimpo padha adhala iwe sii, ande umadhei aipomo amembali ututunia. Incia siimpo akawa i kota i eo sii, roonamo i eo sii abhari o mia moumbana to mopasombaakana kurubani to Kawasana Opu i tampana ibaadati. <verse eid="1SA 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 9:13" />Ingkomiu umembali upokawaakea wakutuuna upesua i nuncana kota, kananteana incia indapo akande i tampana ibaadati. Manga kakemba indapo bheamembali akande ande incia indapo akawa to aporikana abarakati manga kurubani sumai. Ingkomiu salabhina umadheimo ututunia roonamo sii-siimo wakutuumiu to upokawaakea."<verse eid="1SA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 9:14" />Sumaimo manga incia alingkamo i kota incia sumai. Sapesuana i kota, manga incia apokawamo tee Nabii Samuel motangasaana moporopena i tampana ibaadati.<verse eid="1SA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 9:15" />Saeo indapo umbaana Saul iwe sumai, KAWASANA OPU padhamo aposamea tee Samuel mboo sii, <verse eid="1SA 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 9:16" />"Naile kera-kera i wakutuu mboo sii, Iaku bhekulambokoakako samia umane mangura minaaka i lipuna suku Binyamin. Incia uminakia to amembaliaka rajana miana Israel. Incia bheapasalaamati uumatiku minaaka i kuasana miana Filistin, roonamo Iaku padhamo kukamata kanarakaana uumatiku, tee o pekeena manga incia aemani tulungi kuperangoimea."<verse eid="1SA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 9:17" />Wakutuuna Samuel akamata Saul, KAWASANA OPU afirimanimo, "Siimo o mia ipogauakaku tee ingkoo; miamo incia sii bhemoparintana uumatiku."<verse eid="1SA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 9:18" />Wakutuu incia sumai uka o Saul apasari i Samuel i saripina bhambana lawa tee apogau, "Tulungi paumbaakaaku i iapai o bhanuana pande pekilala sumai?"<verse eid="1SA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 9:19" />Samuel alawani Saul, "Iakumo pande pekilala sumai! Penemo porikana i kabumbuna tampana ibaadati, roonamo eo sii ingkomiu bheukande upobhawa tee iaku. Naile saeona sagala giu iabhaakamu bhekupaumbaakako, tee sapadhana incia sumai ingkoo umembalimo umbuli. <verse eid="1SA 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 9:20" />Pokaiana tee keledai bhawine momambuuna talu eo molapana sumai bholimo umaheruakea roonamo atokamatamo. Maka ingkoo tee keluargamu momembalina giu iharapuna mpuu miana Israel!"<verse eid="1SA 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 9:21" />Saul alawani, "Iaku sii kuminaaka i lipuna Binyamin, lipu momaidhiidhina mpuu i tanga-tangana lipuna Israel, tee manga witinaiku uka o mia maidhiidhi i tanga-tangana suku Binyamin. Pokia ingkoo upogau mboo sumai tee iaku?"<verse eid="1SA 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 9:22" />Sapadhana sumai o Samuel akembamo Saul tee sampoosena to apesua i nuncana kamara maoge i saripina tampana pasombaana kurubani sumai, tee atumpua auncura i kauncuramaka motohususuaka to mia motohoromati. Manga kakemba sumai o kabharina kera-kera talu pulu mia. <verse eid="1SA 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 9:23" />Kasiimpo Samuel apogau tee pande nasuna kinande, "Bhawaakaakumo dagi idhikaku tee isameaakaku i saao, tee udhikamea iwe sii."<verse eid="1SA 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 9:24" />Kasiimpo pande nasuna kinande sumai aalamo dagina paana kurubani sumai, tee adhikamea i aroana Saul. Pogauna Samuel, "Kamatamea o dagi mopadhana igaatiku motodhikana i aroamu sii. Kandemea, roonamo dagi incia sii padhamo kudhikaakako pepuu minaaka kupogau, 'Iaku padhamo kukemba mia bhari.' " Sumaimo o Saul akandemo tee Samuel i eo incia sumai.<verse eid="1SA 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 9:25" />Sapadhana incia sumai manga incia asapomo minaaka i tampana ibaadati sumai tee ambulimo i kota, tee o Samuel akoja-kojamo tee Saul i bhawona padhana bhanuana.<verse eid="1SA 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saul Alantia Samuel Amembali Raja</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 9:26-10:16">9:26--10:16</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 9:26" />Saeona manga incia abhangumo, tee o wakutuu incia sumai o matana eo apepuumo abhete, Samuel agoraaka Saul i bhawona padhana bhanua sumai tee apogau, "Bhangumo, iaku bhekuʼantarako umbuli." Saul uka abhangumo kasiimpo manga incia alingkamo. <verse eid="1SA 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 9:27" />Wakutuuna manga incia asapo i potidhaana kota, apogaumo Samuel tee Saul, "Tumpumea o sampoosemu sumai alingkaaka porikana." Kasiimpo sampoosena sumai alingkamo, tee o Samuel apogau uka, "Untopo sabantara, mamudhaakana kupaumbaakako firimanina KAWASANA OPU."<verse eid="1SA 9:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1SA 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 10:1" />Sapadhana incia sumai o Nabii Samuel aalamo bhosu-bhosu mokoantoakana mina tee alalia i bhawona bhaana Saul, kasiimpo aikia tee apogau, "Buaka mencuana KAWASANA OPU mopadhana mominakiko to umembaliaka raja to tinaurakana Aulataʼala?<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">umembaliaka raja to tinaurakana Aulataʼala: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aeati incia sii aose kaburi Ibrani. Maka i nuncana kaburi Yunani mangenge atoburi mboo sii, "Ingkoo bheumembali raja to uumatina KAWASANA OPU tee bheupasalaamati manga incia minaaka i bhari-bharia kuasana musu i saripina. Tee o giu incia sii bheamembali tanda ande ingkoo bhemokapalaina manga tinaurakana Aulataʼala." </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 10:2" />Sapogaata i eo sii, ingkoo bheupokawa tee rua mia umane i saripina koburuna Rahel i Zelzah modhaangiana i potidhaana tanana lipuna Binyamin. Manga incia bheapogau tee ingkoo, 'Manga keledai bhawine ipeelomu sumai atokamatamo, tee sii-sii o amamu indamo afaduliaka manga keledaina sumai, maka incia tangkanamo afikiriaka ingkomiu, tee apogau, "Opea bheipewauku to anaku?" ' "<verse eid="1SA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 10:3" />"Kasiimpo ulingka torosu sakawana i puuna tarbantin i Tabor. Iwe sumai ingkoo bheupokawa tee talu mia umane bhemolingkana mopasombaakana kurubani to Aulataʼala i Kota Bait-El. Dhaangia samia mobhawana talu mbaa anana bhembe, samiana abhawa talu angu roti, tee samiana uka abhawa kadhu kuli mokoantoakana uwena angguru. <verse eid="1SA 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 10:4" />Manga incia bheaabhaaka kadhaangiamu tee adhawuakako rua angu roti. Tarimamea o giu incia sumai minaaka i limana manga incia."<verse eid="1SA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 10:5" />"Sapadhana incia sumai, ingkoo bheukawa i kabumbuna Aulataʼala i Kota Gibea. Iwe sumai dhaangia tee tampana pokemaana suludaduna Filistin. Wakutuuna upesua i kota, ingkoo bheupokawa tee manga rombongana nabii mosapona minaaka i tampana ibaadati. Manga incia abukeaka rohi, tee dhaangia pia mia o mia mosagaanana momagasiaakana gambusu, ganda, suli, tee kecapi i aroana. <verse eid="1SA 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 10:6" />Kasiimpo rohina KAWASANA OPU bheakuasaiko tee ingkoo bheupakawaaka kasameana Aulataʼala upobhawa tee manga incia, tee ingkoo bheumembali mboomo mia mosagaanana. <verse eid="1SA 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 10:7" />Ande manga tanda incia sumai amondomo i karomu, pewaumea opea iabhimu momalapena, roonamo Aulataʼala apoose tee ingkoo."<verse eid="1SA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 10:8" />"Sapadhana incia sumai, ulingkamo i Kota Gilgal uporikanaakaaku tee uantagiaku iwe sumai kangengena pitu eo sakawana kuumba kupasombaakako kurubani tunua tee kurubani pomalapea tee kupaumbaakako opea bheipewaumu."<verse eid="1SA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 10:9" />Maka inda amangenge sapadhana Saul abholi Samuel, Aulataʼala abhaliimo ngangarandana Saul tee incia atarimamo sifatu mobhaau. Kasiimpo bhari-bharia tanda mopadhana ipaumbaakana Samuel amondomo i eo incia sumai uka. <verse eid="1SA 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 10:10" />Wakutuuna Saul tee sampoosena sumai akawa i Kota Gibea, manga incia apokawamo tee sarombongana nabii. Wakutuu incia sumai o Saul akuasaia Rohina Aulataʼala, sabutuna o Saul apakawaakamo kasameana Aulataʼala apobhawa tee manga incia. <verse eid="1SA 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 10:11" />Bhari-bharia mia mopomatauna tee Saul minaaka i piamo itu aposamente, roonamo incia apakawaakamo kasameana Aulataʼala apobhawa tee manga nabii sumai. Kasiimpo manga mia apoabha-abhakimo podho-podho manga incia tee apogau, "Apokia sii o anana Kis sii? Buaka o Saul sii amembalimo samia nabii?"<verse eid="1SA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 10:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 19:23-24">1Sam. 19:23-24</ref>.</char>
    </note>Dhaangia samia o mia momboorena iwe sumai mopogauna, "Incema o amana manga nabii incia sumai?" Sababuna adhaangiamo tee ibarati incia sii, "Buaka o Saul amembalimo nabii?" <verse eid="1SA 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 10:13" />Sapadhana apakawaaka kasameana Aulataʼala apobhawa tee manga nabii, Saul alingkamo i tampana ibaadati.<verse eid="1SA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 10:14" />Saul tee sampoosena sumai akamatea pinoamana, kasiimpo pinaoamana aabhamo, "Minaaka i iapai ingkomiu?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:14">Manga incia alawani, "Tapeelo manga keledai bhawine momambuuna sumai, maka rampaakanamo inda tapotibhaakea, sabutuna ingkami talingkamo tapokawaaka Nabii Samuel."<verse eid="1SA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 10:15" />Pinoamana Saul apogau, "Paumbaakaaku opea ipogauakana Samuel to ingkomiu."<verse eid="1SA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 10:16" />Lawanina Saul, "Incia mangapaumbaaka ande o keledai bhawine sumai atopotibhaakamo." Maka o Saul inda apetulatulaakea to pinoamana ande incia padhamo alantia Samuel to amembali raja.<verse eid="1SA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saul Atopili Amembali Raja</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 10:17-27">10:17-27</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 10:17" />Kasiimpo Nabii Samuel akemba raʼeatina lipuna Israel to aporomusakaaka tee apoaro tee KAWASANA OPU i Kota Mizpa, <verse eid="1SA 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 10:18" />tee apogau, "Mboo siimo firimanina KAWASANA OPU, Aulataʼala isombana miana Israel, 'Iaku padhamo kubhawa miana Israel alimba minaaka i Mesir. Iaku padhamo kurambasakakomiu minaaka i limana miana Mesir tee bhari-bharia pamarinta mosagaanana mopisakikomiu.' <verse eid="1SA 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 10:19" />Maka i eo sii ingkomiu umendeu Kawasana Opumiu to mopasalaamatikomiu minaaka i bhari-bharia kasukara tee kanarakaa. Ingkomiu uka upogau tee Incia, 'Inda, mangaangkaakamo samia raja.' Jadi sii-sii, ukakaromo i aroana KAWASANA OPU uose manga suku tee manga kaumumiu samia-samia."<verse eid="1SA 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 10:20" />Samuel atumpu bhari-bharia sukuna Israel amaju i aroa, tee o suku Binyamin mopotibhaakana undi. <verse eid="1SA 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 10:21" />Sapadhana sumai, incia atumpumo suku Binyamin apoaro tee aose suku tee kaumuna samia-samia, sabutuna o miana Matri mopotibhaakana undi, tee aahirina o Saul bin Kis mopotibhaakana undi. Maka wakutuuna Saul atopeelo, incia inda atopotibhaaka. <verse eid="1SA 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 10:22" />Rampaakanamo sumai, manga incia aabhamo uka i KAWASANA OPU, "Buaka o mia incia sumai dhaangia iwe sii?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:22">KAWASANA OPU alawani, "Kamatea, incia aopo i talikuna manga bara sumai."<verse eid="1SA 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 10:23" />Sumaimo manga incia abuntulimo to aalea minaaka iwe sumai. Wakutuuna Saul akakaro i aroana manga mia incia sumai, kalangana badana Saul alabhi minaaka i kalangana badana manga incia, tee bhari-bharia miana Israel soo adhika i awaana. <verse eid="1SA 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 10:24" />Pogauna Samuel to bhari-bharia mia iwe sumai, "Kamatamea o mia ipilina KAWASANA OPU sii! Inda dhaangia o sampokanana minaaka i tanga-tangana lipu sii."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 10:24">Kasiimpo asambo-sambomo saangua lipu sumai, pogauna, "Adhadhimo o raja!"<verse eid="1SA 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 10:25" />Kasiimpo Samuel apakawaakamo manga tuturana to raʼeati pokaiana tee haku tee iwaajibuakana raja, tee aburia i nuncana saangu kitabi tee adhikaia i aroana KAWASANA OPU. Sapadhana incia sumai o Samuel arambasakamo bhari-bharia raʼeatina lipu sumai to ambuliaka i bhanuana samia-samia.<verse eid="1SA 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 10:26" />Raja Saul uka ambuli i bhanuana i Kota Gibea apoose tee manga hiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">manga hiri: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dhaangia o kaburi mangenge amaʼanaiakea manga mia mobarani; tee dhaangia uka o kaburi Ibrani momaʼanaiakea o tantara. </char></note> mopadhana itumpuna Aulataʼala. <verse eid="1SA 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 10:27" />Maka dhaangia pia mia o mia momadhakina pogauna, "Inda amungki o mia incia sii amembali mangapasalaamati." Manga incia apandaʼente Saul tee amendeu abhawa hadia to incia. Maka o Saul inda tee uuʼuuna.<verse eid="1SA 10:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1SA 11" />
  <para style="s">Saul Apepuu Aparinta Amembali Raja</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 11:1-15:35">11:1--15:35</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="s1">Raja Saul Apekatalo Miana Amon</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 11:1-15">11:1-15</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 11:1" />Kasiimpo Nahas<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nahas: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I nuncana saangu kaburi momangenge, dhaangia saangu paragraf bhaau motoburina mboo sii: Nahas Rajana Amon sii amasega mpuu tee apisaki miana Gad tee miana Ruben. Incia apintoki bhari-bharia mata kaanana manga miana Israel sabutuna manga incia amaeka mpuu. Inda samia uka o mia momembalina motulungina manga incia. Bhari-bharia miana Israel momboorena i weta i timbuna Umala Yordan akailanga mata kaanana, maka tangkanamo soo pitu rewu mia momembalina mopalaiakana karona minaaka i miana Amon. Sapadhana sumai manga incia apindamo i Kota Yabes modhaangiana i Gilead. Maka sambula sapadhana sumai...</char></note> rajana Amon sumai aumba apokema tee akapalai suludaduna to ahumbuni Kota Yabes i lipu Gilead. Bhari-bharia raʼeatina Yabes apogau tee Nahas, "Padhaangiamo pojanjia tee ingkami, sumaimo ingkami bhetaose parintamu."<verse eid="1SA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 11:2" />Maka o Nahas miana Amon sumai alawani, "Iaku bhekupadhaangia pojanjia tee ingkomiu ande uunda utarima saangu hali, siitumo bhari-bharia mata kaanamiu tabeana kupintokia amembaliaka giu imaeaakana bhari-bharia miana Israel."<verse eid="1SA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 11:3" />Lawanina manga mancuanana Kota Yabes, "Mangadhawupo wakutuu kangengena pitu eo mamudhaakana amembali talamboko potoloweamami i saangua lipuna Israel. Ande inda dhaangia mangapasalaamatina, siimpo ingkami tapasaraakaaka karomami to ingkoo."<verse eid="1SA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 11:4" />Wakutuuna manga potoloweana sumai akawa i Kota Gibea imbooresina Raja Saul, manga incia apakawaakamo lele incia sumai i miana Israel, sabutuna manga miana Israel amaasimo tee atangimo tee suara momakaa. <verse eid="1SA 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 11:5" />Wakutuu incia sumai o Saul siimpomo aumba minaaka i inawuna tee incia adhaangia i talikuna sapina, kasiimpo aabha, "Dhaangia tee opea? Apokia manga mia aposatangi?" Kasiimpo manga incia apetulatulaakamo lele ibhawana potoloweana manga miana Yabes sumai.<verse eid="1SA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 11:6" />Sarangona lele incia sumai o Saul akuasaimea Rohina Aulataʼala, tee incia aʼamaramo mpuu. <verse eid="1SA 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 11:7" />Saul aalamo rua mbaa sapi tee atumpo-tumpoa, kasiimpo alambokoakea to saangua lipuna Israel alaloi pia mia potoloweana tee aposamea, "Incema-incema inda moosena Raja Saul tee Nabii Samuel to apotimbe, sumaimo o sapina manga incia bheatotumpo-tumpo uka mboo sii." Kasiimpo KAWASANA OPU apekaeka bhari-bharia miana Israel, sabutuna bhari-bharia miana Israel alingka to apotimbe roonamo amaeka tee Saul. <verse eid="1SA 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 11:8" />Wakutuuna Saul aromusaka tee agagari kabharina manga incia wakutuuna i Bezek, kabharina miana Israel dhaangia 300.000 mia, tee o miana Yuda dhaangia 30.000 mia.<verse eid="1SA 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 11:9" />Sapadhana incia sumai o Saul apogaumo tee manga potoloweana sumai, "Pakawaakamea to manga raʼeatina Kota Yabes-Gilead, ande naile pontanga eo manga incia bheatopasalaamatimo." Kasiimpo manga potoloweana sumai alingkamo tee apakawaaka giu incia sumai to miana Yabes. Sarangona lele incia sumai manga incia akaunde-undemo mpuu. <verse eid="1SA 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 11:10" />Maka apogaumo raʼeatina Yabes tee Nahas, "Naile ingkami bhetapasaraakaaka karomami to ingkoo, tee upewaumo opeapo uka iabhimu momalapena to ingkami."<verse eid="1SA 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 11:11" />Samainawana o Saul abagemo raʼeati mopadhana iromusakana sumai amembali talu kolompo suludadu. Saraneeona manga incia apesuaikimo pokemaana miana Amon. Indapo apontanga eo, suludaduna Saul padhamo apekatalo musuna. Manga miana Amon sumai apontalesaka sampe inda dhaangia motokamatana rua mia momembalina mopoosena mobuntuli.<verse eid="1SA 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 11:12" />Kasiimpo apogaumo raʼeatina Israel tee Samuel, "Ande dhaangia manga mia inda mosatujuina Saul to amembali rajata, sumaimo manga incia ubhawamea iwe sii mamudhaakana tapekamatea!"<verse eid="1SA 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 11:13" />Maka o Saul alawani, "Inda samia uka i eo sii momembalina motopekamate, roonamo i eo sii o KAWASANA OPU padhamo apasalaamati miana Israel."<verse eid="1SA 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 11:14" />Sumaimo o Samuel apogaumo tee manga incia, "Maimo talingkaaka i Gilgal to talantiaka Saul pendua amembali rajata iwe sumai!" <verse eid="1SA 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 11:15" />Kasiimpo saangua lipuna Israel sumai alingkamo i Gilgal. Iwe sumai o Saul atolanti amembali raja i aroana KAWASANA OPU, tee apasombaakea manga kurubani pomalapea. Saul tee bhari-bharia miana Israel akaunde-unde mpuu iwe sumai.<verse eid="1SA 11:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1SA 12" />
  <para style="s1">Pidato Kapadhaana Nabii Samuel</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 12:1-25">12:1-25</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 12:1" />Samuel apogau tee manga miana Israel, "Iaku padhamo kuperangoi bhari-bharia ipogauakamiu tee padhamo kuangkaakakomiu samia raja. <verse eid="1SA 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 12:2" />Sii-sii o rajamo incia sumai bhemokapalaikikomiu tee rua mia anaku umane uka dhaangia i tanga-tangamiu. Iaku kukapalaikomiu apepuu dhaangiapo kumangura sakawana i eo sii, maka sii-sii iaku kumancuanamo tee kukouwamo. <verse eid="1SA 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 12:3" />Sii-sii iaku kukakaro i aroamiu! Ande dhaangia tee kasalahaku, raeakaakumo i aroana KAWASANA OPU tee i aroana raja mopadhana ilantina. Incema mopadhana ialaku sapina tee keledaina? Incema mopadhana itipuku tee ipisakiku? Buaka apernamo urangoaku kutarima doina kasogo mamudhaakana kututubhi mataku? Pogaumo, mamudhaakana ande dhaangia o giu mopadhana ialaku minaaka i ingkomiu amembali kupambuliakakomiu pendua."<verse eid="1SA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 12:4" />Manga incia alawani, "Ingkoo indapo aperna mangatipu tee mangapisaki, atawa utarima doina kasogo."<verse eid="1SA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 12:5" />Kasiimpo Samuel apogau, "KAWASANA OPU tee mia mopadhana ilantina amembali sakusii i eo sii, ande iaku saidhe mpuu uka inda tee kasalahaku."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 12:5">Pogauna manga incia, "Umbe atotuu, KAWASANA OPU momembalina sakusiita."<verse eid="1SA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 12:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 6:26">Limb. 6:26</ref>. </char>
    </note>Kasiimpo Samuel apogau uka, "KAWASANA OPU uka mopilina Nabii Musa tee Harun, tee mobhawana opu-opuamiu alimba minaaka i Tana Mesir. <verse eid="1SA 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 12:7" />Sii-sii ukakaromo, iaku bhekuraeakako i aroana KAWASANA OPU pokaiana tee sagala giuna pewau mobanara ipewauna KAWASANA OPU to ingkomiu tee opu-opuamiu."<verse eid="1SA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 12:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:23">Limb. 2:23</ref>. </char>
    </note>"Saumbana Yakub i Tana Mesir tee sapadhana opu-opuamiu aemani tulungi tee KAWASANA OPU, sumaimo KAWASANA OPU alambokomo Musa tee Harun to apalimbaaka opu-opuamiu minaaka i Tana Mesir tee ataroakea amboore i tampa incia sii."<verse eid="1SA 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 12:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JDG 3:12">Haa. 3:12</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 4:2">4:2</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 13:1">13:1</ref>. </char>
    </note>"Maka manga incia amalinguaka KAWASANA OPU Aulataʼalana, sabutuna manga incia apekataloa tee apasaraakaakea i Sisera momembalina kapalana tantarana Kotana Hazor, tee apasaraakaakea uka i limana miana Filistin tee i limana raja Moab. <verse eid="1SA 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 10:10-15">Haa. 10:10-15</ref>. </char></note>Kasiimpo manga incia adoʼa i KAWASANA OPU tee apogau, 'Ingkami takodosamo roonamo tabholi KAWASANA OPU tee tasomba manga patuna dewa Baal tee patuna dewi Astoret. Maka sii-sii mangarambasakamo minaaka i limana manga musumami, sumaimo ingkami bhetasombako.' <verse eid="1SA 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 12:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 4:6">Haa. 4:6</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 7:1">7:1</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 11:29">11:29</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 3:20">1Sam. 3:20</ref>. </char></note>Kasiimpo KAWASANA OPU alamboko Yerubaal,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yerubaal: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Atosarongi uka "Gideon."</char></note> Barak, Yefta tee iaku to arambasakakomiu minaaka i limana bhari-bharia manga musu mobulilingikomiu, sabutuna amembali udhadhi malape tee uʼamani."<verse eid="1SA 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 12:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 8:19">1Sam. 8:19</ref>. </char>
    </note>"Maka wakutuuna ukamata Nahas rajana miana Amon bheahumbunikomiu, sumaimo ingkomiu upogau tee iaku, 'Inda, ingkami tabeana tee rajamami.' Garaaka o KAWASANA OPU satotuuna o rajamiu. <verse eid="1SA 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 12:13" />Sii-sii kamatamea o raja mopadhana ipili tee iemanimiu sumai, KAWASANA OPU padhamo aangkaakakomiu samia raja. <verse eid="1SA 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 12:14" />Ande uhoromati KAWASANA OPU, usombaia, utaʼatia, tee inda ugua tee parintana, tee ande ingkoo tee raja mokapalaikikomiu sumai udhadhi uose KAWASANA OPU Aulataʼalamiu, sumaimo bheamalape o kadhaangiamiu. <verse eid="1SA 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 12:15" />Maka ande inda utaʼati KAWASANA OPU tee ugua tee parintana, sumaimo limana KAWASANA OPU bheabhalikomiu mboomo abhali opu-opuamiu i piamo itu."<verse eid="1SA 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 12:16" />"Sii-sii kamatea o giu maoge inda momentela bheipewauna KAWASANA OPU i aroamiu! <verse eid="1SA 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 12:17" />Iaku bhekugora i KAWASANA OPU, tee moomini o bulaana paneeo KAWASANA OPU bheapasapo guntu tee wao to kalawanina doʼaku. Wakutuu incia sumai ingkomiu bheusadara ande tapanamo kaoge o dosamiu tee KAWASANA OPU roonamo uemani samia raja."<verse eid="1SA 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 12:18" />Kasiimpo Nabii Samuel agora i KAWASANA OPU, tee i eo incia sumai uka o KAWASANA OPU apasapo guntu tee wao, sabutuna saangua lipu sumai amaeka i KAWASANA OPU tee Samuel.<verse eid="1SA 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 12:19" />Kasiimpo manga incia apogau tee Samuel, "Mangadoʼaakamo i KAWASANA OPU Aulataʼala, mamudhaakana ingkami inda tamate. Sii-sii ingkami tasadaramo ande mencuana tangkanamo dosamami i piamo itu, maka ingkami uka takodosamo roonamo padhamo taemani samia raja."<verse eid="1SA 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 12:20" />Lawanina Samuel, "Bholi umaeka, moomini padhamo upewau giu madhaki mboo sii, maka bholi uunto uose KAWASANA OPU tee usombamo KAWASANA OPU tee saangua ngangarandamiu. <verse eid="1SA 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 12:21" />Bholi usaladhala tee usomba manga barahala inda mokofaʼeda inda momembalina mopasalaamatikomiu, roonamo bhari-bharia sumai o giu mosia-sia. <verse eid="1SA 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 12:22" />KAWASANA OPU inda bheabholi uumatina to sarona momulia sumai, roonamo KAWASANA OPU padhamo apamembalikomiu uumatina. <verse eid="1SA 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 12:23" />Pokaiana tee karoku, iaku inda bhekuunto to kudoʼaakakomiu mamudhaakana inda kukodosa tee KAWASANA OPU. Iaku uka bhekuadhariakakomiu dhala momalape tee momakate. <verse eid="1SA 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 12:24" />Horomatia o KAWASANA OPU tee utaʼatimo uʼibaadati tee Incia tee mpuu-mpuuna incamiu. Udhania tapanamo kaoge manga giu mopadhana ipewauna to ingkomiu. <verse eid="1SA 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 12:25" />Maka ande ingkomiu usadhaadhaa upewau giu madhaki, sumaimo ingkomiu tee rajamiu bheutopabinasa."<verse eid="1SA 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1SA 13" />
  <para style="s1">Raja Saul Apotimbe Abhali Miana Filistin</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 13:1-22">13:1-22</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 13:1" />Umuruna Saul talu pulu tao<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">talu pulu tao: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I nuncana kaburi mangenge motoburina tee pogau Ibrani inda dhaangia o kaburi 'talu pulu tao' mboo sii. </char></note> wakutuuna amembali raja tee kangengena pata pulu rua tao<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">pata pulu rua tao: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaburi pata pulu rua tao i nuncana aeati incia sii amembali tamataua minaaka i kaburina Ibrani momangenge, minaaka i manga ahaliina sejarana Ibrani, tee minaaka i Tulatulana Manga Rasulu. Kamata <char style="xt"><ref loc="ACT 13:21">Tul. 13:21</ref></char>.</char></note> incia amembali rajana Israel. <verse eid="1SA 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 13:2" />Raja Saul apili talu rewu mia minaaka i tanga-tangana miana Israel; rua rewu mia mopoosena tee Saul i Kota Mikhmas tee i manga gununa Bait-El, sainamo sarewu miana apoose tee anana Saul mokosaroakana Yonatan i Kota Gibea modhaangiana i lipu Binyamin, tee o labhina atumpua ambuli i bhanuana samia-samia.<verse eid="1SA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 13:3" />Yonatan apekatalo sakolompo suludaduna miana Filistin modhaangiana i Kota Gibea, tee o giu incia sumai arangoa miana Filistin. Kasiimpo Raja Saul atumpu mia to atowiiaka sangkakala i saangua lipu, pogauna, "Taroakamo arangoa miana Ibrani." <verse eid="1SA 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 13:4" />Jadi bhari-bharia miana Israel arango lele, "Raja Saul padhamo apekatalo suludaduna miana Filistin, sabutuna o miana Filistin abanci miana Israel." Rampaakanamo sumai manga raʼeati aose kakemba to aposaangu tee Saul i Gilgal.<verse eid="1SA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 13:5" />Wakutuu incia sumai uka o miana Filistin aporomusakamo to apotimbe abhali miana Israel tee talu rewu karetana potimbea, nama rewu mia suludadu mokoajara, tee o suludadu modhalana ae kabharina mboomo bhone i bhiwina tawo. Manga incia apokema i Mikhmas i sawetana timbuna Kota Bet-Awen. <verse eid="1SA 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 13:6" />Kasiimpo miana Israel asadaria ande manga incia i nuncana balaa ogena roonamo tantarana aopimea musu, sabutuna abhari manga miana Israel moopona i nuncana lia, i nuncana rumpu mokorui, i talikuna bhatu ogena, i bhalona tana, tee i nuncana sumu. <verse eid="1SA 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 13:7" />Sampe dhaangia uka o miana Ibrani mopolimbana i Umala Yordan tee apesua i Tana Gad tee Gilead, maka o Saul asadhaadhaa amboore i Gilgal, tee bhari-bharia tantarana moosea arengkuaka kaeka.<verse eid="1SA 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 13:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 10:8">1Sam. 10:8</ref>. </char>
    </note>Kangengena pitu eo o Raja Saul aantagi Nabii Samuel mboomo wakutuu mopadhana itantuakana Samuel, maka o Samuel indapo uka akawa i Gilgal, sabutuna manga tantarana sumai apepuumo apogaa-gaa abholi Saul. <verse eid="1SA 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 13:9" />Rampaakanamo sumai o Saul apogau, "Bhawaakaakumo kurubani tunua tee kurubani pomalapea." Kasiimpo incia apasombaakamea o kurubani tunua sumai. <verse eid="1SA 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 13:10" />Siimpo mpuu incia apadha apasombaaka kurubani tunua, saanampuu aumbamo Nabii Samuel. Kasiimpo Raja Saul alingka apokawaakea tee aposalamuakea.<verse eid="1SA 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 13:11" />Maka o Samuel aabha, "Opea mopadhana ipewaumu?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 13:11">Saul alawani, "Wakutuuna kukamata manga tantara sumai apepuumo apogaa-gaa abholiaku maka ingkoo inda uumba i wakutuu mopadhana itantuakamu, garaaka o miana Filistin aporomusakamo i Mikhmas, <verse eid="1SA 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 13:12" />sumaimo kufikiri, 'Indamo amangenge o miana Filistin bheahumbuniakumo i Gilgal, garaaka iaku indapo kuemani tulungi i KAWASANA OPU.' Rampaakanamo sumai iaku kunamisia tabeana kupasombaaka kurubani tunua."<verse eid="1SA 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 13:13" />Kasiimpo Nabii Samuel apogau tee Raja Saul, "Tapanamo kabhongo-bhongo giu ipewaumu sumai! Apokia ingkoo inda ukeniakea pekatangka o parintana KAWASANA OPU mopadhana idhawuakana to ingkoo? Garaaka o KAWASANA OPU gauna apatotapuakako to umembali rajana Israel saʼumurua, <verse eid="1SA 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 13:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:22">Tul. 13:22</ref>. </char></note>maka sii-sii o pamarintamu indamo bheatorotorosu tee kuasana. KAWASANA OPU padhamo apili mia imasanaakana incana tee o KAWASANA OPU padhamo apatotapuakea to mokapalaikina uumatina, roonamo ingkoo inda ukeniakea pekatangka o parintana KAWASANA OPU mopadhana idhawuakana to ingkoo."<verse eid="1SA 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 13:15" />Sapadhana sumai o Nabii Samuel alingkamo minaaka i Kota Gilgal tee apene i Gibea, maka o Saul tee manga suludaduna moosea alingka to aporomuaka tee manga tantara i kapalaina Yonatan i lipu Binyamin. Wakutuuna Raja Saul agagari manga suludaduna mopoosena tee incia, garaaka soomo nama atu mia inda mopalaiakana karona!<verse eid="1SA 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 13:16" />Saul tee Yonatan apoose tee tantarana amboore i Kota Gibea modhaangiana i lipu Binyamin, sainamo miana Filistin apokema i Mikhmas. <verse eid="1SA 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 13:17" />Wakutuu incia sumai alimbamo talu rombongana parampo minaaka i pokemaana miana Filistin. Rombonga mobhaa-bhaana adhala aporope i Ofra i Tana Syual, <verse eid="1SA 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 13:18" />rombonga rua anguna adhala aporope i Bait-Horon, tee o rombonga saanguna uka aala dhala moporopena i lipu mopoarona i Mbolongana Zeboim i weta i tana matuu.<verse eid="1SA 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 13:19" />Wakutuu incia sumai inda dhaangia o pande ase i Tana Israel roonamo alarangia miana Filistin, tee o miana Filistin apogau, "Ancosala manga miana Ibrani akarajaa hancu tee pandanga." <verse eid="1SA 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 13:20" />Jadi manga miana Israel tabeana alingka i miana Filistin to awinto matana tambalina, bhingkuna, tee ndamuna. <verse eid="1SA 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 13:21" />Manga incia tabeana apomea tee haragaa momaali mpuu, siitumo walu haramu doi pera to awintoaka matana bhingkuna tee tambalina, tee apomea pata haramu doi pera to awintoaka ndamu tee kasulaana sapina.<verse eid="1SA 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 13:22" />Jadi, i wakutuuna potimbea sumai inda samia uka mominaakana i miana Israel mokenina hancu atawa o pandanga, maka tangkanamo Raja Saul tee Yonatan o anana sumai mokenina hancu tee pandanga.<verse eid="1SA 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yonatan Abarani Abhali Suludaduna Filistin</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 13:23-14:23">13:23--14:23</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 13:23" />Miana Filistin alamboko suludaduna to amaju tee ajagani kabhangka momembalina polotaana Kota Mikhmas tee Kota Gibea.<verse eid="1SA 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1SA 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 14:1" />Saangu wakutuu Yonatan bin Saul apogau tee pande kenina ewangana, "Maimo tapolimbaaka i tampana suludadu mojaganina posuna miana Filistin i sawetana sumai." Maka o giu incia sumai inda apaumbaakea i amana.<verse eid="1SA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 14:2" />Wakutuu incia sumai o Saul dhaangiapo i saripina Kota Gibea, tee incia tangasaana auncura i tambena puuna dalima i Migron, tee o tantara mopoosena tee incia kera-kera dhaangia 600 mia. <verse eid="1SA 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 14:3" />I tanga-tangana manga incia sumai dhaangia tee Ahia bin Ahitub. Ahitub sumai o witinaina Ikabod, tee Ahitub tee Ikabod sumai o anana Pinehas bin Eli imamuna KAWASANA OPU i Silo. I wakutuu incia sumai Ahia apake bhaju efod roonamo amembalimo imamu mobholosina Eli. Bhari-bharia manga incia inda amataua ande o Yonatan alingkamo abholi pokemaana miana Israel.<verse eid="1SA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 14:4" />Yonatan aʼusaha mpuu mamudhaakana amembali akawa i tampana posuna suludaduna miana Filistin, rampaakanamo sumai incia tabeana alaloi rua angu pimpi momalanga, modhaangiana iwe sii tee modhaangiana iwe sumai. Pimpi sii akosaroaka Bozes tee Sene. <verse eid="1SA 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 14:5" />Pimpi modhaangiana i weta napa apoaro i Mikhmas, sainamo pimpi i weta salata apoaro i Kota Gibea.<verse eid="1SA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 14:6" />Kasiimpo Yonatan apogau tee pande kenina ewangana sumai, "Maimo takompaaka tahumbuni suludaduna manga mia inda mototandaki sumai. Incema amataua o KAWASANA OPU amembali mangapakana, roonamo KAWASANA OPU inda amarasai to mangatulungi, malape ingkita tabhari atawa saidhe."<verse eid="1SA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 14:7" />Sumaimo alawanimo pande kenina ewangana sumai, "Pewaumea bhari-bharia ipeelumu itu. Iaku kusatuju."<verse eid="1SA 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 14:8" />Yonatan apogau, "Umbe, ingkita tapatokamataaka karota wakutuuna takompa tahumbuni manga incia. <verse eid="1SA 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 14:9" />Ande manga incia mangatumpu taunto tee taantagia sakawana mangaumbati, sumaimo ingkita tasadhaadhaa takabhale-bhale i tampata, tee bholi tapene tapokawaakea. <verse eid="1SA 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 14:10" />Maka ande manga incia apogau, 'Penemo iwe sii,' siimpomo ingkita tapeneikia, roonamo giumo incia sumai o tandana ande manga incia padhamo apasaraakaakea KAWASANA OPU i limata."<verse eid="1SA 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 14:11" />Wakutuuna manga incia apatokamataaka karona i suludadu mojaganina posuna miana Filistin, apogaumo manga suludadu sumai, "Kamatea, manga miana Ibrani sumai alimbamo minaaka i bhalo tampana opoana manga incia." <verse eid="1SA 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 14:12" />Kasiimpo manga suludadu mojagani posu sumai apogau tee Yonatan tee pande kenina ewangana, "Penemo iwe sii, mamudhaakana kudhawukomiu kaadhari." Kasiimpo o Yonatan apogaumo tee pande kenina ewangana sumai, "Maimo tapeneaka tee uoseaku, roonamo manga incia padhamo apasaraakaakea KAWASANA OPU i limana miana Israel."<verse eid="1SA 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 14:13" />Yonatan tee pande kenina ewangana tabeana apekangka tee limana tee aena to apene i bhawona pimpi i tampana posuna miana Filistin sumai; Yonatan moporikanana mopenena tee o pande kenina ewangana moosea i talikuna. Sakawana i posuna suludaduna miana Filistin, Yonatan asimbiakamo hancuna to manga suludadu modhaangiana i posu sumai, sainamo pande kenina ewangana apekamate manga suludadu mopadhana isimbina Yonatan. <verse eid="1SA 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 14:14" />I nuncana potimbea bhaa-bhaana, Yonatan tee pande kenina ewangana sumai apekamate kera-kera rua pulu mia i nuncana karidhona saparapa hektar.<verse eid="1SA 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 14:15" />Sumaimo amingkirimo manga miana Filistin modhaangiana i pokemaa, modhaangiana i tana lapa, bhari-bharia suludadu mojagani posu, tee manga rombongana parampo sumai. Kasiimpo dunia apepuumo akolendu tee bhari-bharia mia amingkirimo roonamo Aulataʼala mopasapona kamingkiri incia sumai.<verse eid="1SA 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 14:16" />Wakutuu incia sumai o mata-matana Raja Saul i Kota Gibea modhaangiana i lipu Binyamin akamata suludaduna Filistin apalaiaka karona i iapai-iapai. <verse eid="1SA 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 14:17" />Sumaimo Saul apogaumo tee tantara mopoosena tee incia, "Gagaria tee uparakisaaia, soomo saopea o kabharita." Sapadhana agagaria, garaaka o Yonatan tee pande kenina ewangana inda motokamatana.<verse eid="1SA 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 14:18" />Pogauna Saul tee Imamu Ahia, "Bhawamea iwe sii o Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU sumai <char style="add">mamudhaakana tamembali taabha i Aulataʼala opea bheipewauta </char>." (Wakutuu incia sumai Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU apoose tee miana Israel.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bhawamea iwe sii o Sorongana Pojanjiana KAWASANA OPU: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dhaangia uka o kaburi mangenge motoburina i nuncana pogau Yunani mopogauna mboo sii, " 'Bhawamea iwe sii o bhaju efod sumai.' (Wakutuu incia sumai o Ahia apake bhaju efod wakutuuna amembali imamu to alaiani miana Israel.)" </char></note> <verse eid="1SA 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 14:19" />Maka wakutuuna apogau tee imamu sumai, kaheru i pokemaana suludaduna Filistin ajulumo kaogena, sabutuna o Saul apogau tee imamu sumai, "Bholimo."<verse eid="1SA 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 14:20" />Kasiimpo Saul tee manga tantarana aporomusaka tee amaju apesua i nuncana potimbea. Iwe sumai manga incia akamatea amaoge mpuu o kaheru i tanga-tangana suludaduna Filistin, roonamo manga incia apopekamate podho-podho manga incia. <verse eid="1SA 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 14:21" />Manga miana Ibrani momboorena i lipuna miana Filistin, tee mopadhana mopoosena tee suludaduna miana Filistin uka ambuli aposaangu pendua tee tantarana Israel to atulungi Saul tee Yonatan. <verse eid="1SA 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 14:22" />Manga miana Israel moopona i manga gununa lipuna Efraim arangomea ande o suludaduna Filistin apalaiakamo karona, sabutuna manga incia uka aose apajere manga suludaduna Filistin i nuncana potimbea. <verse eid="1SA 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 14:23" />Mboomo sumai o KAWASANA OPU apasalaamati miana Israel i eo incia sumai. I potimbea sumai manga miana Filistin amatalo tee atopajere sakawana alaloi i Kota Bet-Awen.<verse eid="1SA 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yonatan Atopabebasi minaaka i Katunda</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 14:24-46">14:24-46</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 14:24" />Maka i eo incia sumai o tantarana Israel anamisi kanarakaa, roonamo Saul padhamo aposumpa tee tantarana mboo sii, "Atotundamo o mia mokandena kinande ande indapo asoo matana eo, tee ande indapo kubalasiaka kapiina incaku i manga musuku!" Rampaakanamo sumai inda samia uka minaaka i tantarana Israel mokandena i eo incia sumai.<verse eid="1SA 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 14:25" />Kasiimpo manga incia akawamo i saangu koo tee apotibhaakamo golana uwani motirina i tana, <verse eid="1SA 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 14:26" />maka inda samia uka mobaranina to mokandena golana uwani incia sumai, roonamo amaeka tee katunda ibhoasakana Saul. <verse eid="1SA 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 14:27" />Maka o Yonatan inda amataua ande o amana padhamo aposumpa tee tantarana. Rampaakanamo sumai incia apaulumo katukona tee apalondoa i nuncana bhanuana uwani sumai kasiimpo apenamia, sabutuna ambulimo pendua o kakaana. <verse eid="1SA 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 14:28" />Kasiimpo dhaangia samia minaaka i tanga-tangana manga tantarana sumai mopogauna, "Amamu padhamo manga sumpa tee mpuu-mpuuna incana, pogauna, 'Atotundamo mia mokandena opeapo uka i eo sii.' Rampaakanamo sumai manga tantarana amalutemo."<verse eid="1SA 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 14:29" />Kasiimpo Yonatan alawani, "Amaku padhamo apanarakaa lipu sii. Kamatea, tapanamo kainawa o mataku sapadhana kupenami saidhe golana uwani sii. <verse eid="1SA 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 14:30" />Ntaranamo uka ande i eo sii o tantarana atoundaaka to akande giu mopadhana irampasi minaaka i musu, dhaanamo bheahanda abhari o miana Filistin momembalina ipekamate."<verse eid="1SA 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 14:31" />I eo incia sumai o miana Israel apekatalo miana Filistin sapadhana apotimbe minaaka i Mikhmas sakawana i Ayalon, tee manga tantarana amalutemo mpuu. <verse eid="1SA 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 14:32" />Rampaakanamo sumai manga incia apolopologomo to aala bara irampasi ipotibhaakana minaaka i musu, manga incia aala gulumana dumba, sapi tee manga anana sapi. Kasiimpo asumbelea i bhawona tana tee alausaka akande dagi dhaangiapo mokoraa sumai. <verse eid="1SA 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 14:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 9:4">Bhaa. 9:4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:26-27">Im. 7:26-27</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:10-14">7:10-14</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:26">19:26</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:16">Kap. 12:16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:23">12:23</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 15:23">15:23</ref>. </char></note>Kasiimpo giu incia sumai akabarataakea i Saul mboo sii, "Kamatea, tantarata akodosa tee KAWASANA OPU roonamo akande dagi dhaangiapo mokoraa."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:33">Lawanina Saul, "Ingkomiu inda uose parintana KAWASANA OPU! Padolea o bhatu ogena itu sii-sii uka." <verse eid="1SA 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 14:34" />Kasiimpo Saul apogau uka, "Lingkamo i tanga-tangana manga tantara sumai tee upogau tee manga incia mamudhaakana abhawea o sapi tee dumbana kasiimpo asumbelea tee akandea iwe sii. Pakawaakamea o parinta incia sii to bhari-bharia tantarata, 'Bhawamea o binata irampasi sumai i bhawona bhatu sii mamudhaakana usumbelea tee upalemboa o raana. Bholi ukodosa tee KAWASANA OPU rampaakanamo ukande dagi dhaangiapo mokoraa.' "</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:34">Sumaimo i malo incia sumai bhari-bharia tantara abhawa sapi umanena tee asumbelea iwe sumai. <verse eid="1SA 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 14:35" />Kasiimpo Saul abhangu saangu tampana tunuana kurubani to KAWASANA OPU, siitumo tampana tunuana kurubani mobhaa-bhaana ibhanguna to KAWASANA OPU.<verse eid="1SA 14:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 14:36" />Kasiimpo Saul apogau uka, "Maimo malo sii talingkaaka tapajere miana Filistin tee tarampasia sakawana raneeo, bholi dhaangia samia uka iundaakata adhadhi."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Lawanina manga mia sumai, "Pewaumea opea iabhimu momalapena."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:36">Maka o imamu apogau, "Maimo taabhaakea porikana i Aulataʼala."<verse eid="1SA 14:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 14:37" />Kasiimpo Saul aabha i Aulataʼala mamudhaakana amatau opea ipeeluna, "Amembali iaku kulingka kupajere suludaduna Filistin? Buaka manga incia bheupasaraakaakea i limana miana Israel?" Maka i eo incia sumai o Aulataʼala inda alawania.<verse eid="1SA 14:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 14:38" />Kasiimpo Saul apogau tee manga kapalana tantarana sumai, "Maimo iwe sii bhari-bharikomiu tee uparakisaamea o dosa opea mopadhana ipewauta eo sii. <verse eid="1SA 14:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 14:39" />Iaku kuposumpa to sarona KAWASANA OPU modhadhi mopasalaamatina miana Israel, moomini o dosa sumai apewaua Yonatan, incia dhaanamo atohukumu mate." Maka inda samia uka minaaka i tanga-tangana tantarana sumai mobaranina molawania.<verse eid="1SA 14:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 14:40" />Kasiimpo Saul apogau tee bhari-bharia tantarana Israel, "Ingkomiu bhari-bharikomiu ukakaro i weta iwe sumai, iaku tee Yonatan kukakaro i weta iwe sii."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 14:40">Lawanina tantara sumai, "Pewaumea opea iabhimu momalapena."<verse eid="1SA 14:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 14:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 27:21">Kab. 27:21</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 28:6">1Sam. 28:6</ref>. </char>
    </note>Pogauna Saul, "E KAWASANA OPU, Aulataʼala isombana miana Israel, apokia inda ulawaniaku? Ande iaku tee Yonatan dhaangia tee kasalahamami mangasusuakamo tee Urim. Maka ande o tantaraku mosalana mangasusuakamo tee Tumim." Garaaka o Saul tee Yonatan ikangkanaina undi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">undi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I zamani mangenge o miana Israel kananeana aabha i Aulataʼala tee abhanaka Urim tee Tumim, rua angu giu momangkilo motodhikana i bhaju efodna imamu maoge (kamata <char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 28:30">Limb. 28:30</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 27:21">Kab. 27:21</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 23:6-12">1Sam. 23:6-12</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 28:6">28:6</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 30:7-8">30:7-8</ref> </char>). Moomini o limana maanusia moʼundia, maka o Kawasana Opu moalana kambotu (kamata <char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 16:33">Aar. 16:33</ref> </char>). </char></note> tee o tantarana inda asala. <verse eid="1SA 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 14:42" />Pogauna Saul, "Undiakumo tee Yonatan." Kasiimpo o Yonatan atomambotuaka mosalana.<verse eid="1SA 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 14:43" />Saul apogau tee Yonatan, "Paumbaakaaku opea mopadhana ipewaumu." Jadi Yonatan alawani, "Inciamo iaku padhamo kupenami saidhe o golana uwani ialaku tee lolona katukoku sii, tee mboo sumai iaku kusiapu kutohukumu mate <char style="add">rampaakanamo pewauku sumai </char>."<verse eid="1SA 14:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 14:44" />Pogauna Saul, "Yonatan, ingkoo tabeana umate, tee o Aulataʼala bheahobuti inyawaku ande inda utohukumu mate rampaakanamo dosamu sumai!"<verse eid="1SA 14:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 14:45" />Maka o tantara sumai apogau tee Saul, "Buaka o Yonatan tabeana amate, garaaka incia padhamo apewau kasalaamati momaoge to miana Israel? Inda! Ingkami taposumpa to sarona KAWASANA OPU modhadhi mopasalaamatina miana Israel, ande i eo sii incia inda bheakailanga satake uka o bulua minaaka i bhaana, roonamo tee katulungina Aulataʼala incia amembali akana minaaka i potimbea i eo sii." Mboomo sumai o Yonatan apasalaamatia tantarana minaaka i kahukumu mate.<verse eid="1SA 14:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 14:46" />Saul auntomo apajere suludaduna Filistin, tee o suludaduna Filistin uka ambulimo i mbooresana.<verse eid="1SA 14:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tulatulana Pamarintana tee Keluargana Raja Saul</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 14:47-52">14:47-52</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 14:47" />Samembalina rajana Israel, Saul apotimbe apoewangi tee bhari-bharia musuna Israel i sagala giuna tampa: apotimbe tee miana Moab, miana Amon, miana Edom, manga raja mominaakana i lipuna Zoba [sala saangu kota i Tana Suria], tee miana Filistin. I iapaipo uka apotimbe incia sadia akana. <verse eid="1SA 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 14:48" />Incia apotimbe tee kabaranina tee apekatalo miana Amalek, tee arambasaka miana Israel minaaka kuasana manga mia morampoa i piamo itu.<verse eid="1SA 14:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 14:49" />Siimo saro-sarona anana Saul umane: Yonatan, Yiswi, tee Malkisua. Sainamo sarona rua miaia anana bhawine siitumo Merab momembalina tumpe tee o Mikhal momembalina kaepu. <verse eid="1SA 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 14:50" />Sarona bhawinena Saul siitumo Ahinoam binti Ahimaas, tee o sarona kapalana tantarana siitumo Abner bin Ner, tee o Ner sii o pinoamana Saul. <verse eid="1SA 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 14:51" />Kis amana Saul, tee Ner amana Abner; manga incia podho anana Abiel.<verse eid="1SA 14:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 14:52" />Potimbeana tee suludaduna Filistin sumai anamisia Saul saʼumurua dhadhina. Rampaakanamo sumai, ande o Raja Saul akamata samia umane mangura momakaana tee mobaranina, sumaimo mia incia sumai alausaka aalea to apamembalia tantarana.<verse eid="1SA 14:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1SA 15" />
  <para style="s1">Saul Apotimbe tee Miana Amalek</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 15:1-9">15:1-9</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 10:1">1Sam. 10:1</ref>. </char>
    </note>Saangu wakutuu o Nabii Samuel apogau tee Raja Saul, "KAWASANA OPU alambokoaku to kuminakiko umembaliaka raja to uumatina, siitumo Israel. Rampaakanamo sumai uperangoimea o firimanina KAWASANA OPU. <verse eid="1SA 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 17:8-14">Limb. 17:8-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 25:17-19">Kap. 25:17-19</ref>.</char></note>Mboo siimo firimanina KAWASANA OPU Aulataʼalana saangua alamu, 'Iaku bhekubalasi opea ipewauna miana Amalek to miana Israel, roonamo miana Amalek ajoli-joli miana Israel salimbana minaaka i Tana Mesir. <verse eid="1SA 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 15:3" />Jadi sii-sii ulingkamo uhumbuni miana Amalek tee upahancuru bhari-bharia pewauana. Bholi tee kaasina incamiu tee miana Amalek, maka upekamatemea bhari-bharia umane tee bhawine, anaana tee manga anaana dhaangiapo modudu, sapi tee dumba, unta tee keledaina.' "<verse eid="1SA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 15:4" />Kasiimpo Saul aromusaka tantarana tee agagaria i Kota Telaim. Minaaka i Israel kabharina manga incia modhalana ae dhaangia rua atu rewu mia tee minaaka i Yehuda o kabharina dhaangia sapulu rewu mia. <verse eid="1SA 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 15:5" />Sapadhana incia sumai o Saul alingkamo i kotana miana Amalek tee atumpu tantarana to apentaa musuna i tambena mbolonga. <verse eid="1SA 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 15:6" />Saul uka alamboko kasameana to audhaniaka manga miana Keni,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">manga miana Keni: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Manga incia sii o pande rabuna tambaga tee pande ase tee saangu kaumu mopekapinda-pindana mbooresana i zamani mangenge. Oni 'Keni,' aposiingi tee pogau Aram mokomaʼanana 'samia pande ase.' </char></note> pogauna, "Lingkamo tee ubholimea o miana Amalek sumai, mamudhaakana inda kupahancurukomiu tee manga incia, roonamo i piamo itu opu-opuamiu apomalape tee miana Israel wakutuuna alimba minaaka i Mesir." Sumaimo miana Keni alingkamo minaaka i iwe sumai.<verse eid="1SA 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 15:7" />Kasiimpo Saul apotimbe tee miana Amalek, tee apekataloa pepuu minaaka i Kota Hawila sakawana i Kota Syur i weta i timbuna Mesir. <verse eid="1SA 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 15:8" />Bhari-bharia raʼeatina Amalek apekamateakea tee matana hancu, sainamo Agag rajana miana Amalek arakoa akadhadhi-dhadhi. <verse eid="1SA 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 15:9" />Raja Agag apasalaamatia Saul tee tantarana. Manga incia uka inda apekamate manga gulumana dumba tee sapi momalapena bhanguna, tee inda uka apekamate tee apahancuru manga anana dumba tee manga bara mokoharagaa, maka tangkanamo apahancuru manga kadhambaaka momadhakina bhanguna tee bara inda mokoharagaa.<verse eid="1SA 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saul Amendeua KAWASANA OPU to Amembali Raja</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 15:10-35">15:10-35</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 15:10" />Kasiimpo asapomo firimanina KAWASANA OPU to Samuel mboo sii, <verse eid="1SA 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 15:11" />"Iaku kusoso mpuu kuangka Saul to kupamembalia raja roonamo incia abholiaku tee inda aose parintaku." Samuel aʼamara, sabutuna incia samaloa agora i KAWASANA OPU.<verse eid="1SA 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 15:12" />Samainawana, dhaangiapo saeona mpuu o Samuel abhangumo to apokawaaka Saul, maka dhaangia mopaumbaia mboo sii, "Saul alingkamo i Kota Karmel tee apakaro saangu tugu kaudhania to karona kasiimpo incia alausaka aporope i Gilgal."<verse eid="1SA 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 15:13" />Wakutuuna Samuel apokawa tee Saul, apogaumo Saul, "Maasangia o KAWASANA OPU abarakatiko! Iaku padhamo kuose firimanina KAWASANA OPU."<verse eid="1SA 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 15:14" />Maka o Samuel aabha, "Ande mboo sumai, apokia kurango gulumana dumba mokomee tee gulumana sapi mokomburu iwe sii?"<verse eid="1SA 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 15:15" />Lawanina Saul, "Bhari-bharia sumai o binata mopadhana irampasi minaaka i miana Amalek, roonamo tantaraku apasalaamati gulumana dumba tee gulumana sapi momalapena bhanguna to apasombaakea apamembalia kurubani i aroana KAWASANA OPU Aulataʼalamu. Maka o bhilaana padhamo tapabinasea."<verse eid="1SA 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 15:16" />Sarangona incia sumai o Samuel apogaumo tee Saul, "Untomo upogau! Iaku bhekupaumbaakako opea mopadhana ifirimaniakana KAWASANA OPU i malo."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 15:16">Saul alawani, "Paumbaakaakumo."<verse eid="1SA 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 15:17" />Pogauna Samuel, "I piamo itu ingkoo uabhi karomu inda tee maʼanana, maka sii-sii ingkoo umembalimo kapala to manga sukuna miana Israel, tee o KAWASANA OPU padhamo alantiko umembali rajana miana Israel, <verse eid="1SA 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 15:18" />tee o KAWASANA OPU aparintaakako tee afirimani, 'Lingkamo, pabinasea manga miana Amalek mokodosa sumai, tee upotimbemo ubhali manga incia sakawana abinasa.' <verse eid="1SA 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 15:19" />Pokia ingkoo inda utaʼati parintana KAWASANA OPU, sampe uala bara irampasi tee upewau giu momadhaki i matana KAWASANA OPU?"<verse eid="1SA 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 15:20" />Saul alawani Samuel, "Iaku padhamo kutaʼati parintana KAWASANA OPU tee kupewau opea mopadhana isusuakana. Iaku kubhawa Agag rajana Amalek iwe sii, sainamo bhari-bharia raʼeatina padhamo kupekamatea. <verse eid="1SA 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 15:21" />Maka minaaka i bara irampasi sumai, tantaraku inda apekamate bhari-bharia binata kadhambaaka. Manga incia aala gulumana dumba tee gulumana sapi momalapena bhanguna mopadhana ihususuaka to apasombaakea i KAWASANA OPUNA Aulataʼalamu i Gilgal."<verse eid="1SA 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 15:22" />Lawanina Samuel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">"Buaka o KAWASANA OPU alabhi amaasiaka kurubani tunua tee kurubani isumbele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">tee tataʼati parintana?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:22">Satotuuna tataʼati parintana KAWASANA OPU alabhi o kalapena minaaka i kurubani isumbele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:22">tee taperangoi pogauna alabhi o kalapena minaaka i tabhana dumba umane.<verse eid="1SA 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 15:23" />Roonamo kadorohaka apokana mboomo dosana mia mopekilala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">tee o ngangaranda mosombo apokana o kadhakina mboomo mia mosombana barahala tee terafim.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">terafim: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I nuncana pogau Ibrani akomaʼana, "barahala isomba" to mojaganina bhanua. </char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:23">Rampaakanamo ingkoo umendeu utarima firimanina KAWASANA OPU</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:23">sumaimo Incia uka amendeumo atarimako umembali raja."<verse eid="1SA 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 15:24" />Sarangona pogauna Samuel sumai, Saul apogaumo, "Iaku kukodosamo roonamo indamo kutaʼati tee parintana KAWASANA OPU tee pogaumu. Iaku kumaeka tee tantaraku sabutuna kuose pogauna manga incia. <verse eid="1SA 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 15:25" />Maka sii-sii kuemani mpuu uʼamponia o dosaku tee umbulimo upoose tee iaku mamudhaakana amembali kusomba KAWASANA OPU."<verse eid="1SA 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 15:26" />Samuel alawani Saul, "Iaku kumendeumo kupoose tee ingkoo roonamo inda uose firimanina KAWASANA OPU, tee o KAWASANA OPU uka amendeu atarimako to umembali rajana miana Israel."<verse eid="1SA 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 15:27" />Wakutuuna Samuel bhealingka, Saul akeniakamo tapana jubana Samuel, sabutuna o jubana amabhenci. <verse eid="1SA 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 15:28" />Sabutuna Samuel apogaumo, "Apokana mboomo ingkoo ukeniaka tapana jubaku sii sabutuna amabhenci, mboomo itu uka o KAWASANA OPU i eo sii ahobuti kuasamu minaaka i pamarintamu tee adhawuakea to mia mosagaanana molabhina kalapena minaaka i ingkoo. <verse eid="1SA 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 15:29" />KAWASANA OPU o Aulataʼala Momulia isombana miana Israel inda agau-gau tee inda abhaliia o fikirina roonamo Incia mencuana maanusia."<verse eid="1SA 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 15:30" />Lawanina Saul, "Iaku kukodosamo, maka ande amembali kuemani mamudhaakana uhoromatiaku i aroana manga mancuanana lipuku tee i aroana miana Israel. Mbulimo pendua upoose tee iaku mamudhaakana amembali kuʼibaadati i KAWASANA OPUNA Aulataʼalamu." <verse eid="1SA 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 15:31" />Jadi o Samuel ambulimo pendua apoose tee Saul, tee o Saul uka asombamo KAWASANA OPU.<verse eid="1SA 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 15:32" />Sapadhana sumai o Samuel apogaumo, "Bhawea iwe sii o rajana miana Amalek sumai." Kasiimpo aumbamo o Agag tee akaunde-unde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kasiimpo aumbamo o Agag tee akaunde-unde: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaburi Ibranina pogau incia sii amarasai mpuu to amaʼanaia. Oni Ibrani mokomaʼanana 'akaunde-unde' iwe sii amembali uka atomaʼanai tee atoburi 'atolangke/atobhoke' atawa 'arengku.' </char></note> roonamo incia afikiria, "Balaa imateaka alapamo."<verse eid="1SA 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 15:33" />Kasiimpo Samuel apogau,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 15:33">"Apokana mboomo hancumu padhamo apamembali manga bhawine akailanga anana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 15:33">mboomo sumai uka tee inamu; sii-sii incia bheamembali bhawine mokailangana anana."</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1SA 15:33">Kasiimpo Samuel atata-tata Agag i aroana KAWASANA OPU i Gilgal.<verse eid="1SA 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 15:34" />Sapadhana sumai o Samuel ambulimo i Kota Rama, sainamo Saul ambuli i bhanuana i Kota Gibea. <verse eid="1SA 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 15:35" />Sampe amate o Samuel indamo aperna apokawa tee Saul, roonamo Samuel amaporo mpuu incana tee Saul. KAWASANA OPU uka asoso roonamo padhamo aangka Saul to apamembalia rajana miana Israel.<verse eid="1SA 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1SA 16" />
  <para style="s">Daud tee Raja Saul</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 16:1-30:31">16:1--30:31</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="s1">Daud Atolanti Amembali Raja</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 16:1-13">16:1-13</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 16:1" />Sapadhana sumai afirimanimo KAWASANA OPU tee Nabii Samuel, "Sakawana naepia incamu amaporo rampaakanamo Saul inda kutarimaia amembali rajana miana Israel? Antokimea o tampana mina zaitunmu tee ulingkamo. Iaku kulambokoko to upokawaaka miana Bait Lahim mokosaroakana Isai sumai, roonamo Iaku padhamo kupili samia raja minaaka i manga anana."<verse eid="1SA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 16:2" />Lawanina Samuel, "Tuaapa amembali iaku bhekulingka iwe sumai? Ande o giu incia sumai arangoa Saul incia dhaanamo bheapekamateaku."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:2">Firimanina KAWASANA OPU, "Bhawamo sambaa anana sapi bhawine tee upogau, 'Iaku kuumba to kupasombaaka kurubani i aroana KAWASANA OPU.' <verse eid="1SA 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 16:3" />Kasiimpo ukembamo Isai i haroaana kurubani sumai, tee Iaku bhekupaumbaakako opea bheipewaumu, tee kususuakako mia bheilantimu to amembali raja."<verse eid="1SA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 16:4" />Nabii Samuel apewaua bhari-bharia ifirimaniakana KAWASANA OPU sumai. Wakutuuna incia akawa i Kota Bait Lahim, manga mancuanana kota sumai aumba apokawaakea tee arengku, pogauna manga incia, "Buaka o umbaamu sii ubhawa kaʼamani?"<verse eid="1SA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 16:5" />Lawanina Samuel, "Umbe, iaku kubhawa kaʼamani! Iaku kuumba to kupasombaaka kurubani i aroana KAWASANA OPU. Pekangkilomea o karomu tee umbamo upoose tee iaku i haroaana kurubani sii." Kasiimpo incia apekangkilo Isai tee manga anana tee akembaia i haroaana kurubani sumai.<verse eid="1SA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 16:6" />Wakutuuna manga incia aumba, Samuel akamatamo Eliab ana tumpena Isai tee afikiri, "Dhaanamo mia mokabhale-bhalena i aroaku sii o mia bheilantina KAWASANA OPU."<verse eid="1SA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 16:7" />Maka o KAWASANA OPU afirimani i Samuel, "Bholi ukamata bhanguna atawa o poningkarona, roonamo mencuana incia ipiliku. Iaku inda kunilai maanusia mboomo carana maanusia anilai maanusia rangana, roonamo maanusia anilai mia minaaka i bhanguna, maka Iaku kunilai mia minaaka i ngangarandana."<verse eid="1SA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 16:8" />Kasiimpo Isai akemba Abinadab tee atumpua adhala i aroana Samuel. Maka o Samuel apogau, "Mencuana incia ipilina KAWASANA OPU." <verse eid="1SA 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 16:9" />Kasiimpo Isai atumpu uka Syama modhalana, maka o Samuel apogau, "Mencuana incia uka ipilina KAWASANA OPU." <verse eid="1SA 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 16:10" />Isai atumpu pitu miaia anana sumai to adhala i aroana Samuel, maka o Samuel apogau, "Minaaka i kabharina manga incia inda samia uka ipilina KAWASANA OPU." <verse eid="1SA 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 16:11" />Kasiimpo Samuel aabha, "Soomo incia sii o anamu umane?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Lawanina Isai, "Dhaangia samiapo uka o kaepuku mokosaroakana Daud. Incia tangasaana awulu gulumana dumbamami."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 16:11">Pogauna Samuel, "Tumpumo mia to akembaia, roonamo ingkita indapo tamembali tauncura takande ande incia indapo aumba iwe sii."<verse eid="1SA 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 16:12" />Jadi Isai atumpumo mia to akembaaka anana sumai. Garaaka o anana sumai amakesa o bhanguna, amangada o matana, tee amaleʼi o rouna. Kasiimpo afirimanimo KAWASANA OPU, "Siimo miana, ulantimea."<verse eid="1SA 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 16:13" />Sapadhana incia sumai o Samuel aalamo mina zaitun, kasiimpo alanti tee amina-minaiki bhaana Daud i aroana manga witinaina. Pepuu i eo incia sumai uka o Daud akuasaimea Rohina KAWASANA OPU. Kasiimpo Samuel ambuli i Kota Rama.<verse eid="1SA 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daud i Maligena Raja Saul</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 16:14-23">16:14-23</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 16:14" />Wakutuu incia sumai o Rohina KAWASANA OPU amaridhomo minaaka i Raja Saul, tee incia aganggomea rohi madhaki mopadhana ilambokona KAWASANA OPU.<verse eid="1SA 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 16:15" />Rampaakanamo sumai manga pagawena Saul apogau, "Ingkami tamataua ande dhaangia tee rohi madhaki ilambokona Aulataʼala to moganggoko. <verse eid="1SA 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 16:16" />Ande usatuju, ingkami taunda tapeeloakako mia momakidhana momagasiaakana kecapi. Jadi ande o rohi madhaki sumai aumba aganggoko, mia incia sumai amembali amagasiaakako kecapina, sabutuna bheamalape o namisimu e opuku."<verse eid="1SA 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 16:17" />Pogauna Saul tee manga pagawena, "Peeloakaaku mia momakidhana momagasiaakana kecapi tee ubhawea iwe sii."<verse eid="1SA 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 16:18" />Kasiimpo alawanimo sala samia minaaka i pagawena, "Miana Bait Lahim mokosaroakana Isai sumai dhaangia tee anana momakidhana momagasiaakana kecapi. Incia abarani tee amakaa o bukuna. Incia aʼaarifu o bhatangana pogauna tee amakesa o poningkarona, tee bhari-bharia ipewauna sadia atulungia KAWASANA OPU."<verse eid="1SA 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 16:19" />Kasiimpo o Raja Saul alambokomo pia mia o potoloweana to apokawaaka Isai tee aposamea mboo sii, "Tumpua o Daud mogembalaakana manga gulumana dumbamu sumai to apoaroaka tee iaku." <verse eid="1SA 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 16:20" />Jadi o Isai aala sambaa keledai, sambaa anana bhembe, roti, tee kadhu kuli mokoantoakana angguru kasiimpo adhawuakea to Daud mamudhaakana abhawea apasombaakea to Saul.<verse eid="1SA 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 16:21" />Mboomo sumai o Daud aumba apokawaaka Saul, tee apepuumo alaiania. Saul amaasiaka Daud, sabutuna o Daud aangkea amembali pande kenina ewangana. <verse eid="1SA 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 16:22" />Rampaakanamo sumai o Saul atumpumo mia to apokawaaka Isai tee aposamea, "Taroakamo o Daud ambooreaka iwe sii to alaianiaku roonamo kumaasiakea."<verse eid="1SA 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 16:23" />Pepuu i wakutuu incia sumai, ande o Saul aumbatia rohi madhaki minaaka i Aulataʼala, sumaimo o Daud bheaala kecapina tee amagasiaakea. Kasiimpo rohi madhaki sumai abholi Saul, sabutuna o namisina Saul atanangi tee amalape pendua o fikirina.<verse eid="1SA 16:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1SA 17" />
  <para style="s1">Goliat Abhali Miana Israel</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 17:1-11">17:1-11</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 17:1" />Saangu wakutuu o miana Filistin aromusakamo suludaduna to apotimbeaka tee tantarana Israel. Manga incia aporomusaka i Kota Sokho i lipuna Yehuda, tee apokema i polotaana Sokho tee Azeka i Efes-Damim. <verse eid="1SA 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 17:2" />Saul tee manga tantarana Israel uka aporomusaka, kasiimpo apokema i sawetana Mbolongana Tarbantin. Manga incia uka asiapu to apotimbe tee miana Filistin. <verse eid="1SA 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 17:3" />Tantarana miana Filistin i saangu gunu apoaromo tee tantarana Israel i saangu gunu i sawetana, tee dhaangia tee mbolonga i tanga-tangana manga incia.<verse eid="1SA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 17:4" />Kasiimpo alimbamo samia hiri mokosaroakana Goliat minaaka i pokemaana tantarana Filistin to abhali tantarana Israel, tee incia aminaaka i Kota Gat. Kalangana badana kera-kera alabhi talu metere. <verse eid="1SA 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 17:5" />Incia apake topi tambaga tee apake bhaju zira tambaga mokoona<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bhaju zira tambaga mokoona: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bhaju incia sii kananeana apakea tantara atawa o suludadu wakutuuna alingka apotimbe. </char></note> tee o katamona kera-kera 58 kilo. <verse eid="1SA 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 17:6" />I aena apakeakea katutubhi minaaka i tambaga tee asalili karadha tambaga i talikuna awaana. <verse eid="1SA 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 17:7" />Puuna pandangana amaarate mpuu mboomo kaaratena bhalidha ipakena pande tanu, matana pandangana sumai o katamona kera-kera pitu kilo, tee dhaangia samia o suludadu mokeniakana katangkesina moporikanana i aroana.<verse eid="1SA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 17:8" />Incia akakaro tee apaewa tantarana Israel, "Opea ipewaumiu iwe itu? Buaka ingkomiu gaumiu upotimbe? Iaku o miana Filistin tee ingkomiu o bhatuana Saul! Pilimo samia mobaranina to mowakilikomiu tee utaroakea to asapoaka apoaro tee iaku. <verse eid="1SA 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 17:9" />Ande i nuncana potimbea sumai iaku momatalona, sumaimo ingkami tamembali bhatuamiu, maka ande i nuncana potimbea sumai iaku mokanana, sumaimo ingkomiu bhemomembalina bhatuamami." <verse eid="1SA 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 17:10" />Pogauna hirina Filistin sumai, "Sii-sii uka iaku kupaewa manga suludaduna Israel! Pilimo sala samia minaaka i kabharimiu mamudhaakana ingkami tapotimbe tarua mia." <verse eid="1SA 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 17:11" />Wakutuuna Saul tee bhari-bharia suludaduna Israel arango pogauna miana Filistin sumai, manga incia amaidhiidhimo incana tee amaekamo mpuu.<verse eid="1SA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daud Akawa i Tampana Potimbea</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 17:12-39">17:12-39</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 17:12" />Daud sii o anana Isai miana Efrata mominaakana i Bait Lahim i Yehuda. Isai dhaangia tee anana walu mia umane. Wakutuuna Saul amembali raja, umuruna Isai sii amancuanamo mpuu. <verse eid="1SA 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 17:13" />Talu miaia ana tumpena Isai sumai alingka apotimbe aose Raja Saul. Manga incia siitumo: Mobhaa-bhaana o Eliab; katutunina o Abinadab; kasiimpo Syama. <verse eid="1SA 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 17:14" />Sainamo Daud o kaepu. Talu miaia ana tumpena sumai aose torosu Saul, <verse eid="1SA 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 17:15" />maka o Daud amenturu abholi Saul tee ambuli i Bait Lahim to agembalaaka gulumana dumbana amana.<verse eid="1SA 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 17:16" />Kangengena pata pulu eo, o Goliat sii alimba minaaka i pokemaana tantarana Filistin i saeona tee uka i wakutuuna konowia, kasiimpo incia akakaro samia-miana tee apaewa tantarana Israel.<verse eid="1SA 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 17:17" />Saangu wakutuu Isai apogau tee Daud anana sumai, "Alaakea sapulu kilo gandum itunu tee sapulu angu roti tee ubhawaakea to akamu i pokemaana tantara. <verse eid="1SA 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 17:18" />Bhawaakea uka sapulu tumpu keju to kapalana batalion. Abhaakea tuaapa o kadhaangiana manga akamu, tee ubhawaakaakumo bukutiina ande ingkoo padhamo upokawa tee manga incia tee o kadhaangiana manga incia amalape."<verse eid="1SA 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 17:19" />Wakutuu incia sumai manga incia adhaangia i Mbolongana Tarbantin apobhawa tee Saul, tee bhari-bharia tantarana Israel tangasaana apotimbe tee tantarana Filistin. <verse eid="1SA 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 17:20" />Saeona mpuu o Daud abhangumo tee o gulumana dumbana abholia i samia gembala. Sapadhana sumai o Daud aalamo bhawaana kasiimpo alingka mboomo opea mopadhana iparintaakana amana to incia. Daud akawa i pokemaana tantara sumai wakutuuna manga tantarana Israel siimpo bhealingka i tampana potimbea apoose apekee tee asambo-samboaka potimbea sumai. <verse eid="1SA 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 17:21" />Tantarana Filistin tee tantarana Israel aposapoaromo tee asiapumo to apotimbe. <verse eid="1SA 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 17:22" />Daud adhika bara ibhawana sumai i samia pande jaga, kasiimpo abuntuli i tampana potimbea sumai to aabhaaka kadhaangiana manga akana. <verse eid="1SA 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 17:23" />Maka wakutuuna Daud apogau tee manga akana, Goliat miana Gat sii amajumo i aroana tantarana Filistin tee apaewa tantarana Israel mboomo kananeana. Maka o pogauna Goliat sumai arangoa Daud. <verse eid="1SA 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 17:24" />Bhari-bharia suludaduna Israel apalaiaka karona sakamatana Goliat, roonamo manga incia amaeka mpuu.<verse eid="1SA 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 17:25" />Manga suludaduna Israel apogaumo podho-podho manga incia, "Padhamo ukamatea o mia momajuna i aroa sumai? Incia amaju to ahina tantarana Israel. Rajata padhamo apojanji, incema-incema momembalina mopekamatena Goliat bheadhawuakea hadia momaoge. Raja uka bheapakawiakea tee anana bhawine, tee o witinaina bheapabebasia minaaka i balasitee."<verse eid="1SA 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 17:26" />Kasiimpo Daud aabha tee manga tantara mokabhale-bhalena i saripina, "Incema o miana Filistin inda mototandaki sumai mbakana abarani ahina tantarana Aulataʼala modhadhi? Bheatodhawuaka opea buaka o mia momembalina mopekamatea tee opea bhemomembalina mohapusuna giu itohinaakana tantarana Israel sumai?"<verse eid="1SA 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 17:27" />Manga tantara sumai alawani mboomo opea mopadhana ipogauakana i saao, "Mboomo sumai o giu idhawuakana to mia momembalina mopekamatea."<verse eid="1SA 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 17:28" />Wakutuuna Eliab o akana Daud momengkaakaakana arango Daud apogau tee manga tantara sumai, Eliab aʼamaramo i Daud tee apogau, "Apokia ingkoo uumba iwe sii? Incema mojaganina gulumana dumbana amata i tana matuu? Iaku kumataua o kasombona tee kadhakina ngangarandamu. Ingkoo uumba iwe sii mamudhaakana ukamata potimbea sii!"<verse eid="1SA 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 17:29" />Lawanina Daud, "Opea o kasalahaku? Iaku soo kuabha!" <verse eid="1SA 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 17:30" />Kasiimpo o Daud alingka apekaridho minaaka i akana, kasiimpo aabhaakea uka o giu incia sumai i manga tantara mosagaanana, maka manga tantara sumai apokana uka o kalawanina. <verse eid="1SA 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 17:31" />Garaaka dhaangia o mia morangona pogauna Daud sumai, tee o giu incia sumai apakawaakea i Raja Saul, sabutuna o Saul atumpu mia to akemba Daud.<verse eid="1SA 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 17:32" />Kasiimpo Daud apogaumo tee Saul, "Bholimo dhaangia o mia momaekana tee suludaduna Filistin sumai. Iaku kusiapu to kupoewangiakea."<verse eid="1SA 17:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 17:33" />Saul alawani Daud, "Bholi, ingkoo inda ukapoia to upoaro tee upobusuaka suludaduna Filistin sumai. Ingkoo dhaangiapo umangura, sainamo incia amananeamo apobusu apepuu minaaka dhaangiapo amangura dhadhina."<verse eid="1SA 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 17:34" />Maka o Daud apogau tee Saul, "Iaku sii kumananeamo kugembalaaka dumbana amaku. Ande dhaangia o singa atawa o beruang moumbana mopapakina dumbaku tee apalaiakea minaaka i gulumana, <verse eid="1SA 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 17:35" />sumaimo bhekupajerea, kubhebhea tee kurambasakea minaaka i ngangana. Ande aewangiaku sumaimo bhekukenia o buluna bhorokona kasiimpo kupekamatea. <verse eid="1SA 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 17:36" />Iaku padhamo kupekamate singa tee beruang, jadi o suludaduna Filistin inda mototandaki sumai bheapokana tee manga binata sumai, roonamo incia abarani ahina tantarana Aulataʼala modhadhi." <verse eid="1SA 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 17:37" />Daud uka apogau, "KAWASANA OPU padhamo apasalaamatiaku minaaka i singa tee beruang, Incia uka bheapasalaamatiaku minaaka i suludaduna Filistin sii."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:37">Pogauna Saul, "Lingkamo, maasangia o KAWASANA OPU atulungiko."<verse eid="1SA 17:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 17:38" />Saul adhawuaka bhajuna karona to Daud, kasiimpo Daud apakea. Topi tambagana tee baju asena Saul uka apapakeakea i Daud. <verse eid="1SA 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 17:39" />Daud abhokeakea tee hancu i bhaju asena, kasiimpo acoba adhala pia bhengkala roonamo incia indapo aperna apake manga giu incia sumai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:39">Pogauna Daud tee Saul, "Iaku inda kumembali kubhengkala tee pakea incia sii, roonamo indapo aperna kupake pakea mboo sii." Kasiimpo Daud arambasakamea o pakea incia sumai.<verse eid="1SA 17:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pobusuana Daud tee Goliat</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 17:40-58">17:40-58</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 17:40" />Kasiimpo Daud aala katukona, tee apili lima angu bhatu maʼalusu minaaka i umala tee apapesuaia i nuncana kadhu-kadhu modhaangiana i tasina gembalana, tee aala patena kasiimpo alingka apokawaaka Goliat miana Filistin sumai.<verse eid="1SA 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 17:41" />Inda amangenge sapadhana sumai, miana Filistin sii aumbamo apokawaaka Daud, tee o pande kenina katangkesina moporikanana i aroana. <verse eid="1SA 17:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 17:42" />Wakutuuna miana Filistin sii akamata tee atiliki Daud, incia apandaʼente Daud roonamo akamatea dhaangiapo amangura, amaleʼi o bhagana tee amakesa o poningkarona. <verse eid="1SA 17:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 17:43" />Pogauna Goliat miana Filistin sumai tee Daud, "To opea itu ubhawa katuko? Buaka uabhiaku mantoa?" Kasiimpo tee sarona manga dewana o Goliat atunda Daud. <verse eid="1SA 17:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 17:44" />Goliat miana Filistin sumai apogaumo uka tee Daud, "Maimo maju mamudhaakana o dagimu kudhawuakea to manu-manu i laiana tee binata momaila!"<verse eid="1SA 17:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="1SA 17:45" />Daud alawani miana Filistin sumai, "Ingkoo uumba upoewangiakaaku tee hancu, pandanga tee karadha, maka iaku kuumbatiko tee sarona KAWASANA OPU o Aulataʼalana saangua alamu, siitumo Aulataʼalana tantarana Israel ihinamu sumai. <verse eid="1SA 17:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1SA 17:46" />Eo sii uka o KAWASANA OPU bheapasaraakaako i limaku. Iaku bhekupekataloko tee bhekutumpoa bhaamu. Eo sii uka o bhangkena suludaduna Filistin bhekudhawuakea to manu-manu i laiana tee manga binata momaila. Tee mboo sumai saangua dunia bheamataua ande ingkami o tantarana Israel sii dhaangia tee Aulataʼala isombamami, <verse eid="1SA 17:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1SA 17:47" />tee mamudhaakana bhari-bharia mia bheamataua ande o KAWASANA OPU inda afaraluu hancu tee pandanga to apasalaamati uumatina, roonamo KAWASANA OPU sadia akana minaaka i potimbea tee o KAWASANA OPU uka bheamangapakana minaaka i ingkomiu, tee Incia bhemopasaraakaakomiu i limamami."<verse eid="1SA 17:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1SA 17:48" />Wakutuuna Goliat apasari to apoaroaka Daud, abuntulimo pekadhei o Daud i aroana musu to apoaroaka miana Filistin sumai. <verse eid="1SA 17:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1SA 17:49" />Daud aroro kadhu-kadhuna tasina tee aala saangu bhatu kasiimpo apateakea i Goliat miana Filistin sumai, tee o bhatu sumai akangkanai bhawona rouna tee atongke i bhawona rouna, sabutuna o Goliat akotibu tee apaubho i tana.<verse eid="1SA 17:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1SA 17:50" />Mboomo sumai o Daud apekatalo Goliat miana Filistin sumai tangkanamo tee saangu pate tee saangu bhatu tee inda apake hancu.<verse eid="1SA 17:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1SA 17:51" />Kasiimpo Daud abuntuli i tampana kandawuna Goliat tee akakaro i bhawona badana miana Filistin sumai. Sapadhana incia sumai o Daud aalamo hancuna Goliat tee abhindua minaaka i pisolona kasiimpo tee hancu incia sumai o Daud atumpo bhaana Goliat.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:51">Wakutuuna tantarana Filistin akamata hirina manga incia amatemo, manga incia apalaimo. <verse eid="1SA 17:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1SA 17:52" />Sumaimo tantarana Israel tee Yehuda aumba apoose asambo-sambo. Manga incia apajere tantarana Filistin sakawana i dhala mopesuana i Kota Gat tee sakawana i bhambana lawana Kota Ekron. Manga suludaduna Filistin momatena amantale i dhala moporopena i Saaraim sakawana i Gat tee Ekron. <verse eid="1SA 17:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1SA 17:53" />Sapadhana apajere tantarana Filistin, tantarana Israel ambulimo arampasi manga bara modhaangiana i pokemaana Filistin sumai. <verse eid="1SA 17:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1SA 17:54" />Daud aala bhaana Goliat miana Filistin sumai tee abhawea i Kota Yerusalem, sainamo manga ewangana Goliat adhikaia i nuncana kemana.<verse eid="1SA 17:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1SA 17:55" />Wakutuuna Raja Saul akamata Daud amaju apoewangiaka Goliat miana Filistin sumai, incia aabha i Abner momembalina kapalana tantarana Israel, "Anana incema o ana umane mangura sumai?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:55">Lawanina Abner, "E opuku, satotuuna iaku uka inda kumataua."<verse eid="1SA 17:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="1SA 17:56" />Pogauna Raja Saul, "Lingkapo, abhaakea o anana incema o ana umane mangura sumai?"<verse eid="1SA 17:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="1SA 17:57" />Jadi wakutuuna Daud ambuli i pokemaa sapadhana apekamate Goliat, incia abhawea Abner to apapoaroa tee Saul. Tee i wakutuu incia sumai o Daud dhaangiapo akeni bhaana Goliat.<verse eid="1SA 17:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="1SA 17:58" />Kasiimpo Saul aabhaki Daud, "E ana umane, anana incema ingkoo?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 17:58">Lawanina Daud, "Iaku sii o anana Isai miana Bait Lahim."<verse eid="1SA 17:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1SA 18" />
  <para style="s1">Daud tee Yonatan</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 18:1-5">18:1-5</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 18:1" />Sapadhana Daud apogau tee Raja Saul, Yonatan tee Daud alausakamo ahanda amakasu aposabhangka, tee o Yonatan ahandamo kamaasiakana tee Daud mboomo kamaasiakana tee karona. <verse eid="1SA 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 18:2" />Eo incia sumai uka o Saul aangka Daud to apamembalia pagawena tee inda aundaakea ambuli i bhanuana amana. <verse eid="1SA 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 18:3" />Yonatan apadhaangia pojanjia tee Daud roonamo kamaasiakana mboomo kamaasiakana tee karona. <verse eid="1SA 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 18:4" />Kasiimpo Yonatan arambasaka jubana karona, bhaju potimbeana, hancuna, panana, tee kabhokena tangana tee adhawuakea to Daud.<verse eid="1SA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 18:5" />Daud apewaua pekalape bhari-bharia tugasi idhawuakana Saul to incia. Rampaakanamo sumai o Daud aangkea to apamembalia kapalana tantarana Saul, tee o Daud amaasiakea bhari-bharia tantara tee bhari-bharia pagawena Saul.<verse eid="1SA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Raja Saul Abanci Daud</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 18:6-30">18:6-30</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 18:6" />Sambulina Daud tee sapadhana apekatalo Goliat miana Filistin sumai, alimbamo manga bhawine minaaka i bhari-bharia kota modhaangiana i Israel apoose alagu tee amanari. Manga incia apepago Raja Saul tee ganda, lagu kaunde-unde, tee kecapi talu rambaana. <verse eid="1SA 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 18:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:11">1Sam. 21:11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 29:5">29:5</ref>. </char></note>Manga bhawine sumai akaunde-unde apoose alagu tee o laguna mboo sii,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 18:7" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 18:7">"Saul apekamate rewu-rewuna mia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 18:7">maka o Daud pulu-puluna rewu mia."<verse eid="1SA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 18:8" />Raja Saul aʼamara mpuu tee amarewu incana tee pogau incia sumai, roonamo afikiria, "Daud aabhia padhamo apekamate pulu-puluna rewuna mia, sainamo iaku tangkanamo rewu-rewuna miamea. Indamo amangenge incia bheatoangkamo amembali rajana manga incia." <verse eid="1SA 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 18:9" />Jadi, apepuu eo incia sumai o Saul agigibulu tee Daud.<verse eid="1SA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 18:10" />Samainawana, rohi madhaki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">rohi madhaki: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I nuncana pogau Ibrani amembali uka akomaʼana rohi mosikisaana mia. </char></note> ilambokona KAWASANA OPU asapomo tee akuasai Saul, sabutuna o Saul apesuaikia rohi madhaki tee akakee-kee mboomo mia magila i nuncana bhanuana. Kasiimpo Daud amagasiaaka kecapina mboomo kananeana saesaeo, tee o Saul tangasaana akeni pandanga i limana. <verse eid="1SA 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 18:11" />Saul atudhaaka pandangana sumai, roonamo ifikirina, "Daud bhekupatongkea i rindi." Maka o Daud amembali apasala rua mpearo.<verse eid="1SA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 18:12" />Saul amaekamo tee Daud roonamo KAWASANA OPU apoose tee Daud, sainamo incia karona abholia KAWASANA OPU. <verse eid="1SA 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 18:13" />Rampaakanamo sumai o Saul apekaridho Daud minaaka i karona tee aangkea amembali mokapalaina sarewu tantara. Jadi sadia o Daud mokapalaikina tantara i nuncana potimbea, <verse eid="1SA 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 18:14" />tee akana torosu i nuncana bhari-bharia potimbea, roonamo KAWASANA OPU apoose tee Daud. <verse eid="1SA 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 18:15" />Wakutuuna akamatea ande o Daud sadia akana i nuncana potimbea, sumaimo Saul ahandamo amaeka tee Daud. <verse eid="1SA 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 18:16" />Maka bhari-bharia miana Israel tee Yehuda amaasiaka Daud roonamo Daud mokapalaikina manga incia i nuncana potimbea.<verse eid="1SA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 18:17" />Raja Saul apogau tee Daud, "Siimo o Merab ana tumpeku bhawine, bhekudhawuakako to upamembalia bhawinemu. Maka ingkoo tabeana ususuakaaku kabaranimu tee upotimbemo i nuncana potimbeana KAWASANA OPU." Roonamo ifikirina Saul, "Bholi o limaku mopekamatea, maka taroakamo miana Filistin mopekamatea."<verse eid="1SA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 18:18" />Tee o Daud alawani, "Incema buaka iaku sii, incema buaka o witinaiku atawa o witinaina amaku i Israel sii sampe iaku bheupamembaliaku ana maniamu?" <verse eid="1SA 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 18:19" />Maka sakawana wakutuuna o Merab anana Saul sumai bheatopakawi tee Daud, garaaka o Merab sumai soo apakawia tee Adriel miana Mehola to apamembalia bhawinena.<verse eid="1SA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 18:20" />Maka dhaangia samia o anana Saul bhawine mosagaanana mokosaroakana Mikhal mosintaina Daud. Wakutuuna Saul arango giu incia sumai incia asatujuia. <verse eid="1SA 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 18:21" />Roonamo ifikirina Saul, "Iaku bhekudhawuakea Mikhal to incia. Taroakamo o Mikhal amembaliaka katapu to Daud, tee taroakamo limana miana Filistin mopekamatea." Rampaakanamo sumai to kamondona rua mpearo o Saul apogau tee Daud, "Sii-sii kudhawuakako kalalesa to umembaliaka ana maniaku."<verse eid="1SA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 18:22" />Kasiimpo Saul adhawu parinta to manga pagawena to apaumbaaka Daud tee bholi umarobhoakea, "Satotuuna o raja tee bhari-bharia pagawena amaasiakako. Rampaakanamo sumai ingkoo tabeana umembali ana maniana raja."<verse eid="1SA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 18:23" />Kasiimpo manga pagawena Saul apakawaakea o pogau incia sumai to Daud, maka o Daud alawani, "Buaka amamudha tamembali ana maniana raja? Iaku sii o mia misikini tee o mia maidhiidhi."<verse eid="1SA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 18:24" />Wakutuuna manga bhatuana Saul apakawaaka kalawanina Daud sumai, <verse eid="1SA 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 18:25" />Saul atumpumo manga pagawena to apogau tee Daud mboo sii, "Raja inda afaraluu doina tauraka, maka soo afaraluu saatu kulina tandakiana miana Filistin to abalasiaka manga musuna raja." Giumo incia sii ihaejatiakana Saul to apekamateaka Daud alaloi limana miana Filistin.<verse eid="1SA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 18:26" />Wakutuuna manga pagawena Saul apakawaaka pogau incia sumai, Daud asatuju to amembali ana maniana raja. Jadi kananteana indapo akawa o wakutuu mopadhana itantuakana Saul, <verse eid="1SA 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 18:27" />Daud alingkamo apoose tee manga ana buana tee apekamate rua atu mia o miana Filistin. Manga incia aala kulina tandakiana miana Filistin tee apasaraakaakea i Saul to tandana kasaratina to amembaliaka ana maniana raja. Kasiimpo o Saul adhawuaka Mikhal to Daud to apamembalia bhawinena.<verse eid="1SA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 18:28" />Saul asadaria ande o KAWASANA OPU sadia apoose tee Daud tee o Mikhal asintai Daud. <verse eid="1SA 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 18:29" />Rampaakanamo sumai o Saul ahandamo uka o kaekana tee Daud, tee amusui Daud saʼumurua dhadhina.<verse eid="1SA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 18:30" />Manga rajana miana Filistin amenturu aumba apotimbe tee miana Israel. Maka gagari potimbea o Daud sadia akana alabhi minaaka i kapalana tantarana Saul mosagaanana, sabutuna o sarona Daud ahandamo ajulu o kaogena tee amataua mia bhari.<verse eid="1SA 18:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1SA 19" />
  <para style="s1">Daud Apalaiaka Karona Minaaka i Saul</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 19:1-24">19:1-24</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 19:1" />Sapadhaana sumai Saul apogaumo tee Yonatan o anana tee uka bhari-bharia pagawena, ande Daud tabeana atopekamate. Maka o Yonatan amaasiaka mpuu Daud. <verse eid="1SA 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 19:2" />Rampaakanamo sumai o Yonatan apogau tee Daud, pogauna, "Amaku o Saul gauna apekamateko, jadi upengkaanakamo. Naile saeona uopomo i saangu tampa morahasia tee umbooremo iwe sumai. <verse eid="1SA 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 19:3" />Iaku bhekulimba minaaka i kota kupobhawa tee amaku to talingka i tana lapa i tampana opoamu sumai. Iaku bhekuabha i amaku pokaiana tee ingkoo, tee opea ipogauakamami sumai dhaampomo kupaumbaakako."<verse eid="1SA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 19:4" />Kasiimpo Yonatan apogau tee Saul pokaina tee giu malape mopadhana ipewauna Daud, pogauna, "Rajaku, bholi upewau dosa tee uhukumu Daud, roonamo incia inda apewau dosa tee ingkoo, tee incia abharimo mpuu o jasana to ingkoo. <verse eid="1SA 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 19:5" />Daud padhamo ataa inyawana wakutuuna apaewa Goliat miana Filistin sumai to apotimbe sakawana apekamatea, sabutuna KAWASANA OPU adhawuakea kamangantalo momaoge to bhari-bharia uumatina Israel. Wakutuuna ukamatea o kajadia incia sumai ingkoo ukaunde-unde. Apokia uka ingkoo gaumu bheupewau dosa tee mia inda mosala mboomo Daud tee upekamatea inda tee sababuna?"<verse eid="1SA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 19:6" />Saul aperangoi opea ipogauakana Yonatan, tee incia aposumpa, "Iaku kuposumpa to sarona KAWASANA OPU modhadhi, iaku inda bhekupekamate Daud."<verse eid="1SA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 19:7" />Sapadhana sumai o Yonatan akembamo Daud, tee apetulatulaakea bhari-bharia opea mopadhana ipogauakana tee Saul i saao. Kasiimpo Yonatan abhawamo Daud to apoaro tee Saul, tee o Daud ambulimo alaiani Saul mboomo mobhaa-bhaana.<verse eid="1SA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 19:8" />Kasiimpo adhaangiamo uka o potimbea tee manga tantarana Filistin, jadi o Daud apenduamo uka to akapalai manga suludaduna i nuncana potimbea sii, tee manga incia abhari mpuu apekamate miana Filistin sampe o bhilaana manga tantarana Filistin inda motopekamatena apalaiaka karona.<verse eid="1SA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 19:9" />Maka o rohi madhaki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">rohi madhaki: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">I nuncana pogau Ibrani amembali uka akomaʼana rohi mosikisaana mia. </char></note> ilambokona KAWASANA OPU aumba pendua to akuasai Saul wakutuuna incia tangasaana auncura i bhanuana tee pandangana i limana. Wakutuu incia sumai o Daud tangasaana amagasiaaka kecapina, <verse eid="1SA 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 19:10" />saanampuu o Saul aʼusahamo mamudhaakana o Daud apatongkeakea tee pandangana i rindi. Maka o Daud amembali apasala sabutuna o pandangana Saul soo akangkanai rindi tee i malo incia sumai uka o Daud apalaiaka karona.<verse eid="1SA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 19:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 59:1">Zab. 59:1</ref>. </char>
    </note>Kasiimpo Saul atumpu pia mia o potumpuana to alukutiaka Daud i bhanuana mamudhaakana atopekamate wakutuuna saeona. Maka o Mikhal o bhawinena Daud, apaumbaia mboo sii, "Ande inda upalai malo sii, dhaanamo naile saeona ingkoo bheutopekamate." <verse eid="1SA 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 19:12" />Jadi Daud apasapoa Mikhal alaloi bhalo-bhalo tee apalaiaka karona. <verse eid="1SA 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 19:13" />Sapadhana sumai o Mikhal aalamo <char style="add">saangu barahala isombana to ajagani manga miana i bhanua isarongiaka</char> "terafim" tee apadholea i kolemana Daud, tee i weta i bhaana adhikaakea buluna bhembe kasiimpo atutubhiakea tee kakumu.<verse eid="1SA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 19:14" />Wakutuuna Saul alamboko manga potumpuana to arako Daud, Mikhal apogau, "Daud amapii."<verse eid="1SA 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 19:15" />Kasiimpo Saul apendua alamboko manga potumpuana sumai to akamataaka Daud, pogauna, "Sodhamea o kolemana tee ubhawea iwe sii mamudhaakana kupekamatea." <verse eid="1SA 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 19:16" />Maka wakutuuna manga potumpuana sumai apesua, garaaka motokamatana i kolema sumai tangkanamo terafim tee buluna bhembe modhaangiana i weta i bhaana.<verse eid="1SA 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 19:17" />Saul apogau tee Mikhal, "Apokia utipuaku? Apokia urambasaka musuku to apalaiaka karona?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:17">Lawanina Mikhal i Saul, "Incia apogau tee iaku, 'Taroakaakumo kulingkaaka. Buaka tabeana kupekamateko?' "<verse eid="1SA 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 19:18" />Wakutuuna Daud apalaiaka karona, incia alingka i bhanuana Nabii Samuel i Kota Rama tee apaumbaakea bhari-bharia opea mopadhana ipewauna Raja Saul tee incia. Kasiimpo Daud alingka apoose tee Samuel tee amboore i Nayot. <verse eid="1SA 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 19:19" />Maka o Saul dhaangia tee mopaumbaakea ande o Daud dhaangia i Nayot i saripina Kota Rama. <verse eid="1SA 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 19:20" />Rampaakanamo sumai o Saul alambokomo uka manga potumpuana to arako Daud. Maka wakutuuna manga potumpuana Saul sumai akamata sakolompo nabii ikapalaina Samuel tangasaana apakawaaka kasameana Aulataʼala, saanampuu asapomo Rohina Aulataʼala asampaiki manga incia, sabutuna manga potumpuana Saul sumai uka apakawaaka kasameana Aulataʼala mboomo manga nabii sumai. <verse eid="1SA 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 19:21" />Wakutuuna o lele incia sumai arangoa Saul, incia alambokomo uka manga potumpuana mosagaanana, maka manga incia uka apepuumo apakawaaka kasameana Aulataʼala mboomo manga nabii. Sakawana talu mpearo o Saul alamboko potumpuana, maka manga incia uka asadhaadhaa apakawaaka kasameana Aulataʼala mboomo manga nabii sumai. <verse eid="1SA 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 19:22" />Sumaimo Saul o karona molingkana i Kota Rama. Sakawana i sumu ogena i Sekhu, incia aabhamo, "Iapai o Nabii Samuel tee Daud?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 19:22">Lawanina manga mia iwe sumai, "Dhaangia i Nayot i saripina Kota Rama."<verse eid="1SA 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 19:23" />Jadi Raja Saul alingkamo iwe sumai, i Nayot i saripina Kota Rama, maka incia uka apesuaikia Rohina Aulataʼala, sabutuna i nuncana lingkaana sumai incia apakawaaka kasameana Aulataʼala sakaaratea dhala sakawana i Nayot. <verse eid="1SA 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 19:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 10:11-12">1Sam. 10:11-12</ref>. </char></note>Sakawana iwe sumai o Saul arambasakamo pakeana tee apakawaaka kasameana Aulataʼala tee akakee-kee i aroana Samuel, kasiimpo akotibu i tana tee akalealea saeoa tee samaloa. Rampaakanamo sumai o mia apogau, "Buaka o Saul uka amembali nabii?"<verse eid="1SA 19:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1SA 20" />
  <para style="s1">Pojanjia i Tanga-tangana Daud tee Yonatan</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 20:1-42">20:1-42</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 20:1" />Daud apalai minaaka i Nayot i saripina Kota Rama, kasiimpo alingka apokawaaka Yonatan tee apogau, "Opea mopadhana ipewauku, opea o kasalahaku, opea o dosaku tee amamu sampe incia bheapekamateaku?"<verse eid="1SA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 20:2" />Lawanina Yonatan, "Bholi upogau mboo itu! Amaku inda bheapekamateko. Incia sadia apaumbaakaaku bhari-bharia giu ihaejatiakana, malape momaogena atawa momaidhi-idhina. Jadi inda amungki bhearahasiaakaaku haejatina. Rampaakanamo sumai opea ipogauakamu itu inda atotuu!"<verse eid="1SA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 20:3" />Maka o Daud aposumpamo uka pendua tee apogau, "Amamu amataua mpuu ande umaasiakaaku. Jadi i fikirina amamu, 'Ancosala giu incia sii amataua Yonatan, roonamo dhaanamo bheamaporoakea incana.' Maka kuposumpa to sarona KAWASANA OPU modhadhi tee uka to dhadhimu, satotuuna o dhadhiku sii soomo sabhengkalapo o karidhona minaaka i mate."<verse eid="1SA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 20:4" />Kasiimpo Yonatan apogau tee Daud, "Opeapo uka iemanimu bhekupewaua."<verse eid="1SA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 20:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 28:11">Kab. 28:11</ref>. </char>
    </note>Jadi o Daud alawani Yonatan, "Naile o kariaana bula bhaau tee iaku tabeana kuuncura kukande tee raja. Maka, taroakamo kulingka kuopo i tana lapa sakawana naipua i wakutuuna soo matanaeo. <verse eid="1SA 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 20:6" />Ande o amamu aabhaakaaku, paumbaia, 'Daud aemani mpuu tee iaku mamudhaakana kuundaakea to ambuli i kampona i Bait Lahim roonamo i kota incia sumai dhaangia tee haroaana kurubani satao-satao to bhari-bharia manga witinaina.' <verse eid="1SA 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 20:7" />Ande incia apogau, 'Umbe,' maʼanana iaku kusalaamati, maka ande aʼamara, maʼanana incia bheahaejati apacilakaaku. <verse eid="1SA 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 20:8" />Rampaakanamo sumai, susuakaakumo kaasimu, roonamo ingkita padhamo tabhoke pojanjia i aroana KAWASANA OPU. Maka ande iaku mosalana, taroakamo upekamateaku, maka bholi upasaraakaaku i amamu."<verse eid="1SA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 20:9" />Lawanina Yonatan, "Bholi umeri! Roonamo ande atotuu-totuu kumataua o amaku padhamo ahaejati to apacilakako, inda amungki iaku inda bhekupaumbaakako!"<verse eid="1SA 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 20:10" />Kasiimpo Daud aabha uka i Yonatan, "Incema bhemopaumbaakaaku ande o amamu akasara alawaniko?"<verse eid="1SA 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 20:11" />Pogauna Yonatan tee Daud, "Maimo talingkaaka i tana lapa." Kasiimpo manga incia alingkamo i tana lapa.<verse eid="1SA 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 20:12" />Kasiimpo Yonatan apogau tee Daud, "Iaku kuposumpa to sarona KAWASANA OPU, Aulataʼala isombana miana Israel. Naile saeona atawa naipua i wakutuu mopokana mboo sii uka, iaku bhekuʼusaha to kumatauaka antona ngangarandana amaku. Ande amalape o kadhaangiana, iaku bhekutumpu mia to alambokoakako lele. <verse eid="1SA 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 20:13" />Maka ande incia ahaejati to apacilakako, dhaanamo iaku kupaumbaakako mamudhaakana umembali upasalaamati karomu. Ande o giu incia sumai inda kupewaua taroakamo KAWASANA OPU ahukumuaku. Maasangia o KAWASANA OPU atulungiko mboomo Incia atulungi amaku i piamo itu. <verse eid="1SA 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 20:14" />Ande dhaangiapo kudhadhi, udhanimea o pojanjiata i aroana KAWASANA OPU tee ususuakaakumo kaasina. Maka ande kumate, <verse eid="1SA 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 20:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 9:1">2Sam. 9:1</ref>. </char></note>iaku kuemani mpuu mamudhaakana bholi ubhotukia o kaasimu minaaka i witinaiku saʼumurua, sampe moomini uka o KAWASANA OPU padhamo apabinasa bhari-bharia musumu minaaka i bhawona alamu sii."<verse eid="1SA 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 20:16" />Mboomo sumai o Yonatan abhoke pojanjiana tee siwuluna Daud, tee apogau, "Taroakamo KAWASANA OPU apabinasaaka bhari-bharia musumu." <verse eid="1SA 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 20:17" />Kasiimpo Yonatan atumpu Daud to aposumpa pendua to asusuaka kaasina Daud tee incia, roonamo Yonatan amaasiaka Daud mboomo kaasina tee karona.<verse eid="1SA 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 20:18" />Kasiimpo Yonatan apogau, "Naile o kariaana bula bhaau. Manga mia dhaanamo bheapeeloko roonamo kauncuramakamu akoso. <verse eid="1SA 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 20:19" />Naipua wakutuuna soona eo, usapomo pekadhei tee ulingkamo i tampana opoamu i piamo itu, kasiimpo uantagimo i saripina Bhatu Ezil. <verse eid="1SA 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 20:20" />Iaku bhekurambasaka talu angu anana pana i saripina bhatu sumai, mboomo kabilanga dhaangia tee imetaku. <verse eid="1SA 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 20:21" />Kasiimpo iaku bhekutumpu bhatuaku to aene pendua manga anana pana sumai. Ande kupogau tee bhatuaku, 'Kamatea manga anana pana i weta iwe sii', pogauku sumai akomaʼana ingkoo uʼamanimo tee umembalimo ulimba. Iaku kuposumpa to sarona KAWASANA OPU modhadhi, ande ingkoo usalaamatimo tee indamo dhaangia o mia bhemopacilakako. <verse eid="1SA 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 20:22" />Maka ande kupogau mboo sii tee bhatua sumai, 'Kamatea, manga anana pana momaridhona i weta iwe sumako,' pogauku sumai akomaʼana ulingkamo, roonamo KAWASANA OPU atumpukomo ulingka. <verse eid="1SA 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 20:23" />Pokaiana tee giu mopadhana ipogauakata sumai, satotuuna o KAWASANA OPU dhaangia i tanga-tangaku tee i tanga-tangamu saʼumurua."<verse eid="1SA 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 20:24" />Jadi o Daud aopomo i tana lapa. Tee wakutuuna kariaana bula bhaau akawamo o Raja Saul aumba tee auncura akande i kariaa sumai. <verse eid="1SA 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 20:25" />Mboomo kananeana, incia auncura i kauncuramaka i saripina rindi, sainamo Yonatan auncura i aroana, tee o Abner auncura i saripina Raja Saul; maka o tampana Daud asadhaadhaa akoso. <verse eid="1SA 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 20:26" />I eo incia sumai o Saul inda apogauaka opeopea, roonamo afikiria, "Aipomo dhaangia tee saangu hali monaajisi mokangkanaina Daud,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">saangu hali monaajisi mokangkanaina Daud: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aipomo Saul aabhia ande o Daud inda amangkilo roonamo saangu giu, mboomo rampaakanamo akeni bhangkena binata. Abhari o tutura i nuncana Hukumu Taurati mosababuakana mia inda amangkilo.</char></note> sampe incia inda aumba i kariaa sii, umbe, koroo mboo sumai." <verse eid="1SA 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 20:27" />Maka samainawana, siitumo i eo rua eona i kariaana bula bhaau sumai, kauncuramakana Daud sadhaadhaana uka akoso. Sumaimo o Saul aabhamo i Yonatan, "Apokia minaaka i iawi sakawana i eo sii o anana Isai sumai indapo uka aumba akande i kariaa sii?"<verse eid="1SA 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 20:28" />Yonatan alawani Raja Saul, "Daud padhamo aemani mpuu tee iaku mamudhaakana kuundaakea to ambuli i Bait Lahim. <verse eid="1SA 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 20:29" />Pogauna, 'Undaakaakumo kulingkaaka, roonamo bhari-bharia mia tangasaana apadhaangia kariaana kurubani i kotamami, tee o akaku atumpuaku kuumba iwe sumai. Jadi ande umaasiakaaku, undaakaakumo kulingkaaka kupokawa tee manga witinaiku sii-sii.' Giumo incia sumai mosababuakana incia inda aumba i kariaana raja sii."<verse eid="1SA 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 20:30" />Sumaimo aʼamaramo mpuu o Saul tee Yonatan tee apogau, "Ingkoo sii o anana minaaka i bhawine pasunda tee modorohaka! Buaka iaku inda kumatauko ande uewaaka anana Isai sumai? Ingkoo sii upekaea karomu tee inamu! <verse eid="1SA 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 20:31" />Kangengena anana Isai sumai dhaangiapo adhadhi i bhawona dunia sii, ingkoo tee pamarintamu inda bheamatangka. Sii-sii tumpumo mia to abhawaaka Daud iwe sii roonamo incia alaenga to amate tee iaku bhekupekamatea."<verse eid="1SA 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 20:32" />Maka o Yonatan aabhaki amana, "Apokia incia bheupekamatea? Opea o dosana?" <verse eid="1SA 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 20:33" />Kasiimpo Saul atudhaaka pandangana tee gauna apekamate Yonatan. Sumaimo o Yonatan amataumea ande o amana atotuu-totuu bheahaejati apekamate Daud.<verse eid="1SA 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 20:34" />Rampaakanamo sumai o Yonatan aʼamara mpuu tee alausaka abholi kariaa sumai. Incia inda akande opeapo uka i eo rua eona kariaana bula bhaau sumai. Ngangarandana amaheru rampaakanamo o amana padhamo ahina Daud.<verse eid="1SA 20:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 20:35" />Samainawana o Yonatan alingkamo i tana lapa to apokawaaka Daud tee incia abhawa samia anaana maidhiidhi to bhatuana mboomo mopadhana imambotuakana. <verse eid="1SA 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 20:36" />Kasiimpo apogaumo Yonatan tee bhatuana sumai, "Buntulimo tee upeelomea o matana pana ipalimbaku!" Siimpo mpuu o bhatuana sumai abuntuli, Yonatan apalimbamo samata anana panana modhalana i bhawona bhaana bhatuana sumai. <verse eid="1SA 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 20:37" />Wakutuuna o bhatua sumai akawa i tampana kandawuna matana pana sumai, Yonatan agoramo minaaka i talikuna bhatuana sumai, pogauna, "Maju saidhepo uka i weta iwe sumako!" <verse eid="1SA 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 20:38" />Yonatan apogau uka, "Siapumo, lingkamo pekadhei tee bholi soo ukabhale-bhale!" Bhatua sumai aenemo matana pana sumai kasiimpo ambuli pendua i Yonatan. <verse eid="1SA 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 20:39" />Bhatuana sumai inda amaʼanaia opea ipogauakana Yonatan, maka tangkanamo Yonatan tee Daud momataua. <verse eid="1SA 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 20:40" />Sapadhana sumai o Yonatan adhawuakamo panana to bhatuana sumai tee apogau, "Lingkamo, bhawamea i kota."<verse eid="1SA 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 20:41" />Salingkana bhatuana sumai, Daud alimbamo minaaka i tampana opoana i weta i salatana bhatu sumai, kasiimpo asuju talu mpearo tee o rouna atumpu i tana. Manga incia atangi tee aposakulaka, tee o tangina Daud alabhi o kabharina minaaka i tangina Yonatan.<verse eid="1SA 20:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 20:42" />Yonatan apogau tee Daud, "Maasangia o KAWASANA OPU apasalaamatiko roonamo ingkita padhamo taposumpa, 'KAWASANA OPU bheadhaangia i tanga-tangata, tee o siwuluta bheatorotorosu akeniaka pojanjiata saʼumurua.' " Sapadhana sumai o Daud alingkamo, tee o Yonatan ambulimo pendua i kota.<verse eid="1SA 20:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1SA 21" />
  <para style="s1">Daud i Kota Nob</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 21:1-9">21:1-9</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 21:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:1-6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:3-4">Mat. 12:3-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:25-26">Mrk. 2:25-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:3">Luk. 6:3</ref>. </char>
    </note>Kasiimpo o Daud alingkamo i Kota Nob to apokawa tee Imamu Ahimelekh. Wakutuuna Ahimelekh apepago Daud, incia arengkuaka kaeka tee aabha, "Apokia uumba iwe sii samia-miamu tee inda samia uka mopoosena tee ingkoo?"<verse eid="1SA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 21:2" />Daud alawani Imamu Ahimelekh, "Raja adhawuakaaku saangu tugasi, maka incia apogau, 'Bholi dhaangia o mia momatauna opea ipatugasiakaku to ingkoo sii.' Rampaakanamo sumai manga suludaduku padhamo kutumpua to aantagiaku i saangu tampa to pokawaamami. <verse eid="1SA 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 21:3" />Maka ande amembali kuabhapo, dhaangia tee giu momembalina ikande iwe sii? Dhawuakupo lima angu roti atawa opeapo uka momembalina ikande."<verse eid="1SA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 21:4" />Pogauna Imamu Ahimelekh, "Inda dhaangia o roti biasa, maka modhaangiana tangkanamo rotina pasombaa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">roti pasombaa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Roti pasombaa sumai adhikaia i meja to apasombaakea i aroana Tampa Momangkilo i nuncana Kemana Aulataʼala. Roti incia sii asusuaka ande manga mia tangasaana i aroana Aulataʼala. Kananeana tangkanamo manga imamu momembalina mokandena roti incia sii. Kamata <char style="xt"><ref loc="LEV 24:5-7">Im. 24:5-7</ref> </char> </char></note> Ingkomiu amembali ualea tee ukande roti incia sumai somanamo ingkomiu inda siimpo padha ukole tee bhawine."<verse eid="1SA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 21:5" />Daud alawani Imamu Ahimelekh, "Atantumo ingkami inda tatoundaaka takole tee bhawine mboomo kananeamami ande talimba tatugasi i potimbea mamudhaakana tasadhaadhaa tamangkilo moomini tangkanamo soo tugasi biasa. Ntaranamo uka i eo sii ingkami takarajaa tugasi mohususu." <verse eid="1SA 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 21:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:5-9">Im. 24:5-9</ref>. </char></note>Rampaakanamo sumai, Imamu Ahimelekh adhawuakamo roti mopadhana ipasombaaka sumai to Daud, roonamo inda dhaangia o roti mosagaanana iwe sumai tee tangkanamo soo roti pasombaa siimpo mopadhana iangka minaaka i tampana pasombaa to KAWASANA OPU tee motobholosiakana tee roti mobhaau.<verse eid="1SA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 21:7" />I eo incia sumai dhaangia samia o pagawena Saul moumbana iwe sumai to aose haroaana pasombaana KAWASANA OPU mokosaroakana Do'eg; incia o miana Edom mokapalaina manga gembalana Saul.<verse eid="1SA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 21:8" />Daud apogaumo tee Imamu Ahimelekh, "Dhaangia tee pandanga atawa o hancumu momembalina ipakeku? Iaku kukaago-ago kupotibhaaka tugasi hususu minaaka i raja, sabutuna inda tee wakutuuku to kubhawa pandanga tee hancu atawa o ewanga mosagaanana uka."<verse eid="1SA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 21:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 17:51">1Sam. 17:51</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 17:54">17:54</ref>. </char>
    </note>Lawanina Imamu Ahimelekh, "Iwe sii modhaangiana tangkanamo hancuna Goliat miana Filistin mopadhana ipekamatemu i Mbolongana Tarbantin. Hancu incia sumai kutangeakea kae tee kudhikaia i talikuna bhaju efod. Ande upeelua, kualaakako, roonamo inda dhaangia o ewanga mosagaanana tangkanamo incia sumai."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 21:9">Pogauna Daud, "Hancu incia itu inda dhaangia o sampodhimbana i saangua lipu sii; dhawuakaakumo!"<verse eid="1SA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daud i Kota Gat</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 21:10-15">21:10-15</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 21:10" />I eo incia sumai uka o Daud apalaiaka karona minaaka i Saul, tee akawa i Tana Filistin to apokawa tee Akhis rajana Kota Gat. <verse eid="1SA 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 21:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:7">1Sam. 18:7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 29:5">29:5</ref>. </char></note>Manga pagawena Akhis apogau tee raja mboo sii, "Mencuana incia buaka mokosaroakana Daud rajana lipu incia sumai? Mencuana pokaiana tee incia buaka mbakana manga incia alagu-laguakea tee apoose amanari mboo sii,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 21:11" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 21:11">"Saul apekamate rewu-rewuna mia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 21:11">maka o Daud pulu-puluna rewu mia."<verse eid="1SA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 21:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 56:1">Zab. 56:1</ref>. </char>
    </note>Daud afikiriakea torotorosu o pogau incia sumai, sabutuna incia amaeka mpuu tee Raja Akhis. <verse eid="1SA 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 21:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:1">Zab. 34:1</ref>. </char></note>Rampaakanamo sumai o Daud apara-para amagila i aroana manga incia. Daud abhori-bhori bhambana lawa tee ataroakea o wiluna atiri i jangkuna.<verse eid="1SA 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 21:14" />Kasiimpo o Akhis apogau tee manga pagawena, "Buaka inda ukamatea o mia incia sumai amagila? Apokia ingkomiu ubhawea i aroaku? <verse eid="1SA 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 21:15" />Abharimo mpuu o mia magila iwe sii. Indamo afaraluu ubhawea iwe sii to apewauaka kagilana i aroaku sii! Tee bholi utaroakea apesua i nuncana bhanuaku!"<verse eid="1SA 21:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1SA 22" />
  <para style="s1">Daud Adhaangia i Kota Adulam tee i Kota Mizpa</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 22:1-5">22:1-5</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 57:1">Zab. 57:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 142:1">142:1</ref>. </char>
    </note>Kasiimpo Daud apalaiaka karona minaaka i Kota Gat tee aopo i lia momakasuna tee Kota Adulam. Manga akana tee bhari-bharia witinaina aumba to apokawaakea wakutuuna manga incia arangoa ande o Daud adhaangia iwe sumai. <verse eid="1SA 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 22:2" />Tee dhaangia uka manga mia motopisaki, mia mokodhosa, mia momapiina incana aposaumba tee aposaangu tee Daud, tee o Daud amembali kapalana manga incia. Kabharina manga incia kera-kera dhaangia pata atu umane.<verse eid="1SA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 22:3" />Kasiimpo minaaka i lia sumai o Daud alingka i Kota Mizpa modhaangiana i Tana Moab tee apogau tee rajana Moab, "Iaku kuemani mpuu mamudhaakana o amaku tee inaku amembali amboore iwe sii sakawana kumataua opea bheipewauna Aulataʼala to karoku." <verse eid="1SA 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 22:4" />Kasiimpo Daud abhawa mancuanana i rajana Moab, tee manga incia asadhaadhaa amboore tee rajana Moab kangengena Daud amboore i nuncana tampana potaangiana sumai.<verse eid="1SA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 22:5" />Maka dhaangia samia nabii mokosaroakana Gad mopogauna tee Daud, "Bholi umboore i nuncana tampana potaangiamu sii, maka ulingkamo tee umbulimo i Tana Yehuda." Kasiimpo o Daud alingkamo tee apesua i Koona Keret.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Koona Keret: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Maʼanana o "Koo Ponue." </char></note><verse eid="1SA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Manga Imamu i Kota Nob Apekamatea Raja Saul</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 22:6-23">22:6-23</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 22:6" />Raja Saul arango lele ande dhaangia tee mia mokamatana tampana opoana Daud tee manga mia mopoosena tee incia. Wakutuu incia sumai o Saul tangasaana auncura tee akeni pandanga i tambena puuna tamariska i bhawona kabumbu i Kota Gibea tee abulilingia manga pagawena. <verse eid="1SA 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 22:7" />Saul apogau tee manga pagawena, "E manga witinaiku miana Binyamin, rangoa! Buaka o anana Isai sumai bheadhawuakakomiu tana tee inawuna angguru <char style="add">ande incia amembali rajana Israel</char>? Buaka incia bheaangkakomiu to umembali kapitana sarewu suludadu atawa o kapitana saatu suludadu? <verse eid="1SA 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 22:8" />Aipomo rampaakanamo incia sumai ingkomiu upomufakati to ubhaliaku! Apokia ingkomiu inda samia uka mopaumbaakaaku ande o anaku padhamo abhoke pojanjia tee anana Isai sumai? Inda samia uka mominaakana ingkomiu momaheruakaaku atawa mopaumbaaku ande o anaku padhamo awuju pagaweku to aewangiaku sabutuna incia asiapu to ahumbuniaku mboomo momembalina eo sii."<verse eid="1SA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 22:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:9-10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 52:2">Zab. 52:2</ref>. </char>
    </note>Wakutuu incia sumai o Doʼeg miana Edom sumai akabhale-bhale i saripina pagawena Saul tee apogau, "Wakutuuna i Kota Nob iaku kukamata anana Isai sumai aumbati Imamu Ahimelekh bin Ahitub. <verse eid="1SA 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 22:10" />Ahimelekh aabha i KAWASANA OPU pokaiana tee opea tabeana bheipewauna Daud. Incia uka adhawuakea roti tee hancuna Goliat miana Filistin sumai to Daud."<verse eid="1SA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 22:11" />Kasiimpo Raja Saul atumpumo mia to alingkaaka akemba Imamu Ahimelekh bin Ahitub tee bhari-bharia witinaina, siitumo manga imamu i Kota Nob. Sumaimo manga incia aumbamo to apoaro tee Raja Saul.<verse eid="1SA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 22:12" />Pogauna Saul, "E anana Ahitub, rangoa."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:12">Lawanina, "Umbe, Opuku."<verse eid="1SA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 22:13" />Kasiimpo aabhamo o Saul i Imamu Ahimelekh, "Apokia ingkoo tee anana Isai sumai upomufakati to ubhaliaku? Apokia udhawuakea roti tee samata ewanga tee uka uabha i KAWASANA OPU pokaina tee opea bheipewauna? Rampaakanamo kahambamu sumai, sabutuna sii-sii incia abhaliaku tee tangasaana apeeloakaaku wakutuu to apekamateaku."<verse eid="1SA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 22:14" />Lawanina Imamu Ahimelekh, "Incema buaka o bhatuamu molabhina kataʼatina minaaka i Daud? Ntaranamo uka incia o ana maniamu tee o kapitana manga suludadu mojaganina raja tee bhari-bharia mia modhaangiana i nuncana maligemu ahoromatia. <verse eid="1SA 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 22:15" />Buaka siimpo eo sii iaku kuabha i Aulataʼala pokaina tee opea tabeana bheipewauna Daud? Inda! E raja, bholi uraeakaaku tee manga witinaiku pokaiana tee manga parakara incia sumai, roonamo bhari-bharia giu incia sumai inda kumataua."<verse eid="1SA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 22:16" />Maka o Raja Saul apogau tee Ahimelekh, "Inda, ingkoo tee bhari-bharia witinaimu tabeana utopekamate!"<verse eid="1SA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 22:17" />Kasiimpo Raja Saul apogau tee manga suludaduna mokabhale-bhalena i saripina, "Pekamatemea manga imamuna KAWASANA OPU sumai, roonamo manga incia aewaaka Daud. Manga incia amataua ande o Daud apalaiaka karona, maka manga incia inda apaumbaakaaku."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 22:17">Maka manga pagawena raja sumai amendeu apekamate manga imamuna KAWASANA OPU.<verse eid="1SA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 22:18" />Kasiimpo Raja Saul apogau tee Do'eg miana Edom sumai, "Majumo tee upekamatea manga imamu sumai!" Sumaimo o Do'eg amajumo tee apekamate bhari-bharia imamu modhaangiana iwe sumai. I eo incia sumai o Doʼeg apekamate walu pulu lima mia imamu mopakena bhaju efod minaaka i kae lenan. <verse eid="1SA 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 22:19" />Incia uka apekamate bhari-bharia raʼeatina Kota Nob, siitumo kotana manga imamu sumai. Malape umane, bhawine, anaana maidhiidhi atawa o anaana dhaangiapo modudu, sapi, keledai, tee dumba uka apekamateakea tee hancu.<verse eid="1SA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 22:20" />Maka dhaangia samia minaaka i anana Ahimelekh bin Ahitub, mokosaroakana Abyatar momembalina mopalaiakana karona tee alausaka aposaangu tee Daud. <verse eid="1SA 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 22:21" />Abyatar apetulatulaakea i Daud ande o Saul padhamo apekamate manga imamuna KAWASANA OPU. <verse eid="1SA 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 22:22" />Pogauna Daud i Abyatar, "Wakutuuna kukamata Doʼeg miana Edom adhaangia iwe sumai, iaku kumataua ande incia dhaanamo bheakabarataakaaku i Saul. Jadi iakumo mosababuakana matena bhari-bharia witinaimu. <verse eid="1SA 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 22:23" />Mbooremo tee iaku, bholi umaeka, roonamo mia bhemopekamateko sumai o mia bhemopekamateaku uka. Ingkoo bheuʼamani umboore tee iaku."<verse eid="1SA 22:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1SA 23" />
  <para style="s1">Daud Apasalaamati Kota Kehila</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 23:1-6">23:1-6</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 23:1" />Saangu wakutuu o Daud arango lele ande o miana Filistin tangasaana ahumbuni Kota Kehila tee manga incia arampasi manga gandum i tampana papogaana ompolena gandum. <verse eid="1SA 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 23:2" />Kasiimpo Daud aabhamo i KAWASANA OPU pokaiana tee opea tabeana bheipewauna, "Buaka iaku tabeana kulingka kupoewangi tee miana Filistin?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:2">Lawanina KAWASANA OPU, "Umbe, lingkamo upoewangiakea tee upasalaamati raʼeatina Kota Kehila."<verse eid="1SA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 23:3" />Maka manga ana buana Daud apogau, "Udhania, sainamo i Tana Yehuda sii tamaekamo, ntaranamo uka ande talingka i Kota Kehila to taewangi suludaduna Filistin."<verse eid="1SA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 23:4" />Kasiimpo Daud aabhamo uka i KAWASANA OPU pokaiana tee opea tabeana bheipewauna tee o KAWASANA OPU alawani, "Lingkamo i Kota Kehila roonamo Iaku bhekupasaraakaaka miana Filistin i limamu." <verse eid="1SA 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 23:5" />Sumaimo o Daud tee manga ana buana alingkamo i Kota Kehila to apoewangiaka miana Filistin. Manga incia apekatalo miana Filistin tee arampasi kadhambaakana. Mboomo sumai o Daud apasalaamati raʼeatina Kota Kehila. <verse eid="1SA 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 23:6" />Wakutuuna Abyatar bin Ahimelekh apalaiaka karona i Daud, tee aose Daud sakawana i Kota Kehila, incia uka abhawa bhaju efod.<verse eid="1SA 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Raja Saul Apajere Daud</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 23:7-13">23:7-13</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 23:7" />Wakutuuna Raja Saul arango lele ande o Daud aumbamo i Kota Kehila, Saul apogaumo, "Daud padhamo apasaraakaakea Aulataʼala i limaku, roonamo incia apesuaiki kota mokobente tee motokuncina bhambana lawana, sabutuna incia indamo amembali apalaiaka karona." <verse eid="1SA 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 23:8" />Sumaimo Saul aromusakamo tantarana to alingkaaka ahumbuni Daud tee bhari-bharia ana buana i Kota Kehila.<verse eid="1SA 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 23:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 30:7-8">1Sam. 30:7-8</ref>.</char>
    </note>Maka wakutuuna Daud amataua ande o Saul dhaangia tee haejati madhakina tee incia, Daud apogaumo tee imamu Abyatar, "Bhawamea iwe sii o bhaju efod sumai." <verse eid="1SA 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 23:10" />Kasiimpo Daud adoʼa, "E KAWASANA OPU, Aulataʼala i sombana miana Israel, iaku kurango lele ande o Saul ahaejati aumba i Kota Kehila to apahancuru kota incia sii roonamo iaku kudhaangia iwe sii. <verse eid="1SA 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 23:11" />Buaka manga miana Kota Kehila bheahamba Saul to arakoaku, tee buaka atotuu incia bheaumba mboomo irangoku? E KAWASANA OPU, Aulataʼala isombana miana Israel, tulungi lawaniaku."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 23:11">Lawanina KAWASANA OPU, "Umbe, Saul bheaumba."<verse eid="1SA 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 23:12" />Daud aabha uka pendua, "Buaka manga miana Kota Kehila bheahamba Saul to arakoaku tee manga ana buaku?" Lawanina KAWASANA OPU, "Umbe, manga incia dhaanamo bhearakokomiu."<verse eid="1SA 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 23:13" />Sumaimo Daud tee manga ana buana kabharina kera-kera nama atu mia alausaka alimba minaaka i Kota Kehila. Manga incia apekapinda-pinda o tampana mbooresana mamudhaakana inda amembali arakoa Saul. Wakutuuna Saul arango lele ande o Daud alimbamo minaaka i Kota Kehila, incia apabatalamea o haejatina to alingka i Kota Kehila. Daud Apasalaamati Kota Kehila.<verse eid="1SA 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daud i Tana Matuuna Zif</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 23:14-28">23:14-28</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 23:14" />Daud amboore i tana matuu, i nuncana tampana potaangiana. Tee uka amboore i manga kabumbu i Tana Matuuna Zif. Raja Saul saesaeo apeelo Daud, maka o Aulataʼala inda apasaraakaaka Daud i limana Saul.<verse eid="1SA 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 23:15" />Wakutuuna Daud dhaangia i Koresa i Tana Matuuna Zif, incia arangomo lele ande o Saul alimbamo tee manga suludaduna to aalaaka inyawana. <verse eid="1SA 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 23:16" />Sumaimo Yonatan alingkamo apokawaaka Daud i Koresa to apekatangkaaka kaparacaeana Daud ande o Aulataʼala mojagania. <verse eid="1SA 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 23:17" />Apogaumo Yonatan tee Daud, "Bholi umaeka; amaku inda bhearakoko. Roonamo incia amataua ande ingkoo bheumembali rajana miana Israel, tee iaku bhemomembalina wakilimu." <verse eid="1SA 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 23:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:3">1Sam. 18:3</ref>. </char></note>Kasiimpo manga incia abhoke saangu pojanjia i aroana KAWASANA OPU ande manga incia bheaposabhangka saʼumurua. Sapadhana incia sumai Yonatan ambulimo i bhanuana, sainamo Daud ambooremo i Koresa.<verse eid="1SA 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 23:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 54:2">Zab. 54:2</ref>. </char>
    </note>Maka dhaangia pia mia o miana Zif molingkana mopoarona tee Saul i Kota Gibea tee apogau, "Ingkami tamataua i iapai o Daud, incia apeopo i tampana potaangia i lipumami i Koresa, i bhawona Kabumbuna Hakhila i weta i salatana tana matuu. <verse eid="1SA 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 23:20" />E Raja, ingkami tamataua ande ingkoo gaumu mpuu bheurako Daud. Rampaakanamo sumai umbamo i lipumami naepiapo uka. Ingkami bhetarako Daud tee tapasaraakaakea to ingkoo."<verse eid="1SA 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 23:21" />Lawanina Saul, "Maasangia o KAWASANA OPU abarakatikomiu, roonamo ingkomiu ususuaka kaasimiu tee iaku! <verse eid="1SA 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 23:22" />Sii-sii ulingkamo tee upeeloa pendua o kadhaangiana tee mbooresana, tee incema mopadhana mokamatea iwe sumai. Roonamo iaku kurango lele ande incia akoʼakala mpuu. <verse eid="1SA 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 23:23" />Jadi uparakisaamea bhari-bharia tampana peopoana, sapadhana sumai umbulimo pendua to ulaporoakaaku, kasiimpo iaku bhekulingka kupobhawa tee ingkomiu. Ande incia dhaangiapo i lipu incia sumai, iaku bhekupeeloa moomini i tanga-tangana rewuna miana Yehuda."<verse eid="1SA 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 23:24" />Sumaimo manga incia alingkamo i Zif aporikanaaka Saul. Wakutuu incia sumai o Daud tee manga ana buana tangasaana adhaangia i Tana Matuuna Maon, i Arabah i weta i salatana tana matuuna Yehuda. <verse eid="1SA 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 23:25" />Tee mboo sumai o Saul tee manga tantarana alingkamo apeelo Daud, maka dhaangia o mia mopakoleleakana giu incia sumai i Daud, sabutuna Daud alingkamo i gunu bhatu modhaangiana i Tana Matuuna Maon tee amboore iwe sumai. Wakutuuna Saul arango giu incia sumai, incia alingkamo apajere Daud i Tana Matuuna Maon.<verse eid="1SA 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 23:26" />Wakutuuna Saul tee manga tantarana apajere Daud, manga incia adhaangia i saangu gunu mopokana. Saul tee manga tantarana adhala i gunu i weta iwe sii sainamo Daud tee manga ana buana adhala i gunu i weta iwe sumako. Daud tee manga ana buana saidhepo atorako roonamo manga incia apepuumo ahumbunia Saul, maka o Daud apekadhei apalaiaka karona. <verse eid="1SA 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 23:27" />Saanampuu aumbamo samia potolowea to apoaro tee Saul tee aposamea, "Mbulimo pekadhei! Suludaduna Filistin bheahumbunimo liputa!" <verse eid="1SA 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 23:28" />Sumaimo o Saul auntomo apajere Daud tee alingkamo apotimbe tee apoewangiaka suludaduna Filistin. Rampaakanamo sumai o tampa incia sumai asarongiakea Gunu Batu Iʼalapaaaka.<verse eid="1SA 23:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1SA 24" />
  <para style="s1">Raja Saul Atotaroaka Adhadhi</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 24:1-23">24:1-23</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 24:1" />Daud alingka minaaka iwe sumai, kasiimpo amboore i tana matuu i nuncana tampa potaangiana i En-Gedi. <verse eid="1SA 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 24:2" />Sambulina Saul minaaka i potimbea apoewangi tee miana Filistin, incia atarimamo lele mboo sii, "Daud dhaangia i tana matuu i saripina En-Gedi." <verse eid="1SA 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 24:3" />Kasiimpo o Saul abhawamo talu rewu mia tantarana minaaka i saangua Israel, kasiimpo alingka apeelo Daud tee manga ana buana i Gunu Bhatu Bhembena Koo.<verse eid="1SA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 24:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 57:1">Zab. 57:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 142:1">142:1</ref>. </char>
    </note>Kasiimpo o Saul akawamo i saripina manga kandana gulumana dumba modhaangiana i bhiwina dhala. Iwe sumai dhaangia saangu lia, tee o Saul apesua iwe sumai to alingka i jamba maridho. Wakutuu incia sumai o Daud tee manga ana buana tangasaana aopo i nuncana lia momandala mpuu. <verse eid="1SA 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 24:5" />Kasiimpo apogaumo manga ana buana tee Daud, "Siimo eo ifirimaniakana KAWASANA OPU to ingkoo, 'Satotuuna Iaku bhekupasaraakaaka musumu i nuncana limamu mamudhaakana upewau opea iabhimu momalapena.' " Sumaimo o Daud apesua inda tee uuʼuuna i tampana Saul tee adhodho saidhe tapana jubana Saul.<verse eid="1SA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 24:6" />Maka o Daud asosomo sapadhana adhodho tapana jubana Saul sumai. <verse eid="1SA 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 24:7" />Pogauna Daud tee ana buana, "Maasangia o KAWASANA OPU ajaganiaku mamudhaakana inda kupewau giu madhaki tee rajaku mopadhana ipilina KAWASANA OPU sii. Saidhe uka iaku bholi kupacilakea roonamo incia o mia mopadhana ilantina KAWASANA OPU." <verse eid="1SA 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 24:8" />Mboomo sumai o Daud apatanangi incana ana buana tee inda aundaakea to abhali Saul. Wakutuu incia sumai o Saul tangasaana bheasiapu to alimba minaaka i lia sumai to apalausakaaka lingkaana.<verse eid="1SA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 24:9" />Kasiimpo Daud alimbamo madhei minaaka i nuncana lia tee agora i talikuna Saul, pogauna, "Opuku Raja!" Wakutuuna o Raja Saul apoili, Daud asujumo tee o rouna atumpu i tana tee adhawu horomati. <verse eid="1SA 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 24:10" />Kasiimpo Daud apogau tee Saul, "Apokia uperangoi pogauna mia mopogauna ande iaku bhekupacilakako? <verse eid="1SA 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 24:11" />Satotuuna i eo sii ukamataakamea karomu tuaapa o KAWASANA OPU padhamo apasaraakaako i limaku i nuncana lia sii. Dhaangia pia mia o ana buaku mowujuaku to kupekamateko, maka iaku kumendeu kupekamateko tee kulawani, 'Iaku kumendeu kupacilakea roonamo incia o mia mopadhana ilantina KAWASANA OPU.' <verse eid="1SA 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 24:12" />Amaku ukamatapea! Kamatea o tapana jubamu dhaangia i limaku. Iaku kutumpo tapana jubamu, maka inda kupekamateko. Jadi amembalimo umataua tee ukamatea ande iaku inda dhaangia o haejatiku momadhakina atawa kuhianatiko, tee inda kupewau dosa tee ingkoo moomini upajereaku tee gaumu upekamateaku! <verse eid="1SA 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 24:13" />Maasangia o KAWASANA OPU amembali haakimu i tanga-tangata tee maasangia o KAWASANA OPU bheabalasi opea mopadhana ipewaumu tee iaku, maka moomini saidhe uka iaku inda bhekuwanduko. <verse eid="1SA 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 24:14" />Dhaangia saangu ibarati i zamani mangenge mopogauna mboo sii, 'Giu madhaki aumba minaaka i mia madhaki,' maka iaku inda bhekupacilakako. <verse eid="1SA 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 24:15" />Apokia o rajana Israel apajereaku to apekamateaku? Sainamo iaku sii inda kukoharagaa; iaku tangkanamo mboomo sambaa mantoa momate atawa mboomo sambaa kutu! <verse eid="1SA 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 24:16" />Rampaakanamo sumai, maasangia o KAWASANA OPU bheamembali haakimu to mobhotukiakana parakara i tanga-tangaku tee ingkoo. Maasangia Incia akamataaku, aewaakaaku, tee apabebasiaku minaaka i limamu."<verse eid="1SA 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 24:17" />Sapadhana Daud apakawaaka pogau incia sumai, aabhamo o Raja Saul, "Suaramu itu anaku Daud?" Kasiimpo Saul atangimo tee suara momakaa. <verse eid="1SA 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 24:18" />Pogauna Saul tee Daud, "Ingkoo ulabhi ubanara tee iaku, roonamo ingkoo padhamo upewau giu momalape tee iaku, garaaka iaku kupewau giu madhaki tee ingkoo. <verse eid="1SA 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 24:19" />I eo sii ingkoo padhamo ususuakaaku kalapena haejatimu, roonamo inda upekamateaku, moomini o KAWASANA OPU padhamo apasaraakaaku i limamu. <verse eid="1SA 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 24:20" />Buaka dhaangia o mia morambasakana musuna kasiimpo atumpua alingka tee ataroakea adhadhi? Maasangia o KAWASANA OPU abalasia o kalapemu apokana tee opea mopadhana ipewaumu tee iaku i eo sii. <verse eid="1SA 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 24:21" />Sii-sii kumataumea ande ingkoo dhaanamo bheumembali rajana Israel, tee o pamarintana Israel bheamatangka i nuncana limamu. <verse eid="1SA 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 24:22" />Rampaakanamo sumai uposumpamo to iaku to sarona KAWASANA OPU ande ingkoo inda bheupamofu siwuluku naile itu, tee uka inda uhapusu saroku i tanga-tangana sarona witinaiku."<verse eid="1SA 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 24:23" />Kasiimpo aposumpamo o Daud to Saul. Sapadhana sumai o Saul ambulimo i bhanuana, sainamo Daud tee ana buana ambulimo pendua i tampana potaangiana.<verse eid="1SA 24:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1SA 25" />
  <para style="s1">Mateana Nabii Samuel</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 25:1">25:1</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 25:1" />Inda amangenge sapadhana sumai, amatemo o Nabii Samuel. Bhari-bharia miana Israel aporomusaka to atangisia, tee incia atokoburu i bhanuana i Kota Rama. Sapadhana sumai o Daud alausakamo alingka i Tana Matuuna Paran.<verse eid="1SA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daud, Nabal, tee Abigail</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 25:2-44">25:2-44</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 25:2" />I Kota Maon dhaangia samia umane mokosaroakana Nabal. Mia incia sumai arangkaea mpuu, tee o kabharina gulumana dumbana dhaangia talu rewu mbaa tee o bhembena sarewu mbaa. Incia tangasaana agunti buluna dumbana i Karmel. <verse eid="1SA 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 25:3" />Nabal dhaangia tee bhawinena mokosaroakana Abigail. Bhawinena sumai aʼaarifu tee amakesa o rouna, sainamo umanena akasara tee amadhaki o feʼelina. Incia aminaaka i siwuluna Kaleb.<verse eid="1SA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 25:4" />Wakutuuna Daud adhaangia i tana matuu incia arangomo lele, ande o Nabal tangasaana agunti buluna manga dumbana. <verse eid="1SA 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 25:5" />Sumaimo Daud alambokomo sapulu mia ana umane mangura tee apogau, "Lingkamo i Karmel to upokawaaka tee Nabal tee upaumbaia kuabhaakea o kadhaangiana, <verse eid="1SA 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 25:6" />tee upaumbaia mboo sii, 'Maasangia ingkoo tee manga keluargamu udhadhi malape, tee adhadhi malape bhari-bharia opea modhaangiana i karomu.' "<verse eid="1SA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 25:7" />" 'Indapo amangenge sii iaku kurango lele, ande ingkoo tangasaana ugunti buluna dumbamu. Manga gembalamu modhaangiana i lipumami inda aperna tapanarakaaia, tee manga incia inda akailangaaka opeapo uka kangengena amboore i Karmel. <verse eid="1SA 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 25:8" />Coba abhakia manga bhatuamu, atantumo manga incia bheapabanarea o hali incia sii. Rampaakanamo sumai ingkami taemani kaasimu, mamudhaakana mangatarima taumba i eona raraea. Tulungi mangadhawuaka opeapo uka modhaangiana i karomu to manga bhatuamu sii tee uka to anamu o Daud.' "<verse eid="1SA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 25:9" />Wakutuuna manga potumpuana Daud akawa iwe sumai, manga incia apogaumo tee Nabal pokaiana tee opea ipogauakana Daud, kasiimpo manga incia aantagi kalawanina Nabal.<verse eid="1SA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 25:10" />Maka o Nabal alawani, "Incema buaka o Daud sumai? Buaka o anana Isai sumai o mia momalangana pangkatina? Sii-sii abhari o bhatua mopalaiakana karona minaaka i opuna. <verse eid="1SA 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 25:11" />Buaka iaku tabeana kuala rotiku, uweku, tee dagina dumba mopadhana isumbeleku to manga pande guntina buluna dumbaku, kasiimpo kudhawuakea to manga mia inda motomatauna asalana?"<verse eid="1SA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 25:12" />Jadi manga potumpuana sumai ambulimo tee sakawana i tampana Daud, manga incia apaumbaakamea bhari-bharia opea mopadhana ipogauakana Nabal. <verse eid="1SA 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 25:13" />Sumaimo Daud apogaumo tee manga ana buana, "Bhokemea o hancumiu i tangamiu samia-samia!" Kasiimpo Daud tee manga ana buana abhoke hancuna i tangana. Kera-kera pata atu umane moosena Daud, tee dhaangia rua atu umane mosagaanana inda moosea, siitumo to mojaganina manga bara.<verse eid="1SA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 25:14" />Maka sala samia minaaka i bhatuana Nabal apaumbamo bhawinena Nabal, siitumo Abigail, mboo sii, "Daud alamboko pia mia o potumpuana minaaka i tana matuu to apakawaaka salamuna kabarakatina to Nabal, maka o oputa soo amangkatua. <verse eid="1SA 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 25:15" />Garaaka manga mia incia sumai amalape tee ingkami. Manga incia inda mangaganggo, tee inda dhaangia o pewauamami mokailangana kangengena taposabhangka tee manga incia i tana lapa. <verse eid="1SA 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 25:16" />Manga incia mboomo tondo, tee malo eona mangajagani kangengena tagembalaaka gulumana dumbamami i saripina manga incia. <verse eid="1SA 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 25:17" />Rampaakanamo sumai, ufikirimea tee umambotuakamea opea tabeana bheipewaumu to giu incia sii, roonamo oputa tangasaana aaro-aro balaa, tee o giu incia sumai amembali aumbaaka kahancuru to bhari-bharia keluargamu. Oputa sii o mia momadhakina pewauna, sabutuna incia inda amembali takembaia to tapogauaka malape."<verse eid="1SA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 25:18" />Sumaimo Abigail alausakamo aala rua atu dhodho roti, rua kanto angguru, lima mbaa dagina dumba mosiapuna motonasu, talu pulu litere gandum itunu, saatu bungkusu kismis, tee rua atu angu hole-hole minaaka i bhakena ara. Bhari-bharia sumai auleaia i bhawona manga keledai. <verse eid="1SA 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 25:19" />Kasiimpo Abigail apogau tee manga ana buana, "Lingkamo porikanaakaaku, dhaampomo kututunikomiu." Maka o giu incia sumai inda apaumbaakea i Nabal umanena.<verse eid="1SA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 25:20" />Tee asawiki keledaina, Abigail asapo alaloi dhala ijolina manga kabumbu, kasiimpo akamatamo Daud tee manga ana buana atitingkulu aporope i weta i incia, sabutuna manga incia apokawamo. <verse eid="1SA 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 25:21" />Daud padhamo abhoasaka pogau incia sii wakutuuna indapo apokawa tee Abigail, "Asia-siamo kujagani pewauana mia incia sii, sampe inda dhaangia o harataana mokailangana wakutuuna i tana matuu, maka o kalapeku sumai abalasia tee kadhaki. <verse eid="1SA 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 25:22" />Mboo siimo o KAWASANA OPU bheahukumuaku,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">bheahukumuaku: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dhaangia uka o kaburi mangenge i nuncana pogau Ibrani atoburi "Bheahukumu manga musuna Daud."</char></note> tee aipomo bhealabhi minaaka i incia sii, ande inda kupekamate bhari-bharia umane modhaangia i bhanuana Nabal wakutuuna indapo abhete matana eo."<verse eid="1SA 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 25:23" />Wakutuuna Abigail akamata Daud, incia apekadheimo asapo minaaka i keledaina, kasiimpo asujumo tee o rouna atumpu i tana to ahoromati Daud. <verse eid="1SA 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 25:24" />Kasiimpo incia apogau, "E Opuku, taroakamo bhatuamu sii bhemotanggona kasalaha incia sumai. Undaakaakupo kupogau, tee uperangoipea o pogauna bhatuamu sii. <verse eid="1SA 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 25:25" />E Opuku, iaku kuemani mpuu mamudhaakana inda ufaduliaka Nabal momadhakina pewauna sumai. Incia akabhongo-bhongo apokana mboomo sarona.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">sarona: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nabal akomaʼana "kabhongo-bhongo" i nuncana pogau Ibrani. </char></note> Satotuuna iaku inda kukamatea manga potumpua ilambokomu sumai. <verse eid="1SA 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 25:26" />Sii-sii o KAWASANA OPU padhamo apasalaamatiko mamudhaakana inda ubalasi tee upekamate manga musumu tee limamu karomu. Rampaakanamo sumai iaku kuposumpa to sarona KAWASANA OPU modhadhi tee i aroamu, iaku kuharapu bhari-bharia musumu tee incemapo uka bhemohaejatina to mopacilakako bheapokana tee dhadhina Nabal. <verse eid="1SA 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 25:27" />E Opuku, tarimamea o kadhawu ibhawaku sii tee udhawuakea to manga ana buamu."<verse eid="1SA 25:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 25:28" />"Maasangia uʼamponia o kasalahana bhatuamu sii. KAWASANA OPU bheabalasiko tee manga siwulumu aundaakea amembali rajana Israel roonamo ingkoo upotimbe i nuncana potimbea ipeeluna KAWASANA OPU, tee ingkoo inda bheupewau madhaki saʼumurua dhadhimu. <verse eid="1SA 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 25:29" />Ande dhaangia o mia mopajereko tee bhemopekamateko, sumaimo inyawamu bheatangea i nuncana katangena manga mia modhadhina moosena KAWASANA OPUNA Aulataʼalamu, maka o dhadhina manga musumu bheatotudhaaka mboomo bhatuna pate. <verse eid="1SA 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 25:30" />Ande o KAWASANA OPU padhamo apewau bhari-bharia giu momalape mboomo mopadhana ifirimaniakana to ingkoo, tee Incia padhamo apatotapuakako to umembali rajana miana Israel, <verse eid="1SA 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 25:31" />sumaimo ingkoo inda bheutosunu atawa amaheru incamu tee usoso roonamo indamo upekamate mia inda tee alasana, tee ingkoo inda uose kapeeluamu karomu wakutuuna ubalasi mia. Udhania, ande o KAWASANA OPU padhamo adhawuakako kasalaamati, bholi umalinguakaaku."<verse eid="1SA 25:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1SA 25:32" />Kasiimpo Daud apogau tee Abigail, "Atopujimo KAWASANA OPU, Aulataʼala isombana miana Israel. Incia padhamo alambokoko to upokawaakaaku i eo sii. <verse eid="1SA 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1SA 25:33" />Atopujimo kaʼaarifumu tee atopujimo karomu, roonamo pemingkuimu tee pogaumu motulungiaku indaaka kupekamate mia, tee inda kuose kapeeluaku karoku to kupeelo kaʼadili tee limaku karoku. <verse eid="1SA 25:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1SA 25:34" />Maka kuposumpa to sarona KAWASANA OPU modhadhi mopadhana motaangiaku mamudhaakana inda kupekamateko, tee ande ingkoo inda uumba madhei upokawaakaaku, sumaimo bhari-bharia ana buana Nabal bhekupekamatea wakutuuna indapo abhete matana eo."<verse eid="1SA 25:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1SA 25:35" />Kasiimpo Daud atarimamo bhari-bharia opea ibhawana Abigail sumai tee apogau, "Mbulimo tee utanangimo i bhanuamu tee bholimo umaheru. Iaku kuperangoimea bhari-bharia opea ipogauakamu."<verse eid="1SA 25:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1SA 25:36" />Wakutuuna Abigail ambuli i bhanuana, garaaka o Nabal tangasaana apadhaangia kariaa maoge mboomo kariaana samia raja. Ngangarandana akaunde-unde tee incia amalango mpuu, sumaimo Abigail inda apetulatulaaka opeapo uka tee Nabal sakawana saeona. <verse eid="1SA 25:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1SA 25:37" />Maka wakutuuna Nabal asadaramo minaaka i kalangona, Abigail apetulatulaakamea bhari-bharia giu incia sumai, tee o Nabal alausaka apaangka ngangarandana tee saangua badana indamo amembali akomingku. <verse eid="1SA 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1SA 25:38" />Kera-kera sapulu eo sapadhana kajadia incia sumai, Nabal amatemo roonamo ahukumumea KAWASANA OPU.<verse eid="1SA 25:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1SA 25:39" />Wakutuuna Daud arango lelena Nabal amatemo, incia apogaumo, "Bhari-bharia kapujia to KAWASANA OPU mopadhana moewaakana parakaraku pokaiana tee kahinana Nabal! Incia ajaganiaku mamudhaakana inda kupewau giu madhaki. Kadhakina Nabal sumai padhamo apambuliakea KAWASANA OPU pendua to karona."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 25:39">Kasiimpo Daud alamboko manga potumpuana to apogau tee Abigail, pokaina tee haejatina to alosaaka Abigail to apamembalia bhawinena. <verse eid="1SA 25:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1SA 25:40" />Wakutuuna manga potumpuana sumai apokawa tee Abigail i Karmel, manga incia apogaumo, "Daud mangatumpu to talosaakako mamudhaakana umembali bhawinena."<verse eid="1SA 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1SA 25:41" />Abigail alausakamo asuju tee o rouna atumpu i tana tee apoose apogau, "Iaku sii o bhatuana oputa mosiapuna motarimana parinta to kubhanuiaka aena manga ana buana sumai." <verse eid="1SA 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1SA 25:42" />Abigail alausakamo aposintuwu tee asawimo i keledaina. Incia aosea lima mia bhatuana bhawine tee manga incia alingkamo aose manga potumpuana Daud sumai. Kasiimpo Abigail amembalimo bhawinena Daud. <verse eid="1SA 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1SA 25:43" />Wakutuuna Daud indapo akobhawineaka Abigail, incia padhamo akawiaka Ahinoam minaaka i Yizreel. Jadi rua miaia bhawine sumai amembalimo bhawinena. <verse eid="1SA 25:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1SA 25:44" />Sainamo Mikhal anana Saul momembalina bhawinena Daud mobhaa-bhaana, padhamo adhawuaka Palti bin Lais mominaakana i Kota Galim to apamembalia bhawinena.<verse eid="1SA 25:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1SA 26" />
  <para style="s1">Kamondona Rua Mpearo o Daud Ataroaka Raja Saul Adhadhi</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 26:1-25">26:1-25</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 26:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 54:2">Zab. 54:2</ref>. </char>
    </note>Saangu wakutuu manga miana Zif aumbati Raja Saul i Kota Gibea tee apogau, "Daud tangasaana abuniaka karona i Kabumbuna Hakhila mopoarona tee tana matuu."<verse eid="1SA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 26:2" />Sumaimo Raja Saul alausakamo aporope i Tana Matuuna Zif apoose tee talu rewu tantarana Israel motopili to apeeloaka Daud. <verse eid="1SA 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 26:3" />Kasiimpo Saul tee tantarana apokema i bhiwina dhala i bhawona Kabumbuna Hakhila mopoarona tee tana matuu, sainamo Daud sadhaadhaa amboore i tana matuu. Wakutuuna Daud arango Saul aumba to apeeloa i tana matuu sumai, <verse eid="1SA 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 26:4" />Daud alamboko pia mia o mata-matana sabutuna amataumea ande o Saul atotuu-totuu aumbamo iwe sumai.<verse eid="1SA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 26:5" />Kasiimpo Daud alingkamo apekadhei i pokemaana Saul sumai. Incia akamatamo Saul tee Abner bin Ner o kapitana tantarana tangasaana akole i tanga-tangana pokemaa sumai, sainamo bhari-bharia kemana manga tantarana abulilingi kemana Saul.<verse eid="1SA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 26:6" />Kasiimpo Daud aabha i Ahimelekh miana Het sumai, tee Abisai o anana Zeruya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zeruya: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Incia o witinaina Daud bhawine, jadi Yoab tee Abisai o pinoanana Daud umane. </char></note> witinaina Yoab, "Incema moundana mopobhawana tee iaku to tapesuaaka i nuncana pokemaana Saul?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:6">Abisai alawani, "Iaku kuunda."<verse eid="1SA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 26:7" />Malo incia sumai uka o Daud tee Abisai alingka i pokemaana Saul. Sakawana iwe sumai manga incia akamatamo Saul tangasaana akole i tanga-tangana pokemaana, tee o pandangana apatongkea i tana i saripina bhaana. Abner tee bhari-bharia tantarana tangasaana akole abulilingi Saul.<verse eid="1SA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 26:8" />Kasiimpo Abisai apogaumo tee Daud, "Eo sii o Aulataʼala apasaraakaakea o musumu i limamu. Rampaakanamo sumai taroakamo iaku mopatongkea i tana tee pandangana karona. Iaku bhekupekamatea tee sampearo katumbosimea tee inda apendua rua mpearo."<verse eid="1SA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 26:9" />Maka o Daud apogau tee Abisai, "Bholi upekamatea, roonamo inda dhaangia o mia momembalina molapana minaaka i kahukumuna KAWASANA OPU ande tapewau madhaki tee raja mopadhana ilantina!" <verse eid="1SA 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 26:10" />Daud apogau uka, "Iaku kuposumpa to sarona KAWASANA OPU modhadhi, ande naile itu o karona KAWASANA OPU bhemopekamatea, aipomo rampaakanamo akawamo ajalana atawa rampaakanamo amate i nuncana potimbea. <verse eid="1SA 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 26:11" />Maka taroakamo o KAWASANA OPU sadia ajaganiaku mamudhaakana inda kupekamate raja mopadhana ilantina. Alamea o pandanga tee bhosuna uwe i saripina bhaana sumai, kasiimpo maimo talingkaaka."<verse eid="1SA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 26:12" />Sumaimo Daud aalamo pandanga tee bhosuna uwe modhaangiana i saripina bhaana Saul kasiimpo alingka tee inda dhaangia mokamatea, inda tee momataua, tee inda dhaangia o mia mobhanguna minaaka i koleana roonamo manga incia apakolea KAWASANA OPU.<verse eid="1SA 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 26:13" />Sapadhana sumai o Daud apolimbamo i sawetana mbolonga mosagaanana tee akabhale-bhale i bhawona lolona kabumbu, sabutuna apomaridhomo minaaka i pokemaana Saul. <verse eid="1SA 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 26:14" />Minaaka i iwe sumai, Daud agoraakamo Abner bin Ner tee tantarana Raja Saul, pogauna, "Abner! Urangoa o suaraku sii?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:14">Lawanina Abner, "Incema ingkoo mogoraakana raja sii?"<verse eid="1SA 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 26:15" />Daud apogau tee Abner, "Ingkoo itu o umane tuaapa? Saangua Israel sii inda dhaangia o sampodhimbamu! Apokia ingkoo inda ujagania o rajamu? Wakutuuna ukole dhaangia o mia mopesuana i nuncana kemamu to mopekamatena rajamu. <verse eid="1SA 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 26:16" />Inda amalape opea ipewaumiu itu. Iaku kuposumpa to sarona KAWASANA OPU modhadhi, ingkomiu ulaenga umate, roonamo inda ujagania o rajamiu mopadhana ilantina KAWASANA OPU sumai. Coba ukamatea! I iapaimo o pandanga tee bhosuna uwe modhaangiana i saripina bhaana rajamiu?"<verse eid="1SA 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 26:17" />Raja Saul amataua o suarana Daud, kasiimpo apogaumo o Saul, "Daud, suaramu itu anaku?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:17">Lawanina Daud, "Umbe, suaraku sii Opuku Raja." <verse eid="1SA 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 26:18" />Daud apogau uka, "E Opuku apokia dhaangiapo utorotorosu upajereaku? Opea o kasalahaku? <verse eid="1SA 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 26:19" />Sii-sii maasangia uperangoia o pogauna bhatuamu sii Rajaku. Ande o KAWASANA OPU motumpuko to mobhaliaku, taroakamo Incia apotibhaaka kurubani pasombaa momembalina mopauntona amaramu to iaku. Maka ande manga maanusia motumpuko, maasangia manga incia atotunda i aroana KAWASANA OPU, roonamo sii-sii manga incia padhamo apadhencuaku tee apogau, 'Lingkamo i lipu mosagaanana tee usombamo dewa-dewana manga incia!' sabutuna iaku inda kupotibhaaka tinauraka i nuncana pusakana KAWASANA OPU. <verse eid="1SA 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 26:20" />Rampaakanamo sumai bholi utaroakea o raaku atobusaka i tana tee amaridho minaaka i aroana KAWASANA OPU. Opea o gunana rajana Israel aumba to apekamate sambaa kutu mboo iaku sii? To opea incia apajereaku mboomo mia mopajerena manu koo i tanga-tangana manga gunu?"<verse eid="1SA 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 26:21" />Kasiimpo o Saul apogau, "Iaku kukodosamo. E anaku Daud, mbulimo. Iaku indamo uka bhekupewau dosa pendua tee ingkoo, roonamo sii-sii o inyawaku akoharagaa i matamu. Satotuuna iaku kukabhongo-bhongo mpuu tee amaoge mpuu o kasalahaku."<verse eid="1SA 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 26:22" />Lawanina Daud, "Siimo o pandangana raja! Tumpumo sala samia suludadumu to aumbaaka aalea iwe sii. <verse eid="1SA 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 26:23" />KAWASANA OPU bheabarakati mia mobanara tee mia motoparacaea. Roonamo i eo sii o KAWASANA OPU padhamo apasaraakaakako i limaku, maka iaku inda kupacilaka mia mopadhana ilantina KAWASANA OPU. <verse eid="1SA 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 26:24" />Mboomo inyawamu akoharagaa i mataku i eo sii, jadi maasangia mboomo sumai uka o KAWASANA OPU bheajaganiaku tee arambasakaaku minaaka i sagala giuna kanarakaa."<verse eid="1SA 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 26:25" />Pogauna Saul, "Maasangia o KAWASANA OPU abarakatiko! Opeapo uka ipewaumu dhaanamo bheakohasili."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 26:25">Kasiimpo o Daud apalausaka lingkaana, sainamo Saul ambulimo i bhanuana.<verse eid="1SA 26:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1SA 27" />
  <para style="s1">Daud Amboore i Tanga-tangana Miana Filistin</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 27:1-28:2">27:1--28:2</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 27:1" />Maka o Daud apogau i nuncana ngangarandana, "Tuaapapo uka naile itu o Raja Saul dhaanamo bheapekamateaku. Jadi indamo dhaangia o dhala mosagaanana to karoku ande inda kupalaiaka karoku i lipuna Filistin. Tee mboo sumai o Saul bheamate o akalana to apeeloaku i saangua lipuna Israel, tee iaku bhekuʼamani."<verse eid="1SA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 27:2" />Kasiimpo o Daud tee nama atu mia ana buana alausakamo alingka i lipuna Raja Akhis bin Maokh, siitumo rajana Kota Gat. <verse eid="1SA 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 27:3" />Sumaimo o Daud tee ana buana ambooremo tee Akhis i Kota Gat apoose tee keluargana samia-samia. Daud abhawa rua miaia bhawinena, siitumo Ahinoam miana Yizreel, tee Abigail iaiarona Nabal miana Karmel sumai. <verse eid="1SA 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 27:4" />Wakutuuna Saul arango ande o Daud apalaiakamo karona i Kota Gat, incia auntomo to apajere Daud.<verse eid="1SA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 27:5" />Kasiimpo apogaumo o Daud tee Raja Akhis, "Ande umaasiakaaku, dhawuakaakumo sala saangu kota momaidhiidhi momaridhona minaaka i kotana pamarintana Filistin sii to kumbooreaka iwe sumai, mamudhaakana iaku inda kumboore kupoose tee ingkoo i nuncana Kota Gat sii."<verse eid="1SA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 27:6" />Sumaimo o Raja Akhis adhawuakamea Kota Ziklag to Daud, tee o giumo incia sumai imembaliakana Kota Ziklag amembali pewauana raja-rajana Yehuda sakawana sii-sii. <verse eid="1SA 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 27:7" />Kangengena satao pata mbula o Daud amboore i lipuna miana Filistin.<verse eid="1SA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 27:8" />Kasiimpo o Daud tee manga ana buana alingka ahumbuni miana Gesur, miana Girzi, tee miana Amalek (minaaka i piamo itu manga incia amboore i lipu incia sumai, minaaka i dhala mopesuana i Syur sakawana i Tana Mesir). <verse eid="1SA 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 27:9" />Daud apekamate bhari-bharia mia modhaangiana i lipu incia sumai, malape umane atawa o bhawine. Incia arampasi gulumana dumba, sapi, keledai, unta, tee pakeana manga mia momboorena iwe sumai, kasiimpo alingka apokawaaka Raja Akhis sambulina minaaka i potimbea.<verse eid="1SA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 27:10" />Ande aabhakia Raja Akhis, "Bheupekahumbuni i iapai i eo sii?" Sumaimo o Daud bhealawani, "I Tana Negeb i mbooresana miana Yehuda," sagaa uka incia apogau, "I Tana Negeb i mbooresana miana Yerahmeel," atawa "I Tana Negeb i mbooresana miana Keni." <verse eid="1SA 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 27:11" />Minaaka i kabharina lipu ihumbunina sumai inda samia uka itaroakana adhadhi, malape umane atawa o bhawine, mamudhaakana inda dhaangia o mia momembalina molingkana i Kota Gat to molaporoakana opea mopadhana ipewauna Daud tee ana buana. Mboomo sumai o kananeana Daud kangengena amboore i lipuna miana Filistin. <verse eid="1SA 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 27:12" />Maka o Raja Akhis aparacaea tee Daud, roonamo i nuncana fikirina, "Incia atotuu-totuu padhamo apewau karona to abancia manga mia i lipuna karona i Israel, sabutuna incia bheamembali bhatuaku moewaakaaku saʼumurua."<verse eid="1SA 27:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1SA 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 28:1" />Wakutuu incia sumai o miana Filistin apasiapu tantarana to apotimbeaka tee tantarana Israel. Kasiimpo apogaumo Raja Akhis tee Daud, "Atantumo umataua, ande ingkoo tee ana buamu bhetaposaangu tee suludaduku i nuncana potimbea sumai."<verse eid="1SA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 28:2" />Lawanina Daud, "Umbe, atantumo bheukamataakea karomu opea momembalina ipewauku to Opuku."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:2">Pogauna Raja Akhis, "Rampaakanamo sumai iaku bhekuangkako umembali kapitana manga suludadu to mojaganiaku saʼumurua."<verse eid="1SA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Raja Saul Apogau tee Sumangana Samuel i Kota En-Dor</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 28:3-25">28:3-25</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 28:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 20:27">Im. 20:27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:10-11">Kap. 18:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 25:1">1Sam. 25:1</ref>. </char>
    </note>Wakutuu incia sumai o Nabii Samuel amatemo. Bhari-bharia miana Israel atangisia tee o Samuel atokoburu i Kota Rama, siitumo i kotana karona. Wakutuu incia sumai o Raja Saul padhamo apadhencu manga bhawine pande kembana sumanga tee manga umane pande sihiri minaaka i Israel.<verse eid="1SA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 28:4" />Tantarana Filistin aporomusaka tee apokema i saripina Kota Sunem. Saul uka aromusaka bhari-bharia tantarana Israel, kasiimpo manga incia apokema i Gunu Gilboa. <verse eid="1SA 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 28:5" />Wakutuuna Saul akamata tantarana Filistin, incia amaekamo tee arengkumo. <verse eid="1SA 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 28:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:21">Kab. 27:21</ref>. </char></note>Saul aabhamo i KAWASANA OPU pokaiana tee opea tabeana bheipewauna, maka o KAWASANA OPU inda alawania, malape alaloi pongipina, alaloi Urim atawa alaloi potoloweana manga nabii. <verse eid="1SA 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 28:7" />Rampakaanamo sumai o Saul apogaumo tee manga pagawena, "Peeloakaaku samia bhawine pande kembana sumanga, mamudhaakana kulingka kupokawaakea tee kuabhaakea pokaiana tee opea tabeana bheipewauku."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:7">Manga pagawena alawani, "I Kota En-Dor dhaangia tee bhawine pande kembana sumanga."<verse eid="1SA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 28:8" />Kasiimpo o Saul apakemo pakea mosagaanana mamudhaakana inda dhaangia o mia momataua tee alingka apobhawa tee rua mia umane. Manga incia akawa i bhanuana bhawine pande kembana sumanga sumai wakutuuna amalo. Kasiimpo Saul apogaumo, "Pekilalaakaakumo alaloi potoloweana sumanga, tee ukembaakaakumo mia bheibhotoakaku sarona to ingkoo."<verse eid="1SA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 28:9" />Lawanina bhawine pande kembana sumanga sumai, "Atantumo ingkoo umataua ande o Raja Saul padhamo apadhencu manga bhawine pande kembana sumanga tee manga umane pande sihiri minaaka i Israel. Apokia ingkoo dhaangiapo uka ucoba to upacilakaaku tee upekamateaku?"<verse eid="1SA 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 28:10" />Kasiimpo o Saul aposumpa, pogauna, "Iaku kuposumpa to sarona KAWASANA OPU modhadhi, ingkoo inda bheakangkanaiko kahukumu rampaakanamo giu incia sii."<verse eid="1SA 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 28:11" />Sapadhana sumai aabhamo bhawine pande kembana sumanga sumai, "Sumangana incema bheikembaakaku to ingkoo?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:11">Lawanina Saul, "Kembaakaaku sumangana Nabii Samuel."<verse eid="1SA 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 28:12" />Wakutuuna bhisa bhawine sumai akamata Samuel, incia apekeemo tee apogau tee Saul, "Apokia ingkoo utipuaku? Ingkoo sii garaaka o Raja Saul!"<verse eid="1SA 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 28:13" />Lawanina Raja Saul, "Bholi umaeka! Opea buaka ikamatamu?" Bhawine sumai alawani, "Iaku kukamata sumanga atiumba minaaka i nuncana tana! Bhanguna atokamata mboomo kanjoli!"<verse eid="1SA 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 28:14" />Saul aabha, "Tuaapa o bhanguna?" Lawanina bhawine sumai, "Dhaangia samia mancuana motiumbana i aroaku, tee incia apake juba." Saul amataua ande isarongina sumai o Samuel, kasiimpo incia asuju tee o rouna atumpu i tana to adhawu horomati.<verse eid="1SA 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 28:15" />Sapadhana incia sumai apogaumo Samuel tee Saul, "Apokia ingkoo uganggoaku tee ukembaaku minaaka i nuncana koburuku?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 28:15">Lawanina Saul, "Iaku kubingu mpuu roonamo tantarana Filistin ahumbuniaku, sainamo Aulataʼala abholiakumo tee indamo alawaniaku, malape alaloi potoloweana manga nabii, atawa alaloi pongipiku. Rampaakanamo sumai iaku kuemani tee ingkoo, mamudhaakana upaumbaakaaku opea tabeana bheipewauku."<verse eid="1SA 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 28:16" />Kasiimpo apogaumo Samuel, "Opea o gunana ukembaaku sii-sii, sainamo KAWASANA OPU abholikomo tee amembalimo musumu? <verse eid="1SA 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 28:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:28">1Sam. 15:28</ref>. </char></note>KAWASANA OPU padhamo apewau opea ifirimaniakana alaloi potoloweaku. KAWASANA OPU padhamo aalea o pamarintamu minaaka i limamu tee adhawuakea to mia i salipumu siitumo o Daud. <verse eid="1SA 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 28:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 15:3-9">1Sam. 15:3-9</ref>. </char></note>Roonamo ingkoo inda utaʼati tee inda ubalasiaka pamuruna KAWASANA OPU to miana Amalek, sumaimo giumo incia sii bheipewauna KAWASANA OPU to ingkoo i eo sii. <verse eid="1SA 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 28:19" />Ingkoo tee lipuna Israel bheapasaraakaakakomiu KAWASANA OPU i limana tantarana Filistin. Naile ingkoo tee manga anamu umane bheupoose tee iaku <char style="add">i alamuna mia mate</char>. KAWASANA OPU uka bheapasaraakaaka tantarana Israel i nuncana limana tantarana Filistin."<verse eid="1SA 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 28:20" />Wakutuu incia sumai uka o Saul atobhata tee akotibu i tana, roonamo kaekana arango pogauna Samuel sumai. Kakaana bukuna Saul uka ailamo, roonamo saeo samalomo inda tee ikandena.<verse eid="1SA 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 28:21" />Bhawine pande kembana sumanga sumai apasari i Saul tee akamatea ande o Saul apaangka ngangarandana. Kasiimpo bhisa bhawine sii aabha, "Satotuuna iaku padhamo kuose opea ipogauakamu. Iaku padhamo kutaaka inyawaku tee kuperangoi opea ipogauakamu tee iaku. <verse eid="1SA 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 28:22" />Sii-sii kuemani mamudhaakana uperangoi opea ipogauakaku sii, ande amembali ukandepo saidhe o kinande ipatalaakaku sii, mamudhaakana dhaangia tee kakaana bukumu to upalausakaaka lingkaamu."<verse eid="1SA 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 28:23" />Maka o Saul amendeu tee apogau, "Iaku kumendeu kukande." Maka sapadhana apakisaaia manga pagawena tee bhawine sumai, sabutuna o Saul aosemo opea ipogauakana manga incia tee abhangumo minaaka i tana kasiimpo auncura i kolema.<verse eid="1SA 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 28:24" />Bhisa bhawine sumai alausaka asumbele sambaa anana sapi momalompo modhaangiana i kandana, tee incia uka alaa tarigu tee alausaka akusoa kasiimpo atunua apamembalia roti inda mokoragi. <verse eid="1SA 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 28:25" />Kasiimpo apatalamea o kinande sumai to Saul tee manga pagawena to akandea. Sapadhana sumai manga incia alingkamo i malo incia sumai uka.<verse eid="1SA 28:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1SA 29" />
  <para style="s1">Daud Inda Aundaakea Miana Filistin to Aose Apotimbe</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 29:1-11">29:1-11</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 29:1" />Miana Filistin aromusaka bhari-bharia suludaduna i Kota Afek, sainamo tantarana Israel apokema i saripina matana uwe i Mbolongana Yizreel. <verse eid="1SA 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 29:2" />Sumaimo manga raja mominaakana i manga kotana Filistin adhala abarisi i nuncana kolompona saatu suludadu tee sarewu suludadu. Daud tee manga ana buana uka adhala abarisi i taliku apoose tee Raja Akhis. <verse eid="1SA 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 29:3" />Kasiimpo apogaumo manga kapitana tantarana Filistin sumai, mboo sii, "Opea akarajaa manga suludaduna Ibrani sii?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 29:3">Lawanina Raja Akhis, "Siimo o Daud, bhatuana Saul rajana Israel momboorena tee iaku kangengena sii. Inda saangu kasalaha uka ipotibhaakaku kangengena incia iwe sii sakawana i eo sii."<verse eid="1SA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 29:4" />Maka manga kapitana tantarana Filistin sumai aʼamara tee Raja Akhis tee apogau, "Tumpua o mia incia itu ambuliaka i kota mopadhana idhawuakamu to incia, tee bholi alingka apotimbe apobhawa tee ingkita; ancosala amembali bhalita i nuncana potimbea! Roonamo giu incia sumai bheamembali kalalesana to aala incana rajana tee cara apekamate manga tantarata. <verse eid="1SA 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 29:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 18:7">1Sam. 18:7</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 21:11">21:11</ref>. </char></note>Buaka o mia incia sii o Daud, ilaguakana manga mia apoose amanari mboo sii,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1SA 29:5" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1SA 29:5">"Saul apekamate rewu-rewuna mia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1SA 29:5">maka o Daud pulu-puluna rewu mia."<verse eid="1SA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 29:6" />Kasiimpo Raja Akhis akemba Daud tee aabhakia, "Iaku kuposumpa to sarona KAWASANA OPU modhadhi, iaku kuparacaea ande ingkoo sii o mia mojujuru tee utaʼati tee iaku. Iaku bheamasanaa o ngangarandaku ande umembali upoose tee iaku i nuncana potimbea sii. Roonamo pepuu minaaka i umbaamu sakawana sii-sii, iaku inda kupotibhaaka saangu kasalahamu uka. Maka manga raja mosagaanana inda apeeluko. <verse eid="1SA 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 29:7" />Rampaakanamo sumai, mbulimo, lingkamo tee kasalaamati tee bholimo upewau giu iʼamaraakana manga raja mominaakana i manga kotana miana Filistin sumai."<verse eid="1SA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 29:8" />Maka o Daud alawani Raja Akhis, "E Opuku, kasalaha opea mopadhana ipewauku? Ingkoo inda upotibhaaka saangu kasalahaku uka mboomo ipogauakamu pepuu minaaka kulaianiko sakawana sii-sii. Maka apokia inda uundaakaaku to kupotimbe kupoewangi tee musumu?"<verse eid="1SA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 29:9" />Kasiimpo Raja Akhis alawani Daud, "Iaku kumataua; i mataku ingkoo sii umalape mboomo malaaʼekatina Aulataʼala. Maka manga kapitana tantarana Filistin sumai amambotuakako mamudhaakana inda amembali uose potimbea upobhawa tee ingkami. <verse eid="1SA 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 29:10" />Rampaakanamo sumai, naile saeona mpuu ingkoo tee bhari-bharia mia mopadhana mobholina Saul, tabeana umbulimo pekadhei i kota mopadhana idhawuakaku to ingkoo sabhetena matana eo."<verse eid="1SA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 29:11" />Sumaimo saeona mpuu o Daud tee manga ana buana ambulimo i lipuna Filistin, sainamo tantarana Filistin amajumo aporope i Mbolongana Yizreel.<verse eid="1SA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="1SA 30" />
  <para style="s1">Ziklag Amangau--Daud Abalasi tee Apekatalo Miana Amalek</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 30:1-25">30:1-25</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 30:1" />Talu eo sapadhana sumai, wakutuuna Daud tee manga ana buana akawa i Kota Ziklag, garaaka o miana Amalek padhamo ahumbuni Tana Negeb tee Ziklag. Manga incia apekatalo Ziklag tee atunua sakawana atopadha. <verse eid="1SA 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 30:2" />Manga incia uka ataangi manga bhawine tee bhari-bharia mia modhaangiana iwe sumai, siitumo minaaka i anaana sakawana i mancuana, maka inda samia uka ipekamatena. Bhari-bharia mia itaangina sumai abhawea apoose tee manga incia wakutuuna apalausaka lingkaana.<verse eid="1SA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 30:3" />Wakutuuna Daud tee manga ana buana akawa i kota incia sumai, manga incia akamatamo saangua kota sumai amangaumo. Bhawinena tee anana manga incia, malape umane atawa o bhawine atotaangimo. <verse eid="1SA 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 30:4" />Kasiimpo Daud tee manga ana buana mopobhawana tee incia atangimo pekakaa sampe akaʼusuʼusu. <verse eid="1SA 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 30:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 25:42-43">1Sam. 25:42-43</ref>. </char></note>Rua miaia bhawinena Daud atotaangi uka, siitumo Ahinoam miana Yizreel tee Abigail iaiarona Nabal miana Karmel sumai. <verse eid="1SA 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 30:6" />Manga ana buana Daud anarakaamo mpuu roonamo akailanga bhawinena tee manga anana manga incia. Rampaakanamo sumai manga incia ahaejati mamudhaakana o Daud atudhaakea tee bhatu. Tee mboo sumai o Daud adhaangia i nuncana karasai momaoge, maka o KAWASANA OPU apendua to apekatangkaaka ngangarandana Daud.<verse eid="1SA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 30:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">30:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 22:20-23">1Sam. 22:20-23</ref>. </char>
    </note>Kasiimpo apogaumo o Daud tee Imamu Abyatar bin Ahimelekh, "Bhawaakaaku bhaju efod iwe sii." Kasiimpo Abyatar abhawaakamea o bhaju efodna sumai. <verse eid="1SA 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 30:8" />Kasiimpo Daud aabha i KAWASANA OPU pokaiana tee opea tabeana bheipewauna, "Buaka manga gorombola sumai tabeana kupajerea? Buaka manga incia amembali kupotibhaakea?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:8">Lawanina KAWASANA OPU, "Umbe pajeremea, roonamo manga incia amembali ututunia tee amembaliaka upabebasi manga mia mototaangi."<verse eid="1SA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 30:9" />Sumaimo o Daud tee nama atu mia ana buana apajeremo manga gorombola sumai. Maka wakutuuna manga incia akawa i bhiwina Umala Besor, dhaangia rua atu mia minaaka i manga ana buana indamo amembali apalausaka lingkaana sabutuna manga incia ambooremo iwe sumai roonamo amangulemo mpuu. <verse eid="1SA 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 30:10" />Maka o Daud tee pata atu mia ana buana mosagaanana atorotorosu apalausaka lingkaana minaaka i Umala Besor to apajereaka manga gorombola sumai.<verse eid="1SA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 30:11" />I nuncana lingkaana manga incia apokawamo tee samia ana umane mominaakana i Mesir i saangu tana lapa. Sapadhana sumai, ana umane sii abhawamea i aroana Daud kasiimpo adhawuakea roti to akandea tee adhawuakea uka o uwe isumpu, <verse eid="1SA 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 30:12" />tee adhawuakea uka satumpo hole-holena ara tee rua kance bhakena angguru matuu. Sapadhana akande, incia amatangkamo pendua o bukuna roonamo dhaangiamo talu eo talu malo inda akande tee asumpu.<verse eid="1SA 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 30:13" />Kasiimpo Daud aabhaki ana umane sumai, "Miana opea ingkoo sii tee incema o opumu?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:13">Lawanina, "Iaku o ana umane mangura mominaakana i Mesir. Iaku o bhatuana miana Amalek. Maka o opuku abholiaku talu eo molapana itu roonamo kumapii. <verse eid="1SA 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1SA 30:14" />Talu eo molapana itu ingkami padhamo tahumbuni tampana mbooresana miana Kreti i Tana Negeb, kasiimpo i lipu tampana mbooresana miana Yehuda i Tana Negeb, tee uka i tampana mbooresana siwuluna Kaleb i Tana Negeb. Ingkami uka padhamo tahumbuni tee tatunu saangua Kota Ziklag."<verse eid="1SA 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1SA 30:15" />Daud aabhamo uka pendua, "Uunda ususuakaaku dhala to taporopeaka i tampana manga gorombola sumai?"</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 30:15">Lawanina, "Umbe, maka somanamo uposumpapo tee sarona KAWASANA OPU ande ingkoo inda bheupekamateaku tee uka inda bheupasaraakaaku i opuku."<verse eid="1SA 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1SA 30:16" />
    <char style="add">Daud uka asatujumo,</char> sabutuna o Daud tee ana buana aʼantaramea ana umane mominaakana i Mesir sumai i tampana gorombolana miana Amalek. Manga miana Amalek sumai apontalesaka tee tangasaana akokariaa akande tee asumpu roonamo manga incia abhari apotibhaaka bara irampasina minaaka i lipuna miana Filistin tee i Tana Yehuda. <verse eid="1SA 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1SA 30:17" />Kasiimpo Daud tee manga ana buana ahumbuni manga miana Amalek sii, minaaka i raneeo sakawana asoo matana eo. Inda dhaangia samia uka minaaka i gorombola sumai mosalaamatina, maka dhaangia pata atu mia ana umane mangura mopalaiakana karona tee asawiki untana. <verse eid="1SA 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1SA 30:18" />Daud aalea pendua bhari-bharia giu irampasina miana Amalek sumai, mboo sumai uka tee rua miaia bhawinena. <verse eid="1SA 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1SA 30:19" />Inda dhaangia mokurana, minaaka i anaana maidhiidhi sakawana i mancuana, malape o ana umane atawa o bhawine. Jadi o Daud amembali aala tee apambuli pendua opeapo uka mopadhana irampasina manga gorombola sumai. <verse eid="1SA 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1SA 30:20" />Daud uka arampasi bhari-bharia gulumana bhembe tee sapina miana Amalek. Kasiimpo manga kadhambaaka sumai awulua i aroana gulumana binata mosagaanana, tee apogau, "Siimo dhawuna Daud."<verse eid="1SA 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1SA 30:21" />Sapadhana sumai o Daud ambulimo pendua i tampana rua atu mia ana buana momangulena moosea tee ibholina i bhiwina Umala Besor sumai. Manga incia alingkamo to apepago Daud tee ana buana, tee o Daud asarimo manga incia to aabhaaka kadhaangiana manga incia. <verse eid="1SA 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1SA 30:22" />Maka dhaangia pia mia o ana buana Daud sii momadhakina feʼelina tee momadhakina pemingkuina, manga incia apogau, "Manga mia incia sii inda alingka apoose tee ingkita, jadi manga incia inda tee hakuna to apotibhaaka opeapo uka minaaka i bara irampasita pendua sii. Manga incia tangkanamo soo amembali aala bhawinena tee anana samia-samia kasiimpo alingka."<verse eid="1SA 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1SA 30:23" />Maka o Daud alawani, "E manga witinaiku, bholi upewau mboo itu tee opea mopadhana irahumatiakana KAWASANA OPU to ingkita! Roonamo Incia padhamo mangajagani tee apasaraakaakea i limata o gorombola mangahumbunina sumai. <verse eid="1SA 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1SA 30:24" />Jadi bholi dhaangia samia uka mosatujuina giu incia sumai! Bhari-bharikita bhetapotibhaaka dhawu mopokanana kabharina. Manga suludadu momboorena to mojaganina manga bara tabeana apotibhaaka uka dhawu mopokana tee manga suludadu molingkana mopotimbe." <verse eid="1SA 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1SA 30:25" />Jadi o giu incia sumai apamembalia Daud amembali saangu katotapu apepuu minaaka i eo incia sumai tee apakea miana Israel sakawana sii-sii.<verse eid="1SA 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Daud Adhawuaka Hadia to Manga Mancuana i Tana Yehuda</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 30:26-31">30:26-31</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1SA 30:26" />Wakutuuna Daud ambuli pendua i Kota Ziklag, incia alamboko sagaa manga bara irampasina minaaka i hasilina potimbea to manga mancuana i Tana Yehuda, siitumo to manga sabhangkana, tee aposamea, "Siimo dhawumu minaaka i hasilina bara irampasi i potimbea tee aminaaka i manga musuna KAWASANA OPU."<verse eid="1SA 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1SA 30:27" />Daud alambokoakea uka to manga mia momboorena i Bait-El, i Ramot i Tana Negeb, i Yatir, <verse eid="1SA 30:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1SA 30:28" />i Aroʼer, i Sifmot, i Eshtemoa, <verse eid="1SA 30:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1SA 30:29" />i Rakhal, i kota-kotana miana Yerahmeel, i kota-kotana miana Keni, <verse eid="1SA 30:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1SA 30:30" />to mia i Horma, i Bor-Asan, i Atakh, <verse eid="1SA 30:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1SA 30:31" />to mia i Kota Hebron tee bhari-bharia tampa mopadhana ilaloina Daud tee manga ana buana.<verse eid="1SA 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="1SA 31" />
  <para style="s">Matena Raja Saul tee Manga Ana Umanena</para>
  <para style="sr">
    <ref loc="1SA 31:1-13">31:1-13</ref>
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1SA 31:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">31:1-13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 10:1-12">1Taw. 10:1-12</ref>. </char>
    </note>Wakutuu incia sumai o tantarana Filistin apotimbe tee tantarana Israel. Tantarana Israel apalaiaka karona minaaka i tantarana Filistin tee abhari momatena i Gunu Gilboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1SA 31:2" />Kasiimpo tantarana Filistin apajere Raja Saul tee manga anana. Manga incia apekamate Yonatan, Abinadab, tee Malkisua. <verse eid="1SA 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1SA 31:3" />Tee o Saul adhaangia i tanga-tangana potimbea ogena sumai. Saul akamatamea manga pande panana miana Filistin, sumaimo incia atopana sabutuna amaoge mpuu o kambelana.<verse eid="1SA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1SA 31:4" />Kasiimpo Saul apogau tee pande kenina ewangana, "Hobutimea o hancumu tee utobhokiakumo, mamudhaakana inda amagamagasiaakaaku tee apekamateaku manga mia inda mototandaki sumai."</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1SA 31:4">Maka o pande kenina ewangana sumai amendeu atobhokia, roonamo amaeka mpuu. Sumaimo o Saul aalamo hancuna karona kasiimpo apakotibu karona i bhawona hancu sumai. <verse eid="1SA 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1SA 31:5" />Wakutuuna pande kenina ewanga sumai akamatea ande o Saul amatemo, incia uka apakotibumo karona i bhawona hancuna, sabutuna incia amate aposari tee Saul. <verse eid="1SA 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1SA 31:6" />Mboomo sumai o Raja Saul tee talu miaia anana, pande kenina ewangana tee bhari-bharia ana buana amate i eo incia sumai uka.<verse eid="1SA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1SA 31:7" />Wakutuuna manga miana Israel momboorena i sawetana Mbolongana Yizreel tee i sawetana timbuna Umala Yordan arango ande o tantarana Israel apalaiakamo karona, tee o Saul tee manga anana amatemo, manga incia apalaiakamo uka karona tee abholi manga kotana. Kasiimpo aumbamo miana Filistin to ambooresi manga kota incia sumai.<verse eid="1SA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1SA 31:8" />Saeo sapadhana incia sumai, wakutuuna miana Filistin aumba to arampasi barana manga mia momate, manga incia apotibhaaka uka maeatina Saul tee talu miaia anana i Gunu Gilboa. <verse eid="1SA 31:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1SA 31:9" />Manga incia atumpo bhaana Saul, aala ewangana tee katangkesina, kasiimpo atumpumo potumpuana to atiingi tanana Filistin to apakawaaka lele incia sumai i tampana barahalana manga incia tee i raʼeati. <verse eid="1SA 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1SA 31:10" />Manga incia adhika manga ewangana Saul i nuncana tampana barahalana dewi Astoret, kasiimpo maeatina Saul apasoa i rindina Kotana Bait-Sean.<verse eid="1SA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1SA 31:11" />Wakutuuna manga miana Yabes modhaangiana i Gilead arango opea mopadhana ipewauna miana Filistin tee Saul, <verse eid="1SA 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1SA 31:12" />sumaimo bhari-bharia hiri alingka i Bait-Sean; manga incia samaloa inda aunto adhala ae minaaka i lingkaana. Tee sakawana iwe sumai, manga hirina Yabes aalamo tee apasapomo maeatina Saul tee manga anana minaaka i rindina kota sumai tee apambulia i Yabes kasiimpo atunua. <verse eid="1SA 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1SA 31:13" />Bhari-bharia bukuna aromusakea tee akoburua i tambena puuna tamariska i Kota Yabes sumai, kasiimpo manga incia apoasa kangengena pitu eo.<verse eid="1SA 31:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1SA 31" />
</usx>